<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अऋणिन्
अऋणिन् a. (ऋ being regarded as
a consonant) Not a debtor, free from
debt; दिवसस्याष्टमे भागे शाकं पचति यो
नरः । अऋणी चाप्रवासी च स वारिचर
मोदते ॥ Mb. The form अनृणिन् also
occurs in this sense.
