अंहु
अंहु a. [अंह् मृग˚ कु] Ved. Sinful,
wicked, injurious (पापकारिन्,
हननशील;) strait, narrow (?)
--हु n.
1 Anxiety, distress; sin, crime (?).
--2
Pudendum Muliebre (?). [cf. L.
angustus, anxius; Goth. aggvus].
--भेद --दी having a narrow slit;
having the pudendum divided (?).
