अक्षम a. [न. त.]
1 Unfit,
incompetent, unable; कार्य, ˚पलायन˚, उपवास˚
&c.
--2 Unable to bear or endure,
not forbearing, non-forbearing;
impatient; ˚मा कालहरणस्य Ś. 3
unable to brook delay, admitting of
no delay; मामक्षमं मंडनकालहानेः
R. 13. 16.
