अग्राह्य|अग्राह्यं
अग्राह्य a. Not acceptable, that
which ought not to be taken or
accepted as a gift, present &c.; ˚ह्यं
शिवनिर्माल्यं पत्रं पुष्पं फलं जलं; not to
be perceived, admitted or trusted;
not to be considered or taken into
account.
