about (with loc.); roam over
(sometimes with acc.); भो बटो भिक्षामट Sk.
go to beg alms; आट नैकटिकाश्रमान्
Bk. 4. 12; महीमटन् Dk. 38 --desid. अटिटिषति;
--freq. अटाट्यते to wander about
habitually, as a religious mendicant.
