1 The point of a needle.
--2 A
linchpin, the pin or bolt at the end of a
pole of carriage.
--3 A limit.
--4 The
corner of a house (used for killing
animals &c.).
--Comp.
--मांडव्यः [
अण्या चिह्नितो मांडव्यः] N. of a sage said
