अतिपत्
अतिपत् {c1c} P.
1 To pass over;
neglect, omit, transgress.
--2 To fly by,
beyond, or over; to cross --Caus.
1 To
delay, neglect; see अतिपात्य below.
--2
To disrespect, offend; ये सत्यमेव हि
गुरूनतिपातयंति Mu. 3. 34 transgress,
violate; अतिपातितकालसाधना Ki. 2. 42.
--3 To cause to fly past or by.
--4 To
make ineffectual; संशमनमेवं
संशोधनमतिपातयति Suśr.
--5 To snatch
away, drag away.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0032-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
