Befalling, occurrence;
दुःखातिपातेन कलुषीकियंते K. 289;
जलधारातिपातः 302 falling.
--4 Ill-treatment, or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0032-b" target="_blank">Page0032-b+ 59</a>]
usage.
--5 Opposition, contrariety.
