अदर्शनं
1 Not seeing, non-vision;
absence, not being seen;
तमाहितौत्सुक्यमदर्शनेन R. 2. 73; अंतर्धौ
येनादर्शनमिच्छति P. I. 4. 28 the person whose
sight one wishes to avoid; ˚नं गतः
Pt. 2; ˚नीभूतः Pt. 1 become invisible;
अस्य ˚नं गत्वा Pt. 2 going out of his
sight, beyond the reach of vision;
सा चात्यंतमदर्शनं नयनयोर्याता V. 4. 2
lost to view, become invisible.
--2
