<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यतन|अद्यतनः
अद्यतन a. (नी f.) [अद्य भवः; अद्य ट्यु
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0043-a" target="_blank">Page0043-a+ 57</a>]
तुडागमश्च]
1 Pertaining or referring
to, extending over, to-day; ˚दिवस,
˚काल &c.
--2 Current now-a-days,
prevalent at present, modern.
--नः
The current or this day, period of
the current day (Kāśi. on P. I. 2. 57);
See अनद्यतन also.
--नी (scil. वृत्तिः) A
name given to the Aorist tense, as
it denotes an action done to-day or
on the same day (= ˚भूतः).
