अधिरुक्म
अधिरुक्म a. [अधिगतं रुक्मं आभरणं
येन] Having ornaments (of gold &c.).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिरुह्
अधिरुह् {c1c} P.
1 To ascend, mount
(a throne, hill &c.); go up to, find
access to, sit in or on (acc.);
पादाहतंयदुत्थाय मूर्द्धानमधिरोहति Śi. 2. 46;
पुराधिरूढः शयनं महाधनं Ki. 1. 38. lying
on; तुरगाधिरूढं R. 7. 37 riding a
horse; 12. 104; बंधुजनाधिरूढैर्गजानां
वृंदैः Ku. 7. 52 mounted or seated
on; योगाधिरूढाः R. 13. 52; engaged or
lost in contemplation; so Pt. 1;
सद्यः परस्परतुलामधिरोहतां द्वे R. 5. 68
bear or acquire; प्रतिज्ञां˚ enter on;
कीर्तिर्द्यामधिरोहति Śi. 2. 52.;
सर्वमनोरथानामग्रमिवाधिरूढा K. 158 mounted on
the summit or pinnacle; त्वां धूरियं
योग्यतयाधिरूढा Ki. 3. 50 this
responsibility lies on your shoulders.
--2 To
string; अधिरोहति गांडीवं महेषौ
Ki. 13. 16.
--3 (Intran.) To rise or grow over
or above. --Caus. [रोह -(प) यति]
1 To raise, place, seat, cause to
mount or ascend; ताः स्वमंकमधिरोप्य
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0049-c" target="_blank">Page0049-c+ 57</a>]
R. 19. 44 having placed or seated;
Śi. 12. 46.
--2 To restore, give back;
पुराणशोभामधिरोपितायां (वसतौ)
R. 16. 42 restored to its former grandeur.
--3 To string (as a bow); कार्मुकं च
बलिनाधिरोपितम् R. 11. 81.
--4 To give,
confer &c.; उदारक इति
प्रीतलोकाधिरोपितापरश्लाध्यनामनि Dk. 50.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिरुह्
अधिरुह् a. (At the end of comp.)
Growing on; धरणिरुहाधिरुहो लतायाः
Śi. 7. 46.
