अधिवस्
अधिवस् {c1c} P.
1 To inhabit, fix one's
abode or residence in, settle, dwell
or reside in (with acc. of place);
गिरिमधिवसेस्तत्र विश्रामहेतोः Me. 25;
यानि प्रियासहचरश्चिरमध्यवात्सं U. 3. 8;
बाल्यात्परामिव दशां मदनोध्युवास
R. 5. 63; 11. 61; 13. 79; Śi. 3. 59; Bk. 5. 6;
1. 3; 8. 79.
--2 To settle, alight or
perch on.
--3 ({c2c} A.) To put on (clothes).
--Caus.
1 To cause to stay overnight.
--2 To consecrate, set up (as an image).
