अधिवासनं|अधिवासन
अधिवासनं [वस्-णिच्, or
--वास् ल्युट्.]
1
Scenting with perfumes or odorous
substances (संस्कारो गंधमाल्याद्यैः Ak.).
--2
[वस्-णिच्-ल्युट्] Preliminary
consecration (प्रतिष्ठा) of an image, its
invocation and worship by suitable
Mantras &c. before the commencement of
a sacrifice; (यज्ञारंभात्प्राक् देवताद्यावाहनपूर्वकः
पूजनादिकर्मभेदः); making a divinity
assume its abode in an image.
