<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीत|अधीतः
अधीत p. p. Learnt, studied, read,
remembered, attained &c.
--Comp.
--विद्य a. who has studied the Vedas
or finished his studies.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीतिः|अधीति
अधीतिः f. [इ-क्तिन्]
1 Study,
perusal; ˚बोधाचरणप्रचारणैः N. 1. 4.
--2
Remembrance, recollection.
