अधीर|अधीरः
अधीर a.
1 Not bold, timid.
--2
Confused, lacking self-command,
excited, excitable.
--3 Fitful, capricious.
--4 Unsteady, not fixed, tremulous,
rolling; ˚विप्रेक्षितमायताक्ष्या
Ku. 1. 46; ˚लोचनः Śi. 1. 53; 6. 25.
--5
Querulous, foolish, weak-minded.
--रा
1 Lightning.
--2 A capricious or
quarrelsome mistress; see under नायिका.
