अनंश
अनंश a. [न. ब.]
1 Not entitled to
a share in the inheritance; ˚शौ
क्लीबपतितौ जात्यंधबधिरौ तथा ।
उन्मत्तजडमूकाश्च ये च केचिन्निरिंद्रियाः ॥ Ms. 9. 201.
Other persons are also mentioned
by Devala, Baudhāyana, Kātyāyana
and Nārada.
--2 Without parts,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0055-a" target="_blank">Page0055-a+ 56</a>]
undivided, portionless; an epithet
of the sky or the Supreme Being.
