अनुधाव्
अनुधाव् {c1c} P.
1 To run after;
follow; ऋषीणां पुनराद्यानां वाचमर्थोऽ
नुधावति U. 1. 10 the sense follows the
words (the words being not
uttered with a view to a particular sense);
स्वरुचिं निश्चयतोऽनुधावति Śi. 16. 44
follows his own will.
--2 To run up
to, approach.
--3 To cleanse, wash.
