अनुधावनं
1 Going or running after,
following, pursuing; तुरग ˚कंडितसंधेः
Ś. 2.
--2 Close pursuit of an object
(for the knowledge of truth);
research, investigation.
--3 Seeking a
mistress, though unattainable.
--4
Cleansing, purification.
