अनुपतनं|अनुपतन
अनुपतनं, पातः
1 Falling upon,
alighting upon in succession.
--2
Following, going after, pursuit;
उपवनपवनानुपातदक्षैः Śi. 7. 27.
--3 Going or
proceeding in order or as a
consequence.
--4 [अनुरूपः त्रैराशिकेन पातः]
Proportion.
--5 Rule of three.
--6 A
degree of latitude, opposite to one
given.
--तं ind. (regarded as a ṇamul
from पत्) Following in succession,
going after; लतानुपातं कुसुमान्यगृह्णात्
Bk. 2. 11 (लतां लतामनुपात्य going to
creeper after creeper, or after
bending the creepers).
