अनुपलब्धिः|अनुपलब्धि
अनुपलब्धिः f. Non-recognition,
non-perception (प्रत्यक्षाद्यभाव);
नास्ति घटोऽनुपलब्धेः the knowledge of
घटाभाव is possible because the
प्रतियोगी or counter-entity is not found
with the non-entity or अभाव (that
is, there being no उपलब्धि or
knowledge of the घट); one of the
instruments of knowledge according to the
Mīmāṃsakas, but not according to
the Naiyāyikas.
--Comp.
--समः a
fallacy, trying to establish a fact
(say, the eternity of sound) from
the impossibility of seeing the
nonperception of it.
