अनुमा
अनुमा [मा-अङ्] Inference,
conclusion from given premises; see
अनुमिति.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0077-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमातृ
अनुमातृ a. One who infers; न हि
करिणि दृष्टे चीत्कारेण तमनुमिमतेऽनुमातारः.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0077-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमानं|अनुमान
अनुमानं
1 Inferring as the
instrument of an अनुमिति, conclusion from
given premises; an inference,
conclusion; one of the four means of
obtaining knowledge according to the
Nyāya system; (अनुमितिकरणमनुमानं तच्च
धूमो वह्निव्याप्य इति व्याप्तिज्ञानं. It is of two
kinds स्वार्थानुमानं & परार्थानुमानं); प्रत्यक्षं
चानुमानं च शास्त्रं च विविधागमं । त्रयं
सुविदितं कार्यं धर्मशुद्धिमभीप्सता ॥
Ms. 12. 105.
--2 A guess, conjecture, sign to
know; इंगितैरनुमानैश्च मया ज्ञेया भविष्यति
Rām.
--3 Analogy, similarity; आत्मनो
हृदयानुमानेन प्रेक्षसे Ś. 5 you judge (of
others) by the analogy of your own
heart; स्वानुमानात्कादंबरीमुत्प्रेक्ष्य
K. 305.
--4 (In Rhet.) A figure which
consists in a notion, expressed
in a peculiarly striking manner,
of a thing established by proof;
S. D. 711; यत्र पतत्यबलानां दृष्टिर्निशिताः
पतंति तत्र शराः । तच्चापरोपितशरो धावत्यासां
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0077-c" target="_blank">Page0077-c+ 56</a>]
पुरः स्मरो मन्ये ॥ अनुमानं तदुक्तं
यत्साध्यसाधनयोर्वचः K. P. 10.
--Comp.
--उक्ति f.
reasoning; logical inference.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0077-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

