<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयुक्त|अनुयुक्तः
अनुयुक्त p. p.
1 Asked,
questioned, examined, ordered &c.
--2
Censured, reproached.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0078-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयुक्तिन्
अनुयुक्तिन् a. [अस्त्यर्थे इनि] One
who has ordered, examined; cf.
गृहीतिन्, अधीतिन्.
