अनुयोक्तृ
अनुयोक्तृ m. An examiner,
interrogator; inquirer; a teacher,
especially hired or mercenary (भृतकाध्यापक).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0078-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
