अनुव्रज्
अनुव्रज् {c1c} P.
1 To follow, go after;
तां व्रजंतीमनुवव्राज K. 132, 210; attend
especially a departing guest (as far
as the bank of water, lake, &c.) as
a mark of respect; Y. 1. 113; तं
मातरो देवमनुव्रजंत्यः Ku. 7. 38;
यमिच्छेत्पुनरायांतं नैनं दूरमनुव्रजेत् Rām.
--2 To visit
in order, seek.
--3 To go to or near;
betake oneself to; मृगा मृगैः
संगमनुव्रजंति Pt. 1 deer herd or associate
with deer.
--4 To obey, to do
homage to.
