अनुसंधा|अनुसन्धा
अनुसंधा {c3c} U.
1 To search into
or after, look after, inquire into,
investigate, explore, examine,
ascertain; प्रसवयोग्यं स्थानमनुसंधीयतां
H. 3; Ms. 12. 106.
--2 To calm,
compose, quiet; आत्मानमनुसंधेहि
शोकचर्चां च परिहर H. 4.
--3 To think of,
aim at, refer or allude to, consider,
deliberate; यथाकर्तव्यमनुसंधयितां
H. 3; नैतदनुसंधाय मयोक्तं Mv. 6 after
deliberation, or because I aimed at
it; अलमनेनातीतोपालंभेन
प्रस्तुतमनुसंधीयतां H. 3 let us consider what is
before us, (turn to the matter in
hand); अत्र… इति पुरावृत्तकथानुऽ
संधेया Malli. on Ku. 1. 21 should be
sought or referred to.
--4 To plan,
arrange; prepare, set in order;
सारसत्वं दुर्गमनुसंधेहि, दुर्गशोधनमनुसंधातव्यं
H. 3.
--5 To follow, go after, attend,
accompany; चरेण अनुसंधीयमानः
Mu. 6; कस्ते निर्बंधः पदे पदे मामनुसंधातुं
Mk. 1; एतौ तौ मामनुसंधत्तः Mk. 2 are
after me.
--6 To take up, follow,
continue; तच्छेषमात्मवचसाप्यऽनुसंदधानः
K. 240 following, making up the
unfinished portion &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

