अनृतुः|अनृतु
अनृतुः [न. त.]
1 Unfit season,
improper or premature time; अनृतौ
चाभ्रदर्शने Ms. 4. 104.
--2 Time before
menstruation.
--Comp.
--कन्या a girl
before menstruation.
