अंति|अन्ति|अन्तिः
अंति ind. [अंत्-इ] Ved.
1 Near,
before, in the presence of; न
ही नु वो मरुतो अंत्यस्मे Rv. 1. 167. 9;
1. 79. 11.
--2 (Prep.) To, in the
vicinity of (with gen.);
मुग्धप्रभीतवदुपेयतुरंति मात्रोः Bhāg.
--तिः f. An
elder sister (in dramas).
--Comp.
--ऊति a. ready with help. (--तिः f.)
protection of what is near (आसन्नरक्षण)
Rv. 1. 138. 1.
--गृहं a house near one's
own dwelling, the neighbourhood
of the house.
--देव a. being near the
god; an adversary (at dice);
Rv. 1. 180. 7.
--मित्र, --वाम, --षुम्ण a. near or
at hand with help, wealth, or
kindness; अंतिवामा दूरे Rv. 7. 77. 4 (
निकटस्थधना).
