<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्वाधेयं|अन्वाधेय
अन्वाधेयं --यकं A sort of स्त्रीधन or
woman's property, presented to her
after marriage by her husband's
or father's family, or by her own
relatives; विवाहात्परतो यच्च लब्धं
भर्तृकुलात्स्त्रिया । अन्वाधेयं तु तद्द्रव्यं लब्धं पितृ- (v. l.
बंधु-) कुलात्तथा ॥ Kāty. quoted by
Kull. on Ms. 9. 195; Y. 2. 144.
