<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकर्षक
अपकर्षक a.
1 Drawing or taking
off or down, removing.
--2
Lessening, diminishing, detracting from;
दोषास्तस्य (काव्यस्य) अपकर्षकाः S. D. 1.
