अपचि
अपचि {c3c} P.
1 To honour, respect.
--2 To invite respectfully.
--3 ({c5c} U.)
To gather, collect. --pass.
1 To be
reduced in strength or bulk, sink,
waste away; अपचितमपि गात्रं
व्यायतत्वादलक्ष्यं Ś. 2. 9 reduced in bulk,
emaciated, lean; to wane, decline,
diminish, grow less; राजहंस तव सैव
शुभ्रता चीयते न च न चापचीयते K. P. 10.
--2 To fall away from, be deprived
of, lose (with abl.) प्रकृतिः सूयते
तद्वदानंत्यान्नापचीयते Mb.
