अपमृत्युः|अपमृत्यु
अपमृत्युः [अपकृष्टो दुष्टहेतुजन्यत्वेन मृत्युः]
1 Sudden or untimely death,
accidental or unnatural death;
भर्तृसक्तोऽपमृत्युस्तस्य संचरति Pt. 4.
--2
Any great danger, illness &c. from
which a person, hopelessly given up
for lost, recovers, quite contrary to
expectation.
