<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्जनं|अपवर्जन|अपवर्ज्जन|अपवर्ज्जनं
अपवर्जनं
1 Leaving, abandonment;
making good, fulfilling (a promise);
discharging (debt &c.).
--2 A gift
or donation; spending.
--3 Final
beatitude, salvation.
