अपवृत्
अपवृत् {c1c} A. To turn back, turn
away, depart; तस्मादपावर्तत दूरकृष्टा
R. 6. 58; तस्मादपावर्तत कुंडिनेशः 7. 33.
--Caus.
1 To turn back or away, turn
aside, bend; व्यपोढपार्श्वैरपवर्तितत्रिकाः
Ki. 4. 15; आसक्ततिर्यगपवर्तितदृष्टि
वक्त्रं (वहंती) Māl. 1. 40.
--2 (Math.)
To divide (as by a common measure)
without remainder; समेन केनाप्यपवर्त्य
हारभाज्यौ भजेद्वा सति संभवे तु Līlā.
--3 To reduce to a common measure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0112-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्तः|अपवर्त|अपवर्त्त
अपवर्तः
1 Taking away, removing.
--2 (Math.) The (common)
divisor which is applied to both or
either of the quantities of an
equation.
--3 Reduction to a common
measure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0112-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

