अपवर्तनं|अपवर्तन|अपवर्त्तन
अपवर्तनं
1 Removal, transferring
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0112-c" target="_blank">Page0112-c+ 57</a>]
from one place to another; स्थान˚.
--2
Taking away, depriving one of; न
त्यागोस्ति द्विषंत्याश्च न च दायापवर्तनं
Ms. 9. 79.
--3 Abridging, abbreviation.
--4
Reducing a fraction to its lowest terms;
division without remainder, or the
divisor itself.
