अपवृत्त
अपवृत्त p. p.
1 Turned away,
reversed, inverted, overturned;
agitated, disturbed; ˚जठरशफरी
Ki. 12. 49.
--2 With downward face;
व्याकीर्णस्फुरदपवृत्तरुंडखंडः Māl. 3. 17.
--3
Ended, finished.
--त्तं The ecliptic.
