अपसव्य|अपसव्यं|अपसव्यः
अपसव्य, --सव्यक a.
1 Not on the
left, right; अपसव्येन हस्तेन Ms. 3. 214.
--2 Contrary, opposite.
--व्यं ind.
To the right, making the sacred
thread hang down towards the left
part of the body over the right
shoulder (opp. सव्यं when it hangs
over the left); a position of the
thread in Śrāddha or other religious
ceremonies at particular times of
those ceremonies (the three
positions being सव्य, निवीत & अपसव्य)
Ms. 3. 279; ˚व्यं कृ to go round one
so as to keep the right side towards
him; to make the sacred thread
hang over the right shoulder.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0113-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

