अपहस्तः|अपहस्त
अपहस्तः [अपसारणार्थो हस्तः]
1
The hand placed on the neck to
drive out a person (गलहस्त); one
that is so driven out.
--2 Throwing
away or off, taking away.
--3
Stealing, plundering.
