अपहारः|अपहार
अपहारः
1 Taking or carrying away,
stealing, plundering, removing,
killing, destroying; कर्णनासापहारेण
भगिनी मे विरूपिता Rām. by the cutting
of ears and nose; निद्रापहार, विष˚.
--2 Concealing, dissembling;
कथमात्मापहारं करोमि Ś. 1 how shall I
dissemble myself, conceal my real
name and character; see अपहारक
below.
--3 Spending or using
another's property.
--4 Loss, damage.
