<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपह्नु
अपह्नु {c2c} A.
1 To conceal, hide,
disguise; Ms. 8. 53; कामदेवव्यपदेशेन
सखीपुरतोऽपह्नुतः Ratn. 2 was passed
off as Cupid upon her friend.
--2 To
deny, disown; गुणांश्चापह्नुषेऽस्माकं
Bk. 5. 44; अपह्नुवानस्य जनाय यन्निजां
(अधीरतां) N. 1. 49.
--3 To exculpate,
excuse.
