अपह्नवः|अपह्नव
अपह्नवः
1 Concealment, hiding;
concealment of one's knowledge,
feelings &c.
--2 Denial or disowning
of the truth, dissimulation; ˚वे ज्ञः
P. I. 3. 44; ज्ञातं मया ते हृदयं सखे मापह्नवं
कृथाः Ks. 10. 92.
--3 Appeasing,
satisfying.
--4 Love, affection.
