अपार|अपारं|अपारः
अपार a.
1 Shoreless.
--2
Boundless, unbounded, unlimited;
अपारस्याप्रमेयस्य परं पारमुपाश्रिते Rām.
unfathomable, of great length.
--3
Inexhaustible, immense, great (अधिक);
Rv. 5. 87. 6.
--4 Out of reach.
--5
Difficult to be crossed; difficult to be
surmounted or overcome (as an
enemy); रावणश्च महाशत्रुरपारः
प्रतिभाति मे । Rām.
--रं
1 A kind of
mental satisfaction or acquiescence; or,
reverse of mental acquiescence,
nonacquiescence.
--2 The opposite bank
of a river.
--रा The earth.
