--अन्वय a. not
returning; dead.
--आदानं not taking
back or again.
--आवृत्तिः f.
‘nonreturn’, exemption of the soul from
further transmigration, final
beatitude.
--प्राप्य a. irrecoverable.
--भवः
{1} not being born again (of diseases
also). {2} final beatitude. {3}
knowledge of the Supreme Soul which
tends to this step. {4} a person
released from metempsychosis.
