मुख्यानुपकारिन्), regarded as one of the
arthadoshas (faults of the sense or
meaning); as in the instance given
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0118-c" target="_blank">Page0118-c+ 56</a>]
under S. D. 576 विलोक्य वितते व्योम्नि
विधुं मुंच रुषंप्रिये, the adjective वितत
‘expanded,’ as applied, to the sky, does
not in any way help the cessation of
anger and is, therefore, irrelevant.
