अप्सु
अप्सु a. [नास्ति प्सु रूपं यस्य Nir.]
1
Formless, shapeless.
--2 Not beautiful.
Note
--अप्सु forms the first member
of several compounds.
--क्षित् a god.
--चर a. aquatic; moving in waters.
--ज, --जा a. born in the waters or
in the atmosphere. (--जाः) --योनिः
{1} a horse. {2} a cane or reed.
--जित् vanquishing the aerial Asuras.
--मत् a. possessed of what is in water;
not losing one's nature in water (as
lightning); getting sufficient water.
