--द्वीपा {1} the
earth. {2} a portion of land
surrounded by the ocean.
--नगरी N. of
Dvārakā, the capital of Kṛṣṇa.
--नवनीतकः the moon (the butter of
the ocean).
--मंडूकी the pearl-oyster.
