--3 To receive, (as a guest).
--4 To
fold, lay or bring together (as the
hands).
--5 To set, show or bring
forth (as blossom, fruit &c.). --Caus.
To catch or surprise one in the
very act, to let oneself be so caught;
अर्यवर्यस्य कस्यचिद् गृहे चोरयित्वा
रूपाभिग्रहितो बद्धः Dk. 96.
