अभिचक्ष्
अभिचक्ष् {c2c} A.
1 To look at, view,
perceive, see; अभि यो विश्वा भुवनानि
चष्टे (सूर्यः) Rv. 7. 61. 1.
--2 To call
to or address.
--3 Toaddress sharply,
to assail with sharp words
Rv. 7. 104. 8.
--4 To name, call.
--5 To
look graciously upon, 5. 3. .9.
