अभिचारः|अभिचार
अभिचारः
1 Exorcising, enchanting
employment of magical spells for
malevolent purposes; magic itself
(being regarded as one of the
Upapātakas or minor sins); अभिचारेषु
सर्वेषु कर्तव्यो द्विशतो दमः Ms. 9. 290;
11. 64, 198; K. 109; Mv. 1. 62.
--2 Killing.
--Comp.
--कल्पः N. of
a work on incantations
regarded as part of the Atharvaveda.
--ज्वरः a fever caused by magical
spells.
--मंत्रः a magical formula,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0128-c" target="_blank">Page0128-c+ 56</a>]
an incantation or formula for
working a charm; Śi. 7. 58.
--यज्ञः, --होमः
a sacrifice made for magical purposes.
