अभिज्ञा
अभिज्ञा {c9c} U.
1 To recognize,
discern; (सा) नाभ्यजानान्नलं नृपं Mb.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0129-b" target="_blank">Page0129-b+ 58</a>]
--2 To know, understand, be
acquainted with, be aware of,
perceive; अहं हि नाभिजानामि भवेदेवं न
वेति वा Mb.; Bg. 18. 55, 4. 14; 7. 13;
भवदभिज्ञातं कथयतु Dk. 3, 78.
--3 To
look upon, consider or regard as,
know to be.
--4 To admit, own,
acknowledge; नपुत्रमभिजानामि त्वयि जातं
Mb.
--5 To remember, recollect;
used with the Future instead of the
Imperfect, Imperfect with यत्, or both
when interdependence of two actions
is denoted, P. III. 2. 112, 114; cf.
Bk. 6. 138, 139.
