अभिन्न
अभिन्न a.
1 Not broken or cut,
unbroken; not split; अभिन्नपुटोत्तरान्
R. 17. 12.
--2 Unaffected;
क्लेशलेशैरभिन्नं Ś. 2. 4.
--3 Not changed or
altered, unchanged; ˚गतयः Ś. 1. 14
with their gait unchanged.
--4 Not
different from, the same, identical
(with abl.);
जगन्मिथोभिन्नमभिन्नमीश्वरात् Prab.
--5 Undivided, whole,
one (as number).
--6 Holding
together, continuous.
