अभिमन्
अभिमन् {c4c} A. (P. epic)
1 To wish
or desire, long for, covet, like; न
त्वेवं ज्यायसीं वृत्तिमभिमन्येत कर्हिचित्
Ms. 10. 95; see अभिमत below.
--2
To assent to, approve of, allow,
admit; give a grant (to any one, dat.).
--3 To think, fancy, imagine,
consider, believe, regard;
तामार्यामसावन्यथाऽभ्यमन्यत Dk. 164; Bk. 5. 71,
U. 5.
--4 To injure, threaten (Ved.)
--5
({c8c} A.) To think of self.
