अभिया
अभिया {c2c} P.
1 To go up to,
approach, go or repair to; अभिययौ स
हिमाचलमुच्छ्रितं Ki. 5. 1; R. 9. 27.
--2
To come or draw near (without an
object); come (as time).
--3 To march
against, attack, assail, encounter;
कुबेरादभियास्यमानात् R. 5. 30; Dk. 30.
--4 To give or resign oneself to,
devote, attach or betake oneself to.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">Page0136-a+ 57</a>]
--5 To partake or share in, get,
obtain. --Caus. To send away.
