अभियोक्तृ
अभियोक्तृ a. Assailing, attacking,
accusing. --m. (क्ता)
1 An enemy,
assailant, invader; त्वय्युत्कृष्टबलेऽ
भियोक्तरि नृपे Mu. 4. 15; H. 3. 93.
--2 (In law) A complainant,
plaintiff, accuser, prosecutor; Ms. 8. 52,
58; Y. 2. 95.
--3 A pretender,
claimant; a stronger party.
