<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवादः|अभिवाद
अभिवादः, --वादनं
1 Reverential
salutation, respectful obeisance,
salutation of a superior or elder by an
inferior or junior, or of a teacher
by his disciple. It consists in (1)
rising from one's seat (प्रत्युत्त्थान),
(2) seizing the feet (पादोपसंग्रह), and
(3) repeating the form of
salutation (अभिवाद) which includes the
name or title of the person
addressed, followed by the
mention of the person's own name.
For the different ways of
performing obeisance and the merit arising
therefrom see Ms. 2. 120-126.
--2 Abuse, insulting or scurrilous
speech (for अतिवाद).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

