अभिषेणयति Den. P. [अभिसेना-णिच्
P. III. 1. 25, VIII. 3. 65] To march
against (with an army), to attack,
to face or encounter (another) with
an army; कः सिंधुराजमभिषेणयितुं समर्थः
Ve. 2. 25; Śi. 6. 64.
