अभिसंधा|अभिसन्धा
अभिसंधा {c3c} U.
1 To hold together
--2 To acknowledge, recognize;
own.
--3 To fit or fix a missile,
arrow &c. to the bow.
--4 To throw
or shoot at, aim at; (शूलं) चिक्षेप
परमक्रुद्धो लक्ष्मणायाभिसंहितं Rām.
--5
To aim at, have in view, think of,
(with acc.); पदाविद्धं यांती
स्खलितमभिसंधाय बहुशः V. 4. 28 calling to
mind, thinking of my fault;
ऋष्यमूकमभिसंधाय Mv. 5 towards,
in the direction of; Mv. 6;
Bg. 17. 12, 25; sometimes with dat.;
अभिसंदधते ये च विश्वासायास्य मानवाः
Mb.
--6 To deceive, cheat; जनं
विद्वानेकः सकलमभिसंधाय Māl. 1. 14.
--7
To come to an understanding or
agreement; फलं त्वनभिसंधाय
Ms. 9. 52 (एवं यत्र नियमो न कृतः).
--8 To win
over, make friendship with, ally
oneself with; तान्
सर्वानभिसंदध्यात्सामादिभिरुपक्रमैः Ms. 7. 159 (वशीकुर्यात्).
--9 To declare solemnly, agree,
promise.
--10 To calumniate,
traduce.
--11 To add.
--12 To prefer.
