अभिसृ
अभिसृ {c1c} P.
1 To go up to,
go towards, approach; to go to
some place or other, go or
proceed; पुरोभिसस्रे सुरसुंदरीजनैः
Ki. 8. 4.
--2 To attack, assail.
--3 To
go or advance to meet (as at an
appointed place); सुंदरीरभिससार
K. 58; Dk. 51, 52, 91; Śi. 6. 26.
--Caus. To visit, approach, go to
meet; वल्लभानभिसिसारयिषूणां
10. 20, 21; S. D. 115; Ki. 9. 38; Mk. 8.
