अभिघातः|अभिघात
अभिघातः
1 Striking, (fig. also);
beating, smiting, attack, injury,
hurt; तटाभिघातादिव लग्नपंके
Ku. 7. 49; शीतातपाभिघातान् Ms. 12. 77
attacks of heat and cold; so दुःख˚,
शोक˚ &c.
--2 (In Vaiśeṣika phil.)
Striking against (such as gives rise
to sounds &c.), regarded as a kind
of संयोग.
--3 Striking back, driving
or warding off.
--4 Extirpation,
complete destruction or removal;
दुःखत्रयाभिघाताज्जिज्ञासा तदभिघातके हेतौ
Sāṅ. K. 1.
--5 Abrupt or vehement
articulation of words (as of
Vedic texts); sudden shock.
--तं
1 The
combination of the 4th letter of
any class with the first or third
letter of that class; of the second
with the first; and of the third with
the second letter of any class;
अभिघातं स्यात्पूर्वं वेदद्वित्र्यादिवर्णाश्चेत् । नववर्गाणां
नवतो धरणीचंद्रद्विरामाद्याः Śabdak.
--2 A
harsh pronunciation caused by the
neglect of Saṃdhi rules.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

