अभ्यवहृ
अभ्यवहृ {c1c} P.
1 To throw, fling,
cast.
--2 To collect, draw in, procure,
obtain.
--3 To use as food or drink,
eat; सक्तून् पिब धानाः खादेत्यभ्यवहरति
P. III. 4. 5 Sk. --Caus.
1 To cause
to throw down (in water).
--2 To
cause to take or eat (as food), feed
(one with something); शक्नोषि
किमनेन शालिप्रस्थेन
संपन्नमन्नमस्मानभ्यवहारयितुं Dk. 131, 72, 132; to take or
eat (oneself).
--3 To lay or put on
(snares &c.).
--4 To attack; get
one to oppose another.
