अभ्याश|अभ्याशः
अभ्याश a. Near, proximate.
--शः
1 Reaching to, pervading.
--2 Proximate neighbourhood,
vicinity (also written as अभ्यास
q. v.); वायसाभ्याशे समुपविष्टः Pt. 2:
सहसाभ्यागतां भैमीमभ्याशपरिवर्तिनीं Mb.,
Dk. 62.
--3 Result, consequence.
--4
Prospect, hope of gaining; hence
oft. used in the sense of ‘quickly’.
