M. 1; a contract, agreement,
promise; Ms. 9. 53.
--4 Probable
ascertainment, belief; judgment, a view
accepted; Mv. 1. 38; supposition,
inference.
--5 Analogy, affinity.
--Comp.
--सिद्धांतः an admitted
proposition or axiom.
