अभ्युपपत्तिः f.
1 Approaching to
assist, taking pity or compassion on,
favouring; a favour, kindness;
अभ्युपपत्त्या अस्या जीवितमवलंबस्व Ś. 3;
अनयाभ्युपपत्त्या Ś. 4; मम˚ निमित्तं
Mk. 1.
--2 Consolation.
--3 Protection,
defence; ब्राह्मणाभ्युपपत्तौ च शपथे नास्ति
पातकं Ms. 8. 112, 349; 10. 62;
आर्त˚ Dk. 39.
--4 An agreement,
assent, promise.
--5 Impregnation of a
woman (especially of a brother's
widow as an act of duty).
