grasped and not thrown.
--Comp.
--हस्त a. one whose hand is not
open or free (to give), sparing,
stingy (in a bad sense); frugal,
economical, prudent (in a good sense);
सदा प्रहृष्टया भाव्यं व्यये चामुक्तहस्तया
Ms. 5. 150.
