अमूल
अमूल, --लक a.
1 Rootless(lit.);
पशवोऽमूला ओषधयो मूलिन्यः Śat. Br.;
(fig.) without basis or support,
baseless, groundless.
--2 Without
authority; not being in the original;
नामूलं लिख्यते किंचित् Malli.
--3
Without material cause, as the Pradhāna
of the Sāṃkhyas; मूलं मूलाभावादमूलं.
--4 Not fixed in the earth, moving.
--ला N. of a plant (अग्निशिखा).
