अंबष्ठः|अम्बष्ठ|अंबष्ठ|अम्बष्ठः
अंबष्ठः
1 The offspring of a man
of the Brāhmaṇa and a woman of
the Vaiśya tribe;
ब्राह्मणाद्वैश्यकन्यायामंबष्ठो नाम जायते Ms. 10. 8, 13, 15;
Y. 1. 91. (According to
Ms. 10. 47 the duty of an अंबष्ठ is the
curing of diseases; अंबष्ठानां चिकित्सितं).
--2 An elephant-driver.
--3 (pl.) N.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0154-a" target="_blank">Page0154-a+ 60</a>]
of a country and its inhabitants
(they seem to have occupied the
country to the east of Tāk,
comprising the modern district of
Lahore).
