अंबिकेयकः|अम्बिकेयक|अम्बिकेयकः
अंबिकेयः, --यकः N. of Gaṇeśa,
Kārttikeya or Dhṛtarāṣṭra; more
correctly written आंबिकेय q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
