अंबूकृत|अम्बूकृत|अम्बूकृतं
अंबूकृत a. Sputtered, pronounced
indistinctly in shutting the lips,
the sound thus remaining as it were
in the mouth; uttered while
emitting saliva from the mouth.
--तं A
sputtering noise, the growling of a
bear; दधति कुहरभाजामत्र
भल्लूकयूनामनुरसितगुरूणि स्त्यानमंबूकृतानि U. 2. 21;
Māl. 9. 6; Mv. 5. 41.
