<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोनि|अयोनिः
अयोनि a.
1 Without origin or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0158-c" target="_blank">Page0158-c+ 56</a>]
source, eternal; जगद्योनिरयोनिस्त्वं
Ku. 2. 9.
--2 Not born from the womb;
born in a manner not approved by law
or religion.
--निः f.
1 Not the womb;
Y. 2. 293; Ms. 11. 174.
--2 Not a
particular verse of the Sāmaveda.
--निः
1 N. of Brahmā and Śiva.
--2 A
pestle.
--Comp.
--ज, --जन्मन् a.
not born from the womb, not
produced in the ordinary course of
generation; शरीरं द्विविधं
योनिजमयोनिजं चेति T. S; तनयां अयोनिजां
R. 11. 47, 48; कन्यारत्नमयोनिजन्म
