अर|अरं|अरः
अर a. [इयर्ति गच्छत्यनेन, ऋ-अच्]
1
Speedy, swift.
--2 Little.
--3 Going
(at the end of comp.).
--रः
1 The
spoke or radius of a wheel; (˚रं also);
अरैः संधार्यते नाभिर्नाभौ चाराः प्रतिष्ठिताः
Pt. 1. 81.
--2 A spoke of the
timewheel; a jaina division of time.
--3 A corner (कोण) or angle;
त्रिपंचारे पीठे Śyāmāstava.
--4 Moss (
शैवाल).
--5 = पर्पट q. v.
--Comp.
--अंतर (pl.) the intervals of the spoke;
V. 1. 4.
--घट्टः, --घट्टकः [अरैः घट्ट्यते रच्यते असौ]
{1} a wheel or machine for raising
water from a well (Mar. राहाट).
(It usually consists of a single
wheel with spokes on each side
serving as handles to turn it, and
a rope with a bucket attached to it
passes over this wheel); ˚दृं खेलयमानः
Pt. 4 turning this machine; ˚घटी
a bucket so used; कूपमासाद्य
˚टीमार्गेण सर्पस्तेनानीतः Pt. 4. {2} a deep well.
