अर्घीशः N. of Śiva.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्घ्य|अर्घ्यं
अर्घ्य a. [अर्घ-यत् अर्घमर्हति]
1
Valuable; अनर्घ्य invaluable; see s. v.
--2 Venerable, deserving respectful
offering; तानर्घ्यानर्घ्यमादाय
दूरात्प्रत्युद्ययौ गिरिः Ku. 6. 50; Śi. 1. 14;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0164-b" target="_blank">Page0164-b+ 56</a>]
Y. 1. 110.
--र्घ्यं
1 A respectful
offering or oblation to a god or
venerable person (see अर्घ); अर्घः
पूजाविधिः तदर्थं द्रव्यं अर्घ्यं Sk.; अर्घ्यमस्मै
V. 5.; ददतु तरवः पुष्पैरर्घ्यं फलैश्च
मधुश्चुतः U. 3. 24; अर्घ्यमर्घ्यमिति वादिनं
नृपं R. 11. 69; 1. 44; Ku. 1. 58,
6. 50; (it often consists only of
water given in a droṇa and forms
part of the Madhuparka ceremony).
--2 A kind of honey.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

