अर्थात्
अर्थात् ind. (abl. of अर्थ)
1 As
a matter of course, of course, in fact;
मूषिकेण दंडो भक्षित इत्यनेन
तत्सहचरितमपूपभक्षणमर्थादायातं भवति S. D. 10.
--2 According to the circumstances
or state of the case; as a matter of
fact.
--3 That is to say, namely.
