अर्दित|अर्दितं|अर्द्दित|अर्द्दितः
अर्दित p. p. [अर्द्-क्त] Tormented,
afflicted; begged &c.
--तं A disease,
spasm of the jaw-bones, tetanus or
hemiplegia^1 (paralysis of the muscles
on one side of the face and neck).
[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar and Jim Funderburk on 20210104. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/20.
