अर्धुक
अर्धुक a. Prospering, succeeding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0170-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ध्य
अर्ध्य a.
1 Belonging to the half
(of anything).
--2 Fit to be
increased.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0170-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
