अवकॄ
अवकॄ {c6c} P.
1 To bestow, pour
upon, to shower upon, cover with,
fill; Śi. 11. 62; (तं) अवाकिरन्
बाललताः प्रसूनैः R. 2. 10, 4. 27;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0176-b" target="_blank">Page0176-b+ 57</a>]
लाजांजलिभिरवकीर्यमाणः K. 86;
Ki. 6. 2; अवकीर्योत्तरीयाणि Mb.
spreading on the ground; तीर्थानि अवकीर्णानि
तपस्विभिः Mb. filled with; Y. 3. 281;
Me. 54.
--2 To pour out, throw out
Ms. 6. 48.
--3 To shake off, throw
off, leave.
--4 (Atm.) (Used
reflexively) (a) To extend, spread itself;
अवकिरते हस्ती स्वयमेव Sk. (b) To fall
asunder. (c) To pass away, fall off.
(d) To become faithless or untrue.
