--2 Boundary, limit.
--3
Separation.
--4 Distinction, distinguishing,
particularization (as by attributes).
--5 Determination, decision,
settlement; शब्दार्थस्यानवच्छेदे विशेषस्मृतिहेतवः
Vāk. P.
--6 That property of a thing
which distinguishes it from every
thing else, a characteristic property.
--7 Bounding, defining.
--8
Pervading (व्याप्तिः). ˚अवच्छेदः generalizing,
removing distinctions.
