--2
Determining, deciding,
प्रतियोगिकावच्छेदकावच्छिन्नं
--3 Bounding, limiting.
--4
Pervading.
--5 Distinguishing,
particularizing.
--6 Peculiar, characteristic.
--कः
1 That which distinguishes.
--2 A predicate, characteristic
property.
--3 Boundary, limit.
