अवतरणं|अवतरण
अवतरणं
1 Descending for bathing
in water &c., गंगा˚, अप्सरस्तीर्थ˚;
descending or alighting (in general),
coming down; स्तन्य˚.
--2 An
incarnation; see अवतार.
--3 Crossing.
--4 Sudden disappearance.
--5 Steps
or stairs leading to a river.
--6
A holy bathing-place (तीर्थ).
--7
Translating from one language into
another.
--8 Introduction.
--9 An
extract, a quotation.
