अवनत|अवनतं
अवनत p. p.
1 Bent down, hung
down, downcast; विनय˚, प्रश्रय˚,
लज्जा, ˚उत्तरकायं R. 9. 60;
फलपुष्पैरवनतान् Rām.
--2 Verging in the west,
setting; रजनिरवनतेंदुर्लज्जयाधोमुखी च
Śi. 10. 91.
--3 Bending, stooping,
deepened, not projecting.
--4
Humble.
--Comp.
--अंग a. with stooping;
limbs; Ku. 5. 86.
--काय a.
bending the body, crouching down.
--मुख a. with down-cast
countenance.
--शीर्षन् a. bowing the head.
