अवनतिः|अवनति
अवनतिः f.
1 Bending, bowing
down, stooping; अवनतिमवनेः
Mu. 1. 2, 3. 8; Śi. 9. 8.
--2 Declining in the
west, setting; Śi. 9. 8.
--3 A bow,
prostration.
--4 Bending (as a bow);
धनुषामवनतिः K. (where अ˚ also
means ‘stooping’).
--5 Modesty,
absence of insolence, humility.
