अवष्टब्ध|अवष्टब्धं
अवष्टब्ध p. p. [अवस्तंभ्-क्त, षत्वम्]
1
Supported; rested on, protected;
held, seized.
--2 Hanging from
or upon; अवष्टब्धा यष्टिः Sk.
--3
Near, contiguous; अद्यश्वीनावष्टब्धे
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0189-c" target="_blank">Page0189-c+ 57</a>]
P. V. 2. 13, Bk. 9. 72.
--4
Obstructed, stopped, suspended.
--5
Paralysed.
--6 Bound, tied, attached.
--7
Wrapped up, enfolded.
--8 Opposed.
--9 Surpassed, overcome.
