अवष्टंभः|अवष्टम्भ|अवष्टम्भः
अवष्टंभः [स्तंभ्-घञ्, सस्य षत्वं]
1
Leaning, resting upon.
--2 Support, prop;
पक्षाभ्यामीषत्कृतावष्टंभः K. 34, 44, 186,
231, 248; खडलतावष्टंभनिश्चलः
Māl. 3; (hence) having recourse to,
plucking up or summoning (as courage);
तत्कथमहं धैर्यावष्टंभं करोमि Pt. 1; so
पौरुष˚, धीरत्व˚ Māl. 2; सहजसत्त्व˚
K. 286.
--3 Haughtiness, pride,
dignity, majestic greatness; सावष्टंभाकृतिना
K. 179 dignified, noble, see सावष्टंभ.
--4
A post, pillar.
--5 Gold.
--6
Commencement, beginning.
--7 Stopping,
standing till, staying.
--8 Courage,
steadiness; K. 156, 157; resolute
determination; ईदृशोऽस्यावष्टंभः Ratn. 4;
अविनयकोपितोऽवष्टंभं कृत्वा K. 261 plucking
up courage; पलायनमवष्टंभो वा Pt. 4
holding out (as opposed to पलायनं).
--9 Obstruction, impediment.
--10
Paralysis, stupefaction K. 141.
--11
Excellence.
