<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवसक्त
अवसक्त p. p.
1 Suspended from,
placed; कर्णावसक्तामलदंतपत्रं
Ku. 7. 23, K. 206; Ki. 7. 40; Śi. 5. 16,
18, 9. 7, Ch. P. 4.
--2 In contact
with, bound round, touching;
अविज्ञातावसक्तेन दूषिता मम वाससा
Mk. 1. 54.
--3 Engaged in, intent on, eager.
--क्तं Contact.
