Well cooked; matured.
--4 Resolved,
determined, ascertained.
--5
Standing in a pause
--6 Stored, gathered
(as grain).
--7 Tied, fastened, bound.
--8 Gone.
--9 Remaining, dwelling
(Ved.).
--तं
1 A dwelling place;
नवावसिते वैनमाहरेयुः Śat. Br.
--2 Corn
ground.
