अवे
अवे {c2c} P. [अव इ]
1 (a) To know,
understand, learn, perceive, be aware
of; अवैमि ते तस्यां सोदर्यस्नेहं Ś. 4;
अवैमि चैनामनघेति R. 14. 40;
द्विषदभियोग इत्यवैति Mu. 1. 7.; अवैमि ते सारं
Ku. 3. 13; R. 2. 35. (b) To know,
look upon or consider, regard,
तदवैमि कैतवं Ku. 4. 9; Ś. 5. 11;
Bk. 7. 33; किं मां सुतक्षयकरं सुत इत्यवैषि
Ve. 5. 2.
--2 To go or move away.
--3
To go to, approach (with acc.).
--4
To rush upon, come down upon
(Ved.) --Freq. or Pass. (अवेयते) To
beg pardon for, conciliate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0197-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

