अव्याकृत
अव्याकृत a.
1 Not developed,
not manifest; तद्धेदं
तर्ह्यव्याकृतमासीत्, इदं नामरूपाभ्यामव्याकृतं. Ś. B.
--2
Not decomposed, elementary.
--तं
(In Vedānta phil.)
1 An elementary
substance from which all things
were created (considered
identical with Brahma.)
--2 (In Sān. phil.)
The prime germ of nature (प्रधान).
