अव्यापक
अव्यापक a.
1 Not
comprehensive.
--2 Not spread over or pervading
the whole; not an invariable
concomitant, special, individual,
peculiar; ˚ता, --˚त्वं
non-comprehensiveness, speciality, individuality.
