अव्यापार|अव्यापारः
अव्यापार a. Having no work,
unemployed.
--रः
1 Cessation from
work, state of being unemployed.
--2 A business not practised or
understood.
--3 Not one's own
business; अव्यापारेषु व्यापारं कृ to meddle
with affairs not one's own (which do
not concern one).
