अशरीर|अशरीरः
अशरीर a. Bodiless,
incorporeal.
--रः
1 The Supreme Being
(परमात्मन्), Brahma.
--2 (In
Mīmāmsā) A god or deity in general.
--3
Cupid, the god of love चेतांसि
चिंताभिरिवाशरीरः Ki. 17. 10: Śi. 9. 61.
--4 An ascetic who has renounced
all worldly connections; ˚त्वं --ता
absolution.
