1 Not a void.
--2
Something sent to accompany another;
लेखस्याशून्यार्थं किंचिदनुप्रेषितं Mu. 5;
अयं लेखस्याशून्यार्थो भविष्यति ibid. (an
accompaniment such as a customary
present accompanying a letter).
