असाधारण a.
1 Not common,
peculiar, special, specific.
--2 (In
logic) Existing neither in सपक्ष or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0212-c" target="_blank">Page0212-c+ 56</a>]
