अस्मद्
अस्मद् pron. [अस्-मदिक्
Uṇ. 1. 136] A pronominal base from
which several cases of the 1st
personal pronoun are derived; it is also
abl. pl. of the word. --m. The
individual soul, the embodied soul;
यूयं वयं वयं यूयमित्यासीन्मतिरावयोः ।
किं जातमधुना येन यूयं यूयं वयं वयं ॥
Bh. 3. 65 (quite estranged from
each other).
--Comp.
--द्रुह् a. Ved.
forming a plot against us or me,
inimical.
--विध, --अस्मादृश a. similar
or like us.
