आकलनं|आकलन
आकलनं
1 Laying hold of, seizing;
मेखलाकलनं K. 183; binding; Śi. 5. 42
confinement.
--2 Counting,
reckoning.
--3 Wish, desire.
--4 Inquiry.
--5 Comprehending, understanding.
