आकल्पः
1 An ornament,
decoration; आकल्पसारो रूपाजीवाजनः
Dk. 63, K. 313, 365; R. 17. 22, 18. 52.
--2 Dress (in general),
accoutrement.
--3 Sickness, disease.
--4
Adding to, increasing.
