<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रंदः|आक्रन्द|आक्रन्दः
आक्रंदः
1 Weeping, crying out;
किं क्रंदसि दुराक्रंद Pt. 4. 29.
--2
Calling, invoking, calling out to;
Ms. 8. 292.
--3 Sound, war-cry, a cry
(in general); आक्रंद उदभूत्तत्र
Ks. 10 94.
--4 A friend, defender.
--5 A
brother.
--6 A fierce or violent
combat, war, battle.
--7 A place of crying.
--8 A king who prevents an ally
from aiding another; a king whose
kingdom lies next but one;
प्रार्ष्णिग्राहं च संप्रेक्ष्य तथाक्रंदं च मंडले
Ms. 7. 207 (see Kull. thereon).
