आख्या
आख्या {c2c} P.
1 (a) To tell, say,
inform, communicate, narrate
(usually with dat. of person); ते
रामाय वधोपायमाचख्युर्विबुधद्विषः R. 15. 5,
41, 71, 93; 12. 42, 91; Bg. 11. 31,
18. 63; Me. 100; Ms. 8. 224, 9. 73,
Y. 1. 66, 2. 65; sometimes with gen.
of person; आख्याहि भद्रे प्रियदर्शनस्य
Pt. 4. 15; केनाहं तवाख्यातः Mb. (b) To
declare, announce, signify; R. 2. 11.
--2 To call, denominate, name;
सुवर्णबिंदुरित्याख्यायते Māl. 9; R. 10. 21,
Ms. 4. 6.
--3 To look at, count; to
recite (Ved.). --Caus. (ख्यापयति)
1
To cause to tell or narrate.
--2 To
declare.
