<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्यानकं|आख्यानक
आख्यानकं A tale, a short
legendary narrative, an episode;
आख्यानकाख्यायिकेतिहासपुराणाकर्णनेन K. 7;
P. IV. 2. 60 Vārt.
--की N. of a metre
which is a combination of
Indravajrā and Upendravajrā.
