afraid; ˚क्षोभ perplexed; अन्वय˚
hereditary; ˚मन्यु angry; ˚विस्मय
surprised.
--4 Reduced to, fallen
into (a particular state); दासत्वं, पंचत्वं,
संदेहं, विस्मयं &c.
--5 Living or
residing in.
