आगंतुक|आगन्तुक|आगन्तुकं
आगंतुक a. (का, की f.)
1
Coming of one's own accord, arriving
uninvited; आगंतुका वयं Dhūrtas.
--2
Stray (as an animal); Y. 2. 163.
--3 Incidental, accidental;
adventitious; इत्यागंतुका विकाराः Āśval.
--4
Interpolated, spurious (as a
reading), having crept in without
authority; अत्र
गंधवद्गंधमादनमित्यागंतुकः पाठः Malli. on Ku. 6. 46.
--कः
1 An intruder, interloper.
--2
A stranger, guest, new-comer;
Ś. 4, {6}
--3 Interpolated reading.
