आचरित|आचरितं
आचरित p. p.
1 Done, observed,
practised, as a rite or usage &c.
--2
Usual, customary.
--3 Enjoined,
fixed by rule.
--तं
1 Conduct,
behaviour.
--2 One of the five means of
recovering or paying back debt;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0229-b" target="_blank">Page0229-b+ 58</a>]
Ms. 8. 49; see also Bṛhaspati quoted by
Kull.
