आत्
आत् The letter आ. --ind. Ved.
1
Afterwards, then; generally used
antithetically to यद्, यदा, यदि and
then sometimes strengthened by
the particles अह, उ, इद् &c.
--2 Then,
further, also, and (अपिच).
--3
Sometimes it only strengthens the
meaning of another word or gives
emphasis to an interrogative pronoun
like उ, अंग, नु added to किं (possibly,
at all).
