आतंचनं|आतञ्चन|आतञ्चनं
आतंचनं
1 Causing to coagulate
or curdle, casting butter-milk into
heated milk to turn it.
--2
Causing to contract in general.
--3
Curdled milk.
--4 That which causes
coagulation, a runnet.
--5 A sort of
whey.
--6 Conveying.
--7 Gratifying,
satisfying.
--8 Casting away,
destroying.
