आतन्
आतन् {c8c} U.
1 To extend, stretch
over, overspread, cover;
निषादिवक्षःस्थलमातनोति Ki. 16. 15 pervade,
penetrate; Ki. 7. 25.
--2 To spread,
diffuse.
--3 To cause, produce;
आनंदनेन जडतां पुनरातनोति U. 3. 12;
Ki. 6. 18, 7. 39; K. 176; Māl. 5. 9;
Mv. 4. 31.
--4 To bring to pass,
effect, accomplish, do, perform;
सुरतमाततान K. 57; सपर्यां 64.
--5 To
illuminate.
--6 To take hold of;
seek to attain.
--7 To assume a
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0232-c" target="_blank">Page0232-c+ 57</a>]
hostile attitude.
--8 To stretch (as
a bow).
