आतिथेय); हविरातिथ्यं, आतिथ्या इष्टिः &c.
--थ्यः A guest.
--थ्यं
1 Hospitable
reception, hospitality;
तमातिथ्यक्रियाशांतरथक्षोभपरिश्रमं R. 1. 58.
--2 A
particular rite, the reception of
Soma when it is brought to the
sacrificial place (also called
आतिथ्येष्टिः).
--Comp.
--रूप a. being in
the place of the आतिथ्य sacrifice.
--सत्कारः, --सत्क्रिया the rites of
hospitality.
