आद्य|आद्यं|आद्यः
आद्य a. [आदौ भवः यत्]
1 First,
primitive, being at the beginning.
--2
Being at the head, excellent,
unparalleled, pre-eminent, foremost;
आसीन्महीक्षितामाद्यः प्रणवश्छंदसामिव
R. 1. 11.
--3 (At the end of comp.)
Beginning with, and so on; see आदि.
