आदिष्टिन्
आदिष्टिन् a. One who gives orders.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0238-a" target="_blank">Page0238-a+ 57</a>]
--m. (अस्त्यर्थे इनि).
1 A Brāhmaṇa in
the first order of his life; a pupil,
student (ब्रह्मचारिन्).
--2 A penitent,
one engaged in any expiatory rite;
Ms. 5. 88.
