आनत|आनतः
आनत p. p.
1 Respectfully
saluted or bowed to.
--2 (Actively used)
Bent down, bending, stooping,
inclined; कुसुमानताः (तरवः) Ki. 5. 25;
Rs. 6. 3; पादानतः Ku. 3. 8; so प्रश्रय˚, फलभार˚.
--3 Making a low bow, saluting
respectfully; R. 1. 92, 4. 69.
--4
Humble, obedient, submissive, pacified,
conciliated.
