--3 To lead towards or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-a" target="_blank">Page0242-a+ 55</a>]
near, convey.
--4 To mix in.
--5 To
reduce or lead to any condition;
वशं आनी to reduce to
subjection.
--6 To lead off, divert.
--Caus. To cause to bring (with
instr. of person who brings);
R. 12. 12, 15. 74.
