--ना [प्याय्-ल्युट्]
1 The act of
making full or fat.
--2 Satisfying,
refreshing, pleasing.
--3 Satisfaction,
satiety: देवस्याप्यायना भवति Pt. 1.
--4
Advancing, promoting.
--5
Corpulency, growing fat or stout.
--6
Anything which causes corpulency or
good condition.
--7 A
strengthening medicine.
--8 Pouring water on
Soma and thus causing it to swell.
--Comp.
--शील a. satisfying.
