आभा
आभा {c2c} P.
1 To shine, blaze;
सुतरां रत्नमाभाति चामीकरनियोजितं
Subhāṣ.; R. 3. 33.
--2 To appear, look
like; आभासि तीर्थप्रतिपादितर्द्धिः
R. 5. 15, 70, 13. 14; Bk. 7. 8, 66.
--3 To
outshine.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आभा
आभा [भा-अङ्]
1 Light,
splendour, lustre; दीपाभां शलभा यथा
Pt. 4.
--2 Colour, appearance, beauty;
प्रशांतमिव शुद्धाभं Ms. 12. 27.
--3
Likeness, resemblance; oft. at the end of
comp. in these two senses; रुक्माभं
appearnig or shining like gold;
यमदूताभं Pt. 1. 58; मरुत्सखाभं R. 2. 10.
--4 A
reflected image, shadow, reflection.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

