आराध्
आराध् {c5c} {c10c} P.
1 To propitiate,
conciliate, please, try to win the
favour of; परेषां चेतांसि
प्रतिदिवसमाराध्य बहुधा Bh. 3. 34, 2. 4-5;
R. 1. 77, 81, 10. 86, 18. 23; Me. 45.
--2 To honour, worship,
respect.
--3 To deserve, merit.
