आरोपः|आरोप
आरोपः
1 Attributing the nature or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0255-b" target="_blank">Page0255-b+ 57</a>]
properties of one thing to another;
वस्तुन्यवस्त्वारोपोऽध्यारोपः Vedānta S.;
attributing or assigning to,
imputation; दोषारोपो गुणेष्वपि Ak.
--2 Considering as equal;
identification (as in सारोपा लक्षणा).
--3
Superimposition.
--4 Imposing (as a
burden), burdening or charging
with.
--5 Placing in or upon.
--6
Relating to.
--7 Superior position.
