आरोहः|आरोह
आरोहः [आ-रुह्-घञ्]
1 One who
mounts, a rider, as in अश्वारोह,
स्यंदनारोह; सारोहाणां च वाजिनां Rām.; one
who is seated in a carriage.
--2
Ascent, rising, mounting, ascending,
riding.
--3 An elevated place,
elevation, altitude, height; नगाद्यारोह
उच्छ्रायः Ak.
--4 Haughtiness, pride.
--5 A mountain, a heap.
--6 A
woman's waist; the buttocks; सा रामा न
वरारोहा Udb.;
आरोहैर्निबिडबृहन्नितंबबिंबैः Śi. 8. 8.
--7 Length.
--8 A kind of
measure.
--9 A mine.
--10 Descending.
