1 The menstrual
discharge (of women);
नोपगच्छेत्प्रमत्तोऽपि स्त्रियमार्तवदर्शने Ms. 4. 40,
3. 48.
--2 Certain days after
menstrual discharge, favourable to
conception.
--3 A flower.
