आवस्
आवस् {c1c} P. (With acc.)
1 To
inhabit, dwell in; रविमावसते सतां
क्रियायै V. 3. 7; पुरीमिमामावसत् Rām.;
sometimes with loc.; Ms. 7. 69;
Y. 1. 320.
--2 To be occupied or
engaged, enter upon; गृहस्थाश्रमं
Ms. 3. 2.
--3 To take part carnally;
cohabit.
--4 To pass, spend (as night).
--Caus.
1 To allow one to dwell,
receive hospitably.
--2 To inhabit,
settle in a place.
--3 To halt or
encamp (for the night).
