आवह्
आवह् {c1c} P.
1 To bring; अग्ने
पत्नीरिहावह Rv. 1. 22. 9.
--2 To bring
home (as a bride).
--3 To conduce,
lead or tend to, produce, bring on;
व्रीडमावहति मे स संप्रति R. 11. 73
shames me; मनोरुजमावहन् Ś. 3. 4
tending to mental anguish; न मे
सौख्यमावहति does not tend to
my happiness Pt. 1; संगमं K. 174;
Ms. 3. 82.
--4 To pay; Y. 2. 193.
--5 To lead forth, conduct away.
--6 To flow (as blood &c.).
--7
To bear, support, wear;
मंडनमावहंतिं Ch. P. 18.
--8 To apply, use,
employ; मा रोदीर्धैर्यमावह Mārk. P.
--Caus.
1 To send for, cause to be
brought.
--2 To invoke a deity
(by means of Mantras);
गणपतिमावाहयामि &c.
