आवह|आवहः
आवह a. (As last member of
comp.) Producing, leading or
tending to, bringing on,
क्लेशावहा भर्तुरलक्षणाऽहं R. 14. 5; so
दुःख˚, भय˚, क्षय˚ &c.
--हः
1 N. of one
of the seven winds or bands of air,
usually assigned to the भुवर्लोक or
atmospheric region between the
भूर्लोक and स्वर्लोक.
--2 One of the
seven tongues of fire.
