आवृत्
आवृत् {c1c} A.
1 To turn round,
revolve.
--2 To return, come or turn
back; धेनुराववृते वनात् R. 1. 82,
2. 19; Bg. 8. 26.
--3 To go to or
towards.
--4 To be restless or
uneasy; Māl. 1. 41. --Caus.
1 To cause
to turn or revolve; अक्षबलयमावर्तयंतं
K. 42 telling the beads.
--2 To roll,
turn about or over.
--3 To cause
to roll down, shed (as tears &c.).
--4 To attract, win over (see आवृज्)
--5 To repeat, recite.
