आवर्तः
1 Turning round,
winding, revolving; प्रदक्षिणावर्तशिखः
Rām.
--2 A whirlpool, an eddy,
whirl; नृपं तमावर्तमनोज्ञनाभिः
R. 6. 52; दर्शितावर्तनाभेः Me. 28; Dk. 2;
आवर्तः संशयानां Pt. 1. 191.
--3
Deliberation, revolving (in the mind),
anxiety.
--4 A lock of hair curling
backwards, especially on a horse.
--5
The two depressions of the forehead
above the eye-brows.
--6 A crowded
place (where many men live closely
together).
--7 A kind of jewel.
--8 N.
of a form of cloud personified;
आवर्तो निर्जलो मेघः.
--9 Melting (of metals).
--10 Doubt.
--11 Worldly existence
(संसार).
--र्तं A mineral substance,
pyrites (माक्षिकधातु).
