आवर्तन|आवर्तनः|आवर्त्तन|आवर्त्तनं
आवर्तन a.
1 Turning round or
towards.
--2 Revolving.
--नं
1
Turning round, returning,
revolution.
--2 Circular motion, gyration.
--3 Churning or stirring up
anything in fusion.
--4 Melting
together, fusion, alligation (said of
metals).
--5 Mid-day, the time when
shadows are cast in an opposite
direction.
--6 Repeating, doing over
and over again^1.
--7 Study, practising.
--नः Viṣṇu.
--नी
1 A crucible.
--2 A spoon, ladle.
