आव्यध्
आव्यध् {c4c} P.
1 To hit, pierce; see
अनाविद्ध.
--2 To wound.
--3 To break
or pierce through.
--4 To put on;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0263-a" target="_blank">Page0263-a+ 55</a>]
Bk. 20. 11.
--5 To shoot at, throw or
cast towards.
--6 To throw away, cast
off.
--7 To wave, brandish.
--8 To pin
on.
--9 To rouse, agitate, stir up.
--10 To drive away, expel;
निर्बंधमाविध्यति Mv. 5. 39.
