आविद्ध
आविद्ध p. p.
1 Pierced, bored, rent,
splintered, broken down;
उत्पाताविद्धमूर्तिः Mv. 5. 44 rent or contracted;
R. 12. 73.
--2 Curved, crooked,
uneven; V. 4. 28; हर्षाविद्धमभ्युत्थितः
Dk. 37.
--3 Cast with force; दूरनिक्षेप˚
Māl. 8 cast forth in taking
long strides; Mv. 2; Ms. 9. 40;
thrown, put in motion.
--4
Disappointed.
--5 Fallacious, false.
--6
Stupid, foolish.
--Comp.
--कर्णी,
--कर्णिका N. of a plant (पाठा).
