आशंस्
आशंस् {c1c} A. (rarely P.)
1 To
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0263-b" target="_blank">Page0263-b+ 56</a>]
hope for, expect, desire, wish or
long for; स्वकार्यसिद्धिं पुनराशशंसे
Ku. 3. 57; Bk. 14. 70, 90;
Ś. 2. 15; M. 1; मनोरथाय नाशंसे Ś. 7. 13.
--2 To bless, wish well to; एवं ते देवा
आशंसंतु Mk. 1; इत्याशशंसे
करणैरबाह्यैः R. 14. 50.
--3 To speak, say.
--4 To tell; Ku. 3. 14.
--5 To ask
for, beg.
--6 To praise.
--7 To repeat,
recite.
--8 To fear, be afraid of.
--Caus. To render famous or
celebrated.
