आशी
आशी {c2c} A.
1 To lie or sleep on;
कुसुमान्याशेरते षट्पदाः V. 2. 23 v. l.
--2 To pass (the night) in sleep.
--3 To wish, pray for.
--4 To dwell,
live, inhabit.
