<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमिक|आश्रमिकः
आश्रमिक a., आश्रमिन् a. [आश्रम-ठन्
इति]
1 Belonging to one of the four
orders or periods of religious life;
Ms. 6. 90-91, 12. 111, 3. 78.
--2
Belonging to a hermitage.
