breath, breathing freely, recovery,
revival.
--2 Consolation, cheering
up, inspiring confidence; U. 6. 10.
--3 An assurance of safety or
protection.
--4 Cessation, completion, stop.
--5 A chapter or section of a book.
--6
A probable story.
