आसंग|आसङ्ग|आसङ्गं|आसङ्गः
आसंग a. Uninterrupted,
perpetual.
--गः
1 Attachment, devotion
(to any object) (to enjoy or
protect it); सुख˚ लुब्धः K. 173;
U. 3; Bh. 3. 60.
--2 Intentness,
close application.
--3 Contact,
adnerence, clinging; (पंकजं)
सशैवलासंगमपि प्रकाशते Ku. 5. 9; 3. 46;
व्रततिवलयासंगसंजातपाशः Ś. 1. 33;
Mu. 1. 14; अनासंगः absence of
consolation; Māl. 2.
--4 Association,
connection, union; त्यक्त्वा
कर्मफलासंगं Bg. 4. 20; so कांतासंग &c.
--5 Fixing, fastening to.
--6 Pride
about the authorship of a thing
(कर्तृत्वाभिमान).
--7 That which is
fastened; cf. उत्तरासंग.
--8
Waylaying (?).
--गं A kind of fragrant
earth; (सौराष्ट्रमृत्तिका).
--गं ind.
Without interruption, eternally.
