आसंजनं|आसञ्जन
आसंजनं
1 Fastening to, fixing,
putting on the body (as dress,
armour &c.).
--2 Getting entangled,
clinging; व्रततिवलयासंजनात् Ś. 1. 33 v. l.
--3
Attachment, devotion.
--4 Contact,
proximity.
--5 A handle, hook.
