इतिहासः|इतिहास
इतिहासः [fr. इति-ह-आस (3rd. pers.
sing. Perf. of अस् to be); so it has
been]
1 History (legendary or
traditional);
धर्मार्थकाममोक्षाणामुपदेशसमन्वितं । पूर्ववृत्तं कपायुक्तमितिहासं प्रचक्षते ॥
--2 Heroic history (such as the
Mahābhārata).
--3 Historical
evidence, tradition (which is
recognized as a proof by the
Paurāṇikas).
--Comp.
--निबंधनं legendary
composition or narrative; Ś. 3.
--पुराणं history and legendary
stories.
--वादः historical story,
legend; Māl. 3. 3.
