˚आख्याने P. I. 4. 90; Me. 94;
Ku. 6. 26; Ś. 3, 5; कथमित्थंभूता M. 5,
K. 146. {2} true or faithful (as a
story).
--भावः being thus endowed,
having these qualities.
--विध a. {1} of
such kind. {2} endowed with such
qualities.
