1 Kindled,
lighted; Mv. 1. 53; क्रोध˚
Ratn. 1. 4; Mu. 1. 2; ˚राग Ś. 7. 16
whose glow or red colour has just
broken out.
--2 Shining, glowing,
blazing, bright; Ki. 2. 59; Śi. 1. 63;
˚बोधैः Bk. 1. 5 (पटुबुद्धिभिः) sharp.
--3
Clean, clear.
--4 Wonderful.
--5
Obeyed, unresisted (as order); ˚शासनः
Ki. 1. 22
--द्धं
1 Sunshine, heat.
--2
Refulgence, splendour.
--3 Wonder.
--Comp.
--दीधितिः fire; Śi. 16. 35.
--मन्यु a. having the anger excited.
