उ|उः
उ {vI.v} {c1c} A. (अवते, ऊवे, औष्ट, ओतुं, उत)
1 To sound, make a noise.
--2 To
roar, bellow (as a bull &c.). {vII.v} {c5c} P.
(उनोति) Ved. To ask, demand.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0284-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उः|उ
उः
1 N. of Śiva, the second of
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0284--1b" target="_blank">Page0284--1b+ 5</a>]
the three syllables in ओम्; see अ.
--2 N. of Brahmā.
--3 The orb of the
moon. --ind.
1 As a particle used
expletively; उ उमेशः Sk.
--2 An
interjection of:-- (a) calling; उ मेति मात्रा
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0284-1c" target="_blank">Page0284-1c+ 6</a>]
तपसो निषिद्धा पश्चादुमाख्यां सुमुखी जगाम
Ku. 1. 26; (b) anger; (c)
compassion; (d) command; (e) acceptance; (f)
interrogation; or (g) used merely as an
expletive. In the Veda used as an
enclitic copula implying restriction
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0285-a" target="_blank">Page0285-a+ 57</a>]
and emphasis (and, but, on the
other hand, now, I ask &c.);
in classical literature used
chiefly with अथ (अथो), न (नो) and
किम् (किमु); see these words. उ-उ
or उत on the one hand-on the other
hand, partly-partly.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0284-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

