उच्
उच् {c4c} P. (उच्यति, उवोच, औचीत्,
उचिष्यति, उचितुं, उचित or उग्र mostly
used in p. p.)
1 To collect, to
gather together.
--2 To take
pleasure in, delight in, be fond of.
--3 To be accustomed or used to.
--4 To be suitable, suit, fit.
