उच्छिष्ट|उच्छिष्टं
उच्छिष्ट p. p.
1 Left as a remainder
--2 Rejected, abandoned; अन्˚
R. 12. 15.
--3 Stale; ˚कल्पना stale idea
or invention.
--4 (Used actively)
One who has not washed his mouth
and hands after meals, and hence
considered impure; न चोच्छिष्टः क्वचिद्
व्रजेत् Ms. 2. 56.
--ष्टं
1 Leavings,
fragments, remainder (especially of
food or sacrifice); नोच्छिष्टं कस्यचिद्
दद्यात् Ms. 2. 56; so द्विज˚, गृध्र˚.
--2
Honey.
--Comp.
--अन्नं leavings, offal.
--चांडालिनी a form of the goddess
मातंगी.
--भोजन, --भोजिन्, --भोक्तृ a. one
who eats the leavings of another or
eats the leavings of offerings to gods
(as an attendant upon an idol).
--भोजनं eating the leavings of
another.
