उच्छ्वसित|उच्छ्वसितं
उच्छ्वसित p. p. (Used actively).
1 Heaving, breathing; U. 3.
--2
Emitting or sending out vapour
(refreshed); V. 4.
--3 Full-blown,
opened, expanded; Māl. 4; ˚मूर्तिः
K. 92 raised up, Ch. P. 13.
--4 (a)
Enlivened, gladdened, refreshed;
Me. 42. (b) Inspired or animated with
hope; Ku. 6. 14.
--5 Breathing a
sigh of relief; M. 3. 6; R. 10. 73;
K. 181.
--6 Consoled;
उत्कंठोच्छ्वसितहृदया Me. 100.
--7 Waving,
dishevelled; ˚अलकं R. 8. 55.
--8
Effaced (सम्˚); Ku. 3. 38.
--तं
1
Breath, the (very) life; सा
कुलपतेरुच्छ्वसितमिव Ś. 3; Ku. 7. 4.
--2
Blooming, blowing.
--3 Exhalation;
R. 8. 3.
--4 Heaving, upheaval,
throbbing; R. 6. 68; V. 1.
--5
Becoming loose or relaxed.
--6
Sighing.
--7 The vital airs of
the body.
