उत्कंठा
1 Anxiety, uneasiness (in
general); य स्यत्यद्य शकुंतलेति हृदयं
संस्पृष्टमुत्कंठया Ś. 4. 5; अवाप्त˚
Māl. 2. 12 seized with fright, suddenly
startled.
--2 Longing for a beloved
person or thing; दृष्टिरधिकं
सोत्कंठमुद्वीक्षते Amaru. 24.
--3 Regret, sorrow,
missing anything or person;
गाढोत्कंठा Māl. 1. 15; Me. 83.
