उत्कंठित p. p.
1 Anxious, uneasy.
--2 Regretting, grieving for,
sorrowful.
--3 Longing for a beloved
person or thing.
--ता A mistress
longing for her absent lover or
husband, one of the eight heroines;
she is thus defined
--आगंतुं
कृतचित्तोऽपि दैवान्नायाति यत्प्रियः । तंदनागमदुःखार्ता
विरहोत्कंठिता तु सा ॥ S. D. 121.
