Increasing, growing (in strength),
advancing.
--7 Bounded up,
rebounded; पतिता उत्थिता Mu. 1.
--8 Occurring.
--9 High, lofty,
eminent.
--10 Extended, stretched;
आपर्वभाग˚ Ś. 4. 4.
--11 An epithet of
a Pragātha consisting of ten Pādas.
