उत्पल|उत्पलं|उत्पलः
उत्पल a. [उत्क्रांतः पलं मांसं]
Fleshless, emaciated, lean.
--ली A kind
of cake made with unwinnowed
corn.
--लं
1 A blue lotus, any lotus
or water-lily; नवावतारं
कमलादिवोत्पलं R. 3. 36, 12. 86; Me. 26;
नीलोत्पलपत्रधारया Ś. 1. 18; so रक्त,˚
--2 The
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0297-c" target="_blank">Page0297-c+ 52</a>]
plant Costus Speciosus.
--3 A plant in
general.
--Comp.
--अक्ष, --चक्षुस् a.
lotuseyed.
--आभ a. lotus-like.
--गंधिकं
a variety of sandal of the colour of
brass (which is very fragrant).
--पत्रं {1} a lotus-leaf. {2} a wound
caused by a female's fingernail,
nail-print. {3} a Tilaka or mark on
the forehead made with sandal. {4}
a broad-bladed knife or lancet.
--पत्रकं a broad-bladed knife or
lancet.
--भेद्यकः a kind of bandage.
--माला N. of a lexicon.
