उत्सद्
उत्सद् {c1c} P.
1 To sink (fig. also),
fall into ruin or decay; उत्सीदेयुरिमे
लोकाः Bg. 3. 24.
--2 To leave off,
quit.
--3 To rise up. --Caus.
1 To
destroy, annihilate, bring to ruin;
उत्साद्यंते जातिधर्माः Bg. 1. 43;
Ms. 9. 267.
--2 To overturn, upset
(pots &c.).
--3 To rub in, anoint
(as with oil, perfumes &c.);
Y. 1. 277.
