उदच्
उदच्, उदंच् a. (m. उदङ्, n. उदक्,
f. उदीची)
1 Turned or going
upwards.
--2 Upper, higher; ˚कूलः,
˚तीरः &c.
--3 Northern, turned
towards the north.
--4 Subsequent.
--क ind.
1 Above.
--2 Northward,
to the north of (with abl.);
Ms. 3. 217.
--3 Subsequently.
--Comp.
--अद्रिः the northern mountain,
Himālaya.
--अयनं the sun's
progress north of the equator (=
उत्तरायणं q. v.).
--आवृत्तिः f. return from
the north; उदगावृत्तिपथेन नारदः
R. 8. 33.
--दश a. having its skirts or
border turned upwards or towards
the north (as a garment).
--पथः
a northern country.
--प्रवण a.
{1} inclining or sloping towards
the north. {2} proceeding well (as a
sacrifice).
--भूमः, --भूमिः good or
fertile soil.
--मुख a. facing the
north; उत्पतोदङ्मुखः खं Me. 14.
