उदानः|उदान
उदानः [अन्-घञ्]
1 Breathing
upwards.
--2 Breathing, breath in
general.
--3 One of the five
vital airs or life-winds which
rises up the throat and enters into
the head; the other four being प्राण,
अपान, समान and व्यान; स्पंदयत्यधरं वक्त्रं
गात्रनेत्रप्रकोपनः । उद्वेजयति मर्मणि उदानो नाम
मारुतः ॥.
--4 (With Buddhists) An
expression of praise or joy.
--5 The
navel.
--6 An eyelash.
--7 A kind
of snake.
