उदासिन्
उदास, --सिन् a. Indifferent,
apathetic, unconcerned.
--सः, --सिन् m.
1 A
stoic, philosopher.
--2 One who
has no passion for anything, a
religious mendicant in general.
--3
Indifference, apathy.
