उदासीन|उदासीनः
उदासीन pres. p.
1 Indifferent,
unconcerned, apathetic, passive;
तद्दर्शिनमुदासींनं त्वामेव पुरुष विदुः Ku. 2. 13
(taking no part in the creation of
the material universe); see सांख्य;
Pt. 1.
--2 (In law) Not involved in
any dispute.
--3 Neutral (as a king
or nation).
--नः
1 A stranger.
--2
A neutral, an indifferent person;
अरिमित्रोदासीनव्यवस्था Mu. 5;
Ms. 7. 158; Y. 1. 345; Bg. 6. 9.
--3 A
common acquaintance.
