<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदाहृत
उदाहृत p. p.
1 Said, uttered.
--2
Named, called; श्रुतान्वितो दशरथ
इत्युदाहृतः Bk. 1. 1.
--3 Illustrated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदाहृतिः|उदाहृति
उदाहृतिः f. An example,
illustration.
