उद्गै
उद्गै {c1c} P.
1 To sing in a loud
tone, sing aloud; उद्गास्यतामिच्छति
किन्नराणां Ku. 1. 8; गेयमुद्गातुकामा
Me. 86; to sing (in general); उद्गीयमानं
वनदेवताभिः R. 2. 12; निभृताक्षरमुज्जगे
Śi. 6. 20.
--2 To begin to sing.
--3
To sing or chant (applied to the
singing of Sāmaveda); साम
सामविदसंगमुज्जगौ Śi. 14. 21; cf. उद्गातृ.
--4
To announce, to celebrate in song.
--5 To sing before one (with acc.).
--6 To fill or make resonant with
song.
