उद्देशः|उद्देश
उद्देशः
1 Pointing to or at,
directing; सूर्योद्देशेन तिला दातव्याः Pt. 2
in the name of.
--2 Mention,
specification; सार्धप्रहरद्वयोद्देशे Pt. 5;
स्वरसंस्कारोद्देशः Nir.
--3 Illustration,
explanation, exemplification.
--4
Ascertainment, determination,
inquiry, investigation, search.
--5 A
brief statement or account; एष
तूद्देशतः प्रोक्तो विभूतेर्विस्तरो मया
Bg. 10. 40.
--6 Assignment, allotment.
--7
Stipulation, bargain.
--8 Object,
motive.
--9 A spot, region, place; अहो
प्रवातसुभगोयमुद्देशः Ś. 3; M. 3; वन˚ a
part of the forest.
--10 Upper region,
high position.
--11 (In phil.) The
enunciation of a thing by its name
(which is to be further discussed
and explained), the other two
processes being लक्षण and परीक्षा.
