उद्धुर
उद्धुर a. [उद्गता धूरस्मात्]
1 Freed
from a burden or yoke,
unrestrained, unchecked, free.
--2 Firm,
intrepid, bold; अभियोग˚ Mv. 6.
--3 Victorious, conquering.
--4 High,
loud (voice &c);
पितरमुद्धुरध्वनिमहाजनानुयातमानीय Dk. 104.
--5 Heavy,
full of; Śi. 5. 64.
--6 Thick, gross.
--7 Lively, cheerful.
--8 Able,
competent; Bv. 4. 40.
