उद्धारक
उद्धर्तृ, उद्धारक a.
1 One who raises
or lifts up.
--2 A sharer, coheir.
--3 One who recovers property. --m.
1 A destroyer, exterminator;
Y. 2. 271.
--2 A saviour, deliverer.
