H. 2. 24; K. 80, 102, 198, 204;
Y. 2. 276, Ms. 9. 270.
--3 An engine,
machine, apparatus, paraphernalia
(in general).
--4 Means of
subsistence, anything supporting life.
--5 A means or expedient; कर्म˚,
वेद˚, यज्ञ˚ &c.
--6 Fabricating,
composing, elaborating.
--7 The
insignia of royalty.
--8 The attendants
of a king.
