उपग्रह्
उपग्रह् {c9c} U.
1 To hold under,
seize or collect from below; as रसं.
--2 To seize, take, take possession
of; तवैव पादावुपगृह्य Rām.;
उपगृह्यास्पदं चैव Ms. 7. 184.
--3 To meet
with, obtain; स मृत्युमुपगृह्णाति
गर्भमश्वतरी यथा Chāṇ. 19.
--4 To subdue,
vanquish.
--5 To provide.
--6 To
conciliate, take as one's ally, favour,
support; तदुपगृहीतेन म्लेच्छराजबलेन
Mu. 1.
--7 To conceive with one's
mind, grasp mentally.
--8 To decide,
determine.
--9 To accept, approve.
