उपचयः|उपचय
उपचयः
1 Accumulation,
addition, accession.
--2 Increase, growth,
excess; बल˚ K. 105; स्वशक्त्युपचये
Śi. 2. 57; अंभसामुपचयाय 9. 32; भाग्य˚
Ratn. 1. 6 dawn of good fortune;
so ज्ञान˚, मांस˚.
--3 Quantity, heap.
--4 Prosperity, elevation, rise.
--5
The third, sixth, tenth and eleventh
house or position from the first
of a zodiacal sign (or a lagna q. v.).
--Comp.
--अपचय (du.) rise and
fall, prosperity and decay.
--भवनं
a species of the Daṇḍaka metre.
