popular idea was strengthened.
--4
Full of, abounding in, covered over
with; R. 9. 53; वियदुपचितमेघं
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0319-c" target="_blank">Page0319-c+ 54</a>]
