उपद्रवः|उपद्रव
उपद्रवः
1 An unhappy accident,
misfortune, calamity.
--2 Injury,
trouble, harm;
पुंसामसमर्थानामुपद्रवायात्मनो भवेत्कोपः Pt. 1. 324; निरुपद्रवं
स्थानं Pt. 1.
--3 Outrage, violence.
--4 A national distress (whether
caused by the king or famine,
seasons &c.).
--5 A national
disturbance, rebellion.
--6 A symptom, a
supervenient disease (one brought
on whilst a person is suffering from
another).
