उपधिः|उपधि
उपधिः [उप-धा-कि]
1 Fraud,
dishonesty; अरिषु हि विजयार्थिनः क्षितीशा
विदधति सोपधि संधिदूषणानि Ki. 1. 45,
see अनुपधि also.
--2 (In law)
Suppression of the truth, a false
suggestion; Ms. 8. 165.
--3
Terror, threat, compulsion, false
inducement; बलोपधिविनिर्वृत्तान्
व्यवहारान्निवर्तयेत् Y. 2. 31, 89.
--4 The
part of a wheel between the nave
and the circumference, or the wheel
itself.
--5 Foundation (with the
Buddhists).
