उपरम्
उपरम् {c1c} P. (Sometimes A. also).
1 To cease, end, terminate;
संगतावुपरराम च लज्जा Ki. 9. 44, 13. 69;
इत्युक्त्वोपरराम; युद्धमुपारमत् ceased &c.
--2 To cease or desist from, stop
(oft. with pres. part.);
व्यापादयन्नोपरराम Pt. 1; or with abl.; Bg. 2. 35;
Bk. 8. 54; 9. 51; or with inf.;
Ki. 4. 17; or by itself; Bk. 8. 55.
--3
To be quiet or calm; यत्रोपरमते चित्तं
Bg. 6. 20.
--4 To a wait, wait for.
--5
To make quiet (= Caus.) --Caus.
To cause to cease, stop, make quiet
or still.
