उपरत|उपरतः
उपरत p. p.
1 Stopped, ceased;
रजस्युपरते Ms. 5. 66.
--2 Dead; अद्य
दशमो मासस्तातस्योपरतस्य Mu. 4.
--3
Withdrawn or retired from;
रणात, कलहात् &c.
--4 One who is
disgusted with the world and has
retired from it.
--Comp.
--अरि a. having
no foe.
--कर्मन् a. ceasing from
works, not relying on worldly acts.
--विषयाभिलाष a. one who has
renounced all desire for worldly
things.
--स्पृह a. void of desire,
indifferent to worldly attachments or
possessions.
