उपलक्षणं|उपलक्षण
उपलक्षणं
1 Looking at, beholding,
observing, marking, ascertainment;
वेलोपलक्षणार्थं Ś. 4.
--2 A mark,
characteristic or distinctive feature:
उपलब्धमुपलक्षणं V. 4, 4. 33; उपलक्षणे
तृतीया Sk.
--3 Designation;
प्राद्युपलक्षणं Sk.
--4 Implying something
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-c" target="_blank">Page0329-c+ 57</a>]
that has not been actually
expressed, implication of something in
addition or any similar object
where only one is mentioned;
synecdoche of a part for the whole,
of an individual for the species, or
of a quality for that in which the
quality exists (स्वप्रतिपादकत्वे सति
स्वेतरप्रतिपादकत्वं); मंत्रग्रहणं
ब्राह्मणस्याप्युपलक्षणं P. II. 4. 80 Sk.; so अस्ति
नास्तेरुपलक्षणं &c.
