उपवेदः|उपवेद
उपवेदः ‘Inferior knowledge’, a
class of writings subordinate to the
Vedas. There are four such
Upavedas, one being attached to each of
the four Vedas:--thus आयुर्वेद or
Medicine to ऋग्वेद; (according to
some authorities such as Suśruta
it is a part of the Atharvaveda);
धनुर्वेद or military science to यजुर्वेद;
गांधर्ववेद or Music to सामवेद, and
स्थापत्य-शस्त्रं-वेद or Mechanics to अथर्ववेद.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

