उपसंहृ
उपसंहृ {c1c} P.
1 To draw or bring
together, collect.
--2 To sum or
wind up, conclude; इदानीमुपसंहरति;
प्रकृतमुपसंहरति Kull. on Ms. 1. 57.
--3 To contract; as कूर्मोंऽगानि.
--4 To
withdraw, take away, withhold:
छेत्तुः पार्श्वगतां छायां नोपसंहरते द्रुमः
H. 1. 59.
--5 To check, stop, curb.
--6 To absorb, destroy, annihilate.
