उपस्थानं|उपस्थान
उपस्थानं
1 Presence, proximity,
nearness.
--2 Approaching,
coming, appearance, coming into
the presence of;
युगपदाचार्ययोरुपस्थानं M. 1.
--3 (a) Worshipping,
waiting upon (with prayers);
attendance, service;
सूर्योपस्थानात्प्रतिनिवृत्तं पुरूरवसं मामुपेत्य V. 1;
सूर्यस्योपस्थानं कुर्वः V. 4; Y. 1. 22, 3. 282.
(b) Obeisance; greeting;
˚स्तोत्रपद्धतिं U. 1 a form of congratulatory
panegyric.
--4 Attending to,
guarding; रावणहित˚ Mv. 5.
--5 An abode.
--6 The sanctuary, any sacred place
(approached with respect).
--7 An
assembly.
--8 Remembrance,
recollection, memory; Y. 3. 160.
--9
Obtaining, getting.
