उपस्थित|उपस्थितः
उपस्थित p. p.
1 Approached,
arrived, come (person or thing);
तस्मिन्नंतरे भर्तोपस्थितः M. 1; ˚श्रेयोऽ
वमानिनं Ś. 6; K. 157; Ms. 3. 243;
Y. 2. 62; चिंतित˚ Ku. 6. 24 come
as soon as thought of.
--2 Close or
near, at hand, impending, drawing
near; उपस्थिता रजनी Ś. 3 the night
is at hand (arrived); ˚संप्रहारः
V. 1; ˚उदयं R. 3. 1 approaching its
fulfilment; Māl. 10; Ratn. 1;
R. 14. 39.
--3 Worshipped or waited
