without solicitation; अचिंतित˚
Pt. 2.
--5 Taken place, happened,
occurred, fallen to the lot;
V. 5. 16.
--6 Caused, occasioned,
produced, felt.
--7 Known.
--8 Cleansed,
clean.
--9 Followed by the particle
इति in the Pada text.
--तं
1 The
particle used in this manner.
--2
The position of words before and
after इति so used.
--3 Service,
worship.
