Offering of flowers &c., flowery gifts;
collection of flowers; म्लानपुष्पोपहारः
R. 5. 74; Ku. 6. 42. (b) Presents
(to gods) of flowers &c., materials
of worship; V. 3; Śi. 11. 36.
--6
Honour.
--7 Indemnity, presents
given as the price of peace;
H. 4. 110.
--8 Food distributed to
guests.
--9 Exultation, mirth
(consisting of laughter, dance, singing
&c.).
