उपाहित p. p.
1 Deposited, placed.
--2 Put on, worn.
--3 Connected,
joined; ˚श्यामरुचश्च चंदनाः Ki. 8. 12
showing.
--4 Ascribed or attributed
to (आरोपित).
--5 Agreed upon,
done by mutual agreement.
