उररी
उररी ind. A particle
implying (1) assent, admission or
acceptance. (In this sense it is usually
used with the roots कृ, भू, or अस्, and
it has the force of a गति or
preposition; उररीकृत्य not उररीकृत्वा. Other
forms of the word are उरी, उरुरी, ऊरी
and ऊरुरी); (2) extension.
