round the neck and upon the
breast. {2} an upper garment (for
boys).
--क्षतं injury to the chest.
--गामिन् a. going on the breast (as
a reptile), creeping, crawling.
--ग्रहः, --घातः a disease of the chest,
pleurisy.
--छदः, --त्राणं a cuirass,
breast-plate; Śi. 15. 80.
--जः,
--भूः, --उरसिजः, --उरसिरुहः the
female breast; रेजाते
रुचिरदृशामुरोजकुंभौ Śi. 8. 53, 25, 59.
--भूषणं an
ornament of the breast.
--सूत्रिका
a necklace of pearls hanging over
the breast.
--स्थलं the breast,
bosom.
