उल्लासः|उल्लास
उल्लासः
1 Joy, delight; सोल्लासं
U. 6; सकौतुकोल्लासं U. 2; उल्लासः
फुल्लपंकेरुहपटलपतन्मत्तपुष्पंधयानां S. D.
--2
Light, splendour.
--3 (In Rhet.) A
figure of speech in which a
reference is made to the merits
or demerits of one thing by
comparing or contrasting the merits or
demerits of another;
अन्यदीयगुणदोषप्रयुक्तमन्यस्य गुणदोषयोराधानमुल्लासः R. G.;
for examples, see R. G. ad loc.; cf.
Chandr. 5. 131-133.
--4 A division of
a book, such as chapter, section &c.;
as the ten Ullāsas of the
Kāvyaprakāśa.
--5 Beginning,
commencement.
