उल्लिख्
उल्लिख् {c6c} P.
1 To scratch, cut up,
scrape, tear or rip up, scarify;
जलदसंहतिमुल्लिखंत्यः Śi. 5. 20; K. 30; to
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0343-a" target="_blank">Page0343-a+ 54</a>]
