उषस्
उषस् f.
1 Dawn, morning;
प्रदीपार्चिरिवाषेसि R. 12. 1; उषसि उत्थाय
rising at day-break.
--2 Morning
light; cf. Aurora; (personified as
the daughter of heaven and sister
of the Ādityas).
--3 The deity that
presides over the morning and
evening twilights (used in dual); उषसौ
or उषासौ.
--4 The outer passage of the
ear.
--5 The Malaya range.
--सी The
end of the day, evening twilight.
--Comp.
--बुध् a. awakening with
the morning light, early awaked.
--बुध a. awakening early.
--(धः) {1}
fire; U. 6. {2} a child. {3} N. of a tree
(चित्रक).
