ऊरुः|ऊरु
ऊरुः (m.) [ऊर्णु-कर्मणि कु नुलोपश्च
Uṇ. 1. 30] The thigh; ऊरू तदस्य
यद्वैश्यः Rv. 10. 90. 12; Ms. 1. 31,
87; R. 12. 88; (at the end of fem.
compounds the form is ˚रुः or ˚रूः,
but more usually the latter; रंभोरूः,
वामोरूः, करभोरु Voc).
--Comp.
--अष्ठीवं
thigh and knee.
--उद्भव a. born or
sprung from the thigh; V. 1. 3.
--ग्लानिः f. weakness of the
thigh.
--ग्राहः = ˚स्तंभः q. v.
--ज,
--जन्मन्, --संभव a. sprung from the
thigh. (--m.) a Vaiśya.
--दघ्न,
--द्वयस, --मात्र a. as high as or
reaching the thighs, knee-deep.
--पर्वन्
m. n. the knee.
--फलकं the
thighbone, hip-bone.
--भिन्न a. having
a rent in the thigh; see
P. IV. 1. 52.
--स्तंभः paralysis of the lower
extremities, rheumatism of the
thigh.
--(भा) the plantain tree.
