going together or at the same time.
{5} gregarious.
--(रः) a rhinoceros.
--चरण a. having only one foot.
--चारिन् a. {1} living alone, solitary.
{2} going alone or with one
follower only.
--(णी) a loyal wife.
--चित्त
a. thinking of one thing only,
absorbed in one object.
--(त्तं) {1}
fixedness of thought upon one
object. {2} unanimity; एकचित्तीभूय
H. 1 unanimously; ˚ता fixedness
