एकादश
एकादश a. (शी f.)
1 Eleventh.
--2
Consisting of eleven.
--3 Lasting for
eleven months.
--शी
1 The eleventh
day of every fortnight of a lunar
month, sacred to Viṣṇu; (when
fasting is enjoined and is considered
to be productive of great religious
merit).
--2 Presentations of offerings
to deceased ancestors or Pitṛs on
the eleventh day after decease.
--शं
The number eleven.
--Comp.
--अहः
{1} a collection of 11 days. {2} a
sacrifice lasting for eleven days.
--उत्तमः N. of Śiva (the chief of the
11 Rudras).
--द्वारं the eleven holes
of the body; see ख.
--रुद्राः (pl.)
the eleven Rudras; see रुद्र.
