--2 Congruity or
fitness, as one of the several
circumstances which determine the exact
meaning of a word in a sentence
(such as संयोग, वियोग &c.);
सामर्थ्यमौचिती देशः कालो व्यक्तिः स्वरादयः S. D. 2;
in the example पातु वो दयितामुखं there
is औचिती or fitness in taking मुख to
mean सांमुख्यं (meeting) instead of
आननं.
--3 Habituation.
