--8 One of the 18
divisions of the continent.
--9 N. of
a people (pl.)
--का
1 A sort of
sandal.
--2 Scent of the lotus.
--Comp.
--त्रोटः --टिः a kind of fish.
--पत्र a. furnished with the feathers
of a heron.
--(त्रः) an arrow
furnished with a heron's feathers;
R. 2. 31; U. 4. 20; Mv. 1. 18.
--(त्रं) a
heron's feather fixed on an arrow.
--पत्रिन् m. = कंकपत्रः.
--माला {1} a
kind of musical instrument. {2}
beating time by the clapping of
hands.
--मुख वदन a. shaped like a
heron's mouth. (--खः --खं), --वदनं a
pair of tongs; Ve. 5. 1.
--शायः a
dog (sleeping like a heron).
