--3 Sharp,
piercing; ˚अंकुश Śānti. 1. 22.
--4
Full, developed, complete,
fullgrown, of mature age; कठोरगर्भां
जानकीं विमुच्य U. 1, 1. 49, 6. 25;
Māl. 6. 19; so कठोरताराधिपलांछनच्छविः
Śi. 1. 20; so अ˚ new, young;
Māl. 1. 2.
--5 (Fig.) Matured,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0370-c" target="_blank">Page0370-c+ 53</a>]
refined: कलाकलापालोचनकठारेमातिभिः
K. 7; ˚रीभूतः दिवसः U. 2 it
is noon-time.
--Comp.
--गर्भ a.
far advanced in pregnancy;
U. 1. 49.
--गिरिमाहात्म्यं a portion of
the Brahmāṇḍa Purāṇa.
