कंठ्|कण्ठ्
कंठ् {c1c} {c10c} U. (कंठति-ते, कंठयति-ते,
कंठित)
1 To mourn, grieve for.
--2
To miss, be anxious or long for,
remember with regret; (in this sense
generally used with the preposition
उद् and a noun in the gen., loc. or
dat. case).
