Spirituous liquor or wine in general;
कादंबरीसाक्षिकं प्रथमसौहृदमिष्यते Ś. 6;
or कादंबरीमदविघूर्णितलोचनस्य युक्तं हि
लांगलभृतः पतनं पृथिव्याम् Udb.;
˚रसभरेण K. 240.
--3 The fluid issuing from
the temples of a rutting elephant.
--4 An epithet of Sarasvatī, the
goddess of learning.
--5 A female
cuckoo.
--6 The rain-water collected
into clefts or hollow places.
--7 A
female bird (सारिका).
