श्रेष्ठार्थवाचकाः ॥.
--3 The Aśvattha tree.
--4 The lunar asterism called हस्त.
--5 Hair.
--रा, --री A female elephant.
--Comp.
--अनीकं the division of an
army consisting of elephant-corps.
--अशनः the Aśvattha tree.
--अरातिः {1} a lion. {2} Śarabha (a
fabulous animal with 8 feet).
--ग्रहः an
elephant-catcher.
