कुटुंबं, कुटुंबकं
1 A household, a
family; उदारचरितानां तु वसुधैव
कुटुंबकं H. 1. 70; Y. 2. 45;
Ms. 11. 12, 22; 8. 166.
--2 The duties and
cares of a family; तदुपहितकुटुंबः
R. 7. 71.
--बः, --बं
1 A kinsman, a
relation by descent or marriage.
--2
Offspring, progeny.
--3 A name.
--4
Race.
--5 A group, collection;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">Page0407-c+ 55</a>]
Vikr. 1. 92.
--Comp.
--कलहः, --हं internal or
domestic quarrels.
--भरः the burden
of the family; भर्त्रा तदर्पितकुटुंबभरेण
सार्धम् Ś. 4. 19; ˚चिंतया Pt. 5. 4.
--व्यापृत a. (a father) who is
provident and attentive to the good of the
family.
