कुशल|कुशलं|कुशलः
कुशल a.
1 Right, proper, good,
auspicious; Śi. 16. 41;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0414-b" target="_blank">Page0414-b+ 54</a>]
