कुसीद|कुसीदं|कुसीदः
कुसी(सि)द a. Lazy, slothful.
--दः (also written as कुशी-षी-द) A
money-lender, usurer.
--दं
1 Any
loan or thing lent to be repaid
with interest.
--2 Lending money,
usury, the profession of usury;
कुसीदाद् दारिद्र्यं परकरगतग्रंथिशमनात्
Pt. 1. 11; Ms. 1. 90; 8. 410;
Y. 1. 119.
--Comp.
--पथः usury, usurious
interest; any interest exceeding {5}
per cent.
--वृद्धिः f. interest on
money; कुसीदवृद्धिर्द्वैगुण्यं नात्येति
सकृदाहृता Ms. 8. 151.
