1 Doing,
manufacturing, making, performing.
--2 Action, deed.
--3 Creation, work,
composition; (तौ) स्वकृतिं गापयामास
कविप्रथमपद्धतिं R. 15. 33, 64, 69;
N. 22. 155.
--4 Magic, enchantment.
--5 Injuring, killing.
--6 The
number ‘20’
--7 An enchantress, a
witch.
--8 A knife.
--9 Way-laying;
hurting, injuring (Ved.).
