कोषं|कोष|कोषः
कोशः, --शं (षः, --षं) [कुश्(ष्)
आधारादौ घञ् कर्तरि अच् वा Tv.]
1 A vessel
for holding liquids, a pail.
--2 A
bucket, cup.
--3 A vessel in general.
--4 A box, cupboard, drawer, trunk.
--5 A sheath, scabbard.
--6 A case,
cover, covering.
--7 A store, mass;
Ms. 1. 99.
--8 A store-room.
--9 A
treasury, an apartment where money
is kept; Ms. 8. 419.
--10 Treasure,
money, wealth; निःशेषविश्राणितकोषजातं
