K. 45.
--11 Gold or silver wrought or
unwrought.
--12 A dictionary,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-c" target="_blank">Page0426-c+ 57</a>]
lexicon, vocabulary.
