--5 Power, ability.
--6 Plan,
design, purpose.
--7 Resolution,
determination.
--8 Desire, will.
--9
Fitness, adequacy, efficiency.
--10
Deliberation, consultation.
--11 Inspiration.
--12 Enlightenment.
--13 Offering,
worship.
--14 An Aśvamedha
sacrifice (these senses are mostly Vedic).
--15 The month Āṣāḍha.
--16
Excess of fondness or liking.
--17 An
organ. [cf. Gr. kratos; Zend
khratu].
