out, exclaim.
--4 To yell, howl.
--5
To neigh (as a horse).
--6 To roar.
--7
To creak (as a wheel). --{c10c} P. or
Caus.
1 To cry out continuously.
--2
To roar, rave.
--3 To cause to weep.
