क्षत्तृ
क्षत्तृ m. [क्षद् संज्ञायाम् तृच्
Uṇ. 2. 91]
1 One who cuts or carves
anything.
--2 An attendant, a
doorkeeper.
--3 A coachman, charioteer.
--4 A man born of a Śūdra man
and Kṣatriya woman; cf.
Ms. 10. 9.
--5 The son of a female slave; (
e. g. विदुर).
--6 Brahmā.
--7 A fish.
--8
One who fights from a chariot.
--9
The manager of a treasure (कोषाध्यक्ष).
