क्षारयति
क्षारयति Den. P.
1 To furnish or
mix with acid substances.
--2 To
torture a person with acid
substances.
--3 To speak ill of a person,
accuse.
--4 To abuse, calumniate,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0436-a" target="_blank">Page0436-a+ 54</a>]
traduce^1, censure; cf. आक्षर्.
