away (time); कालक्षेपः.
--7 Delay,
dilatoriness.
--8 Insult, abuse; क्षेपं
करोति चेद्दंड्यः Y. 2. 204; किं क्षेपे.
--9
Disrespect, contempt.
--10 Pride,
haughtiness.
--11 A nosegay.
--12 A
stroke (of an oar &c).
--13 Laying
on (as a paint &c.), besmearing.
--14
(in arith.) Addendum.
