गलित|गलितः
गलित p. p. [गल्-क्त]
1 Dropped
or fallen down.
--2 Melted.
--3
Oozed, flowing.
--4 Lost, vanished,
deprived.
--5 Untied, got loose.
--6
Emptied, leaked away.
