--नयन a. one who
has lost his eyes, blind.
--यौवन a.
one who has lost the bloom or charm
of youth, grown old;
गलितयौवना कामिनी Bh. 2. 56.
--वयस् a. being
in the decline of age, in declining
years; R. 3. 70.
