गातुः|गातु
गातुः
1 A song.
--2 A singer.
--3
A celestial chorister.
--4 The
male (Indian) cuckoo.
--5 The large
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0457-a" target="_blank">Page0457-a+ 55</a>]
black bee. --Ved.
--6 Going, motion.
--7 Free place for moving.
--8 The
earth.
--9 A refuge.
--10 way, course.
--11 Access, egress^1.
--12 Progress.
increase, welfare.
