गीता
गीता [गै कर्मणि क्त] A name given
to certain sacred writings in verse
(often in the form of a dialogue)
which are devoted to the exposition
of particular religious and
theosophical doctrines; e. g. शिवगीता,
रामगीता, भगवद्गीता. But the name
appears to be especially confined
tothe last, the Bhagavadgītā;
गीतासुगीता कर्तव्या किमन्यैः शास्त्रविस्तरैः ।
या स्वयं पद्मनाभस्य मुखपद्माद्विनिःसृता ॥
quoted by Śrīdharasvāmin.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0459-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गीतिः|गीति
गीतिः f. [गै-भावे क्तिन्]
