गौरी
गौरी
1 N. of Pārvatī; as in
गौरीनाथ.
--2 A young girl eight years
old; अष्टवर्षा भवेद्गौरी.
--3 A young
girl prior to menstruation, virgin,
maid.
--4 A woman with a white or
yellowish complexion.
--5 The earth.
--6 Turmeric.
--7 A yellow pigment
or dye; (called गोरोचना).
--8 The
wife of Varuṇa.
--9 The Mallikā
creeper.
--10 The Tulasī plant.
--11
The Mañjiṣṭhā plant.
--12 Speech.
--Comp.
--कांतः, --नाथः an epithet of
Śiva.
--गुरुः the Himālaya
mountain; गौरीगुरोर्गह्वरमाविवेश R. 2. 26;
Ki. 5. 21.
--जः N. of Kārtikeya.
--(जं) talc.
--पट्टः the horizontal
plate of the Liṅga or Phallus of Śiva,
symbolizing the female organ.
--पुत्रः
N. of Kārtikeya.
--ललितं a yellow
orpiment.
--सुतः {1} N. of कार्तिकेय.
{2} the son of a girl married when
{8} years old.
