ग्रासः|ग्रास
ग्रासः [ग्रस् कर्मणि घञ्]
1 A
mouthful, a quantity of anything equal
to a mouthful; Ms. 3. 133; 6. 28;
Y. 3. 55.
--2 Food, nourishment.
--3
The part of the sun or moon
eclipsed.
--4 The morsel bitten.
--5 The
act of swallowing.
--6 Slurring,
indistinct pronunciation; fault in the
pronunciation of the gutturals.
--7
(In geom.) A piece cut out by the
intersection of two circles.
--8 An
eclipse.
--Comp.
--आच्छादनं food
and clothing; i. e. bare subsistence.
--शल्यं any extraneous substance
lodged in the throat.
