called by name; U. 1. 48; सु˚
‘whose name is auspiciously
invoked’ a respectful way of
speaking of venerable or dead persons.
--विद्य a. versed in science,
learned.
--वेतन a. paid, remunerated.
--श्वापद a. the beasts in which are
confined or tracked.
