echo; अद्रिग्रहणगुरुभिर्गर्जितैर्नर्तयंथाः
Me. 44.
--9 The hand.
--10 An organ of
sense.
--11 A prisoner, captive.
--12
Taking by the hand, marrying.
--13
Taking captive, imprisonment.
--14
Gaining, obtaining, purchasing
--15 Choosing.
--16 Taking or
drawing up.
--17 Attraction.
--18
Containing, enclosing.
--19
Undertaking, undergoing.
--20 Service.
--21
Mentioning with praise, respecting.
--22 Acceptation, meaning.
--23
Assent, agreement.
--24 Inviting,
calling, addressing.
--Comp.
--अतः
close of study.
