घटक|घटकः
घटक a. [घटयति घट्-णिच् ण्वुल्]
1
Exerting oneself, striving for; एते
सत्पुरुषाः परार्थघटकाः स्वार्थं परित्यज्य
ये Bh. 2. 74.
--2 Bringing about,
accomplishing.
--3 Forming a
constituent part, constituent,
component.
--कः
1 A tree that
produces fruit without apparent
flowers.
--2 A match-maker, an
agent who ascertains genealogies
and negotiates matrimonial
alliances.
--3 A genealogist.
