घटनं|घटन
घटनं, --ना [घट्-ल्युट्]
1 Effort,
exertion.
--2 Happening, occurring
--3 Accomplishment, bringing about,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0475-c" target="_blank">Page0475-c+ 49</a>]
effecting; as in अघाटेतघटना.
--4
Joining, union, mixing or bringing
together, combination; तप्तेन
तप्तमयसा घटनाय योग्यं V. 2. 16;
देहद्वयार्धघटनारचितं K. 239: U. 3. 13.
--5
Making, forming, shaping.
--6
Motion.
--7 Strife, hostility;
Pt. 1. 159.
--8 (ना) A troop of elephants.
