घटोत्कचः|घटोत्कच
घटोत्कचः N. of a son of Bhīma
by a female demon named हिडिंबा.
He was a very powerful person and
fought valiantly in the great war
between the Pāṇḍavas and Kauravas on
the side of the former, but was slain by
Karṇa with the Śakti or missile he
had received from Indra; cf. Mu. 2. 15..
