1
Terrific, frightful, horrible, awful;
शिवाघोरस्वनां पश्चाद्बुबुधे विकृतेति तां
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0479-b" target="_blank">Page0479-b+ 30</a>]
