घ्रा
घ्रा {c1c} P. (जिघ्रति, जघ्रौ,
अघ्रात्-अघ्रासीत्, घ्रात-घ्राण)
1 To smell, smell at,
perceive by smell; स्पृशन्नपि गजो हंति
जिघ्रन्नपि भुजंगमः H. 3. 14; Bv. 1. 99.
--2 To kiss. --Caus. (घ्रापयति) To cause
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0479-c" target="_blank">Page0479-c+ 30</a>]
to smell; Bk. 15. 109. (Prepositions
like अव, आ, उप, वि, सं &c. are added
to this root without any material
change of meaning; गंधमाघ्राय चोर्व्याः
Me. 21; आमोदमुपजिघ्रंतौ R. 1. 43; see
Bk. 2. 10; 14. 12; R. 3. 3; 13. 70;
Ms. 4. 209 also).
