<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थक|चतुर्थकः
चतुर्थक a. The fourth.
--कः A
fever that returns or is repeated
every four days, a quartan.
--र्थिका
A weight equal to four Karṣas.
