चतुष्क|चतुष्कं
चतुष्क a. [चतुरवयवं चत्वारोऽवयवा
यस्य वा कन्]
1 Consisting of four.
--2 Increased by four; द्विकं त्रिकं
चतुष्कं च पंचकं च शतं समं
Ms. 8. 142 (i. e. 102, 103, 104, or 105,
or interest at the rate of 2 to 5 per
cent).
--ष्कं
1 The number ‘four.’
--2 A collection of four.
--3 A
crossway.
--4 A quadrangular courtyard.
--5 A hall resting on (four)
pillars, a hall or saloon in general;
Ku. 5. 68, 7. 9.
--6 A necklace of
four strings.
--ष्की
1 A large
foursided pond.
--2 A mosquito curtain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0483-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्किका
चतुष्किका The number ‘four’.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0483-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्टय|चतुष्टयं
चतुष्टय a. (यी f.) [चत्वारोऽवयवा
विधा अस्य तयप्]
1 Four fold,
consisting of four; पुराणस्य कवेस्तस्य चतु
र्मुखसमीरिता । प्रवृत्तिरासीच्छब्दानां
चरितार्था चतुष्टयी ॥ Ku. 2. 17.
--यं A
group or collection of four;
एकैकमप्यनर्थाय किमु यत्र चतुटयं H. Pr. 11;
Ku. 7. 62; मासचतुष्टयस्य भोजनं
H. 1.
--2 A square.
--3 The first, fourth,
seventh, and tenth signs of the
zodiac.
--4 The centre of a circle.
