चन
चन ind. Not, not also, even
not (not used by itself, but found
used in combination with the
pronoun किम् or its derivatives, such
as कद्, कथं, क्व, कदा, कुतः to which it
imparts an indefinite sense; see
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0484-b" target="_blank">Page0484-b+ 56</a>]
under किम्). Note. Some regard
चन to be not a separate word, but
a combination of च and न.
