चंपकः|चम्पक|चंपक|चम्पकं|चम्पकः
चंपकः [चंप्-ण्वुल्]
1 A tree
bearing yellow, fragrant flowers.
--2 A
kind of perfume.
--कं
1 A flower
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0486-a" target="_blank">Page0486-a+ 56</a>]
of this tree; अद्यापि तां
कनंकचपकदामगौरीं Ch. P. 1.
--2 The fruit of a
variety of plantain.
--Comp.
--माला
{1} N. of a neck-ornament worn by
women. {2} a garland of Campaka
flowers. {3} a kind of metre (see
App.).
--रंभा a species of plantain.
