चंपूः
चंपूः f. A kind of elaborate and
highly artificial composition in which
the same subject is continued
through alterations in prose and
verse; गद्यपद्यमयं काव्यं
चंपूरित्यभिधीयते S. D. 569; for instance भोजचंपू,
नलचंपू, भारतचंपू &c.
