चरित|चरितं
चरित p. p. [चर् कर्मणि क्त]
1
Wandered or roamed over, gone.
--2
Performed, practised.
--3 Attained.
--4
Known.
--5 Offered; Ś. 4. 21.
--6
Acted, behaved; Ś. 5. 16.
--तं
1
Going, moving, course.
--2 Acting,
doing, practice, behaviour, acts, deeds;
उदारचरितानां H. 1. 70; सर्वं खलस्य
चरितं मशकः करोति 1. 81.
--3 Life,
biography, adventures, history,; उत्तरं
रामचरितं तत्प्रणीतं प्रयुज्यते U. 1. 2;
दिवौकसरत्वच्चरितं लिखंति Ś. 7. 5; so
दशकुमारचरितं &c.
--4 Nature.
--5
Fixed law, due or proper observance.
--Comp.
--अर्थ a. {1} that has
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0487-a" target="_blank">Page0487-a+ 56</a>]
accomplished its end or desired object,
successful; रामरावणयोर्युद्धं
चरितार्थमिवाभवत् R. 12. 87; चरितार्थैव भारती
10. 36; Ki. 13. 62. {2} satisfied,
contented. {3} effected, accomplished.
{4} significant, true to its sense;
Ku. 2. 17. {5} appropriate, fit;
Ku. 4. 45. ˚ता the attainment of the
desired object; Ś. 5.
