चलन|चलनं|चलनः
चलन a. [चल् भावे ल्युट्] Moving,
tremulous, trembling, shaking.
--नः
1 A foot.
--2 A deer.
--नं
1
Trembling, shaking or shaking motion;
चलनात्मकं कर्म T. S.; हस्त˚, जानु˚
&c.;
तरलदृगंचलचलनमनोहरवदनजनितरतिरागं Gīt. 11.
--2 Turning or
leaving off.
--3 Roaming, wandering.
--नी
1 A short petticoat worn by
common women.
--2 The rope for
tying an elephant.
