चाटुः|चाटु
चाटुः, --टु n.
1 [चट्-उण्] Pleasing
or agreeable words, sweet or
coaxing speech, flattery (especially of a
lover to his sweet-heart); प्रियः
प्रियायाः प्रकरोति चाटुं Rs. 6. 14;
विरचितचाटुवचनरचनं चरणरचितप्रणिपातं
Gīt. 11; Amaru. 83; Pt. 1. 175;
Śānti. 3. 14; Ch. P. 20; (the greater part
of the 10th canto of गीतगोविंद
consists of such coaxing).
--2 Distinct
or clear speech.
--3 Endearing words
or acts; Māl. 10. 1.
--Comp.
--उक्तिः
f. {1} flattering or coaxing language.
{2} service.
--उल्लोल, --कार a.
speaking agreeably or sweetly, flatterer;
शिप्रावातः प्रियतम इव प्रार्थनाचाटुकारः
Me. 31.
--पटु a. skilful in using
flattering or coaxing language, an
accomplished flatterer.
--बटुः a
jester, buffoon.
--लोल a. elegantly
tremulous.
--शतं a hundred
entreaties, repeated coaxing;
पटुचाटुशतैरनुकूलं Gīt. 2; गजपुंगवस्तु धीर
विलोकयति चाटुशतैश्च भुंक्ते Bh. 2. 31.
