चाणूरः|चाणूर
चाणूरः A celebrated wrestler in
the service of Kaṃsa. When
Kṛṣṇa was taken by Akrūra to
Mathurā, Kaṃsa sent this
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0489-b" target="_blank">Page0489-b+ 54</a>]
redoubtable wrestler to fight with him;
but in the duel which ensued,
Kṛṣṇa whirled him round and
round several times and smashed his
head.
--Comp.
--मर्दनः, --सूदनः N. of
Kṛṣṇa.
