चीरं|चीर
चीरं [चि-क्रन् दीर्घश्च; Uṇ. 2. 26]
1 A rag, a tattered cloth, a long
stripe or garment; Ms. 6. 6.
--2 A
bark.
--3 A cloth or garment in
general.
--4 A necklace of pearls
consisting of four strings.
--5 A
stripe, stroke, line.
--6 A manner
of writing with strokes.
--7 Lead.
--8 A crest.
--9 The dress of a
Buddhist priest.
