जनक|जनकः
जनक a. (निका f.) [जन्-णिच् ण्वुल्]
Generating, producing, causing;
क्लेशजनक, दुःखजनक &c.
--कः
1 A
father, progenitor.
--2 N. of a
famous king of Videha or Mithilā,
foster-father of Sītā. He was
remarkable for his great knowledge,
good works, and holiness. After
the abandonment of Sītā by Rāma,
he became an anchorite-indifferent
to pleasure or pain-and spent
his time in philosophical
discussions. The sage याज्ञवल्क्य was his
priest and adviser.
--Comp.
--आत्मजा, --तनया, --नंदिनी, --सुता epithets of
Sītā, daughter of king Janaka.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0505-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
