जन्य|जन्यं|जन्यः
जन्य a. [जन् कर्तरि यत्]
1 To be born
or produced.
--2 Born, produced.
--3
(At the end of comp.) Born from,
occasioned by.
--4 Belonging to a race
or family.
--5 Vulgar, common.
--6
National.
--7 Relating to, or fit for
men.
--न्यः
1 A father.
--2 A friend,
attendant or relative of a
bridegroom; Māl. 6. 2.
--3 A common
man.
--4 A report, rumour.
--न्यं
1 Birth, production, creation.
--2
That which is born or created, a
created thing, an effect (opp.
जनक); जन्यानां जनकः कालः
Bhāṣā P. 45; जनकस्य स्वभावो हि जन्ये तिष्ठति
निश्चितं Śabdak.
--3 The body.
--4 A
portent occurring at birth.
--5 A
market, a fair.
--6 War, battle; तत्र
जन्यं रघोर्घोरं पर्वतीयैर्गणैरभूत् R. 4. 77.
--7 Censure, abuse.
--8 A community,
nation.
--9 People.
--10 Report,
rumour.
--न्या
1 The friend of a mother.
--2 The relation of a bride, a bride's
maid; याहीति जन्यामवदत्कुमारी
R. 6. 30.
--3 Pleasure, happiness.
--4
Affection.
