जामित्रं|जामित्र
जामित्रं The seventh zodiacal sign
from the natal sign (लग्न); तिथौ
च जामित्रगुणान्वितायां Ku. 7. 1. (
जामित्रं लग्नात्सप्तमं स्थानं Malli.) Note--Some
derive the word from जाया, because
in astrology, the जामित्र sign
indicates the future good-luck of one's
wife (जायामित्रं?); but the word is
obviously connected with the Greek
diametron.
