जुष्
जुष् {vI.v} {c6c} A. (जुषते-जुष्ट)
1 To be
pleased or satisfied.
--2 To be
favourable or propitious.
--3 To like, be
found of, take pleasure or delight
in, enjoy; सत्त्वं जुषाणस्य भवाय देहिनां
