तम्
तम् {c4c} P. (ताम्यति, तांत)
1 To choke,
be suffocated.
--2 To be exhausted or
fatigued; ललितशिरीषपुष्पहननैरपि
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0531-b" target="_blank">Page0531-b+ 57</a>]
ताम्यति यत् Māl. 5. 31.
--3 To be
distressed (in body or mind), be uneasy
or pained, pine, waste away;
प्रविशति मुहुः कुंजं गुंजन्मुहुर्बहु ताम्यति Gīt. 5;
गाढोत्कंठा ललितलुलितैरंगकैस्ताम्यतीति
Māl. 1. 15, 9. 33; तृष्णे मुधा ताम्यसि
Mu. 3. 1; Amaru. 7.
--4 To stop,
become immovable.
--5 To wish,
desire. --Caus. (तमयति) To suffocate,
choke.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0531-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

