तम|तमं|तमः
तम A Taddhita affix of the
superlative degree applied to nouns,
adjectives, and also to verbs and
indeclinables in which latter case it
is changed to तमाम्; अश्व˚ Pt. 5.
‘the best horse’; सुहृत्तम Mu. 1; so
पचतितमाम्. It is also added to
pronouns in the sense of ‘one of many’;
e. g. कतम, यतम, ततम &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0531-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

