Amaru. 27.
--3 Splendid, sparkling,
glittering; Pt. 1. 190.
--4 Liquid.
--5
Libidinous, wanton.
--6 Hollow.
--7 Extensive, wide.
--लः
1 The
central gem of a necklace; मुक्तामयोऽ
प्यतरलमध्यः Vās. 35; or
हारांस्तारांरतरलगुटिकान् (Malli. considers this as
an interpolation in Meghadūta).
--2 A necklace.
--3 A level surface.
--4 Bottom, depth.
--5 A diamond.
--6 Iron.
--7 Thorn-apple.
--ला
1
Rice-gruel.
--2 Spirituons liquor.
--3
A bee.
--Comp.
--नयना, --लोचना a
woman with rolling or tremulous
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0532-b" target="_blank">Page0532-b+ 55</a>]
eyes.
