तिरस्
तिरस् ind. [तॄ-असुन् स्वरादि]
1
Crookedly, obliquely, awry; स
तिर्यङ् यस्तिरोंऽचति Ak.
--2 Without;
apart from.
--3 Secretly, covertly,
invisibly.
--4 Across, beyond, over.
--5 Indirectly, badly. [In classical
literature तिरस् is rarely used by
itself, but chiefly occurs in
composition with (a) कृ, (b) धा, and (c)
भू; see below.]
--Comp.
--कुड्य,
--प्राकार a. looking through a wall.
--गत a. vanished, disappeared.
--वर्ष a. protected from rain.
