<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलित
तुलित p. p.
1 Weighed,
counterpoised.
--2 Compared, likened, equal
led; Bh. 3. 36; see तुल्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
