[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">Page0543-b+ 53</a>]
and then setting it on fire.
--अंबु n.
--उदकं, --उत्थं sour rice-gruel or
barley gruel.
--ग्रहः, --सारः fire.
