1 Pleasing, satisfying.
--2
Satisfaction, pleasure.
--3 Satiety,
fulness.
--4 One of the five daily
Yajñas (performed by men),
presenting libations of water to the
Manes of the deceased ancestors
(पितृयज्ञ).
--5 Fuel for the sacred
fire.
--6 Food.
--7 Filling the eyes
with oil &c.
--Comp.
--इच्छुः an
epithet of Bhīṣma.
