त्वच्
त्वच् f.
1 Skin(of men, serpents
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0552-b" target="_blank">Page0552-b+ 54</a>]
&c.); U. 4. 20; Mv. 1. 18.
