<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दक्षिणात्
दक्षिणात् ind. On the right, from
the south, southward.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0554-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दक्षिणाहि
दक्षिणाहि ind.
1 Far on the right.
--2 Far in the south, to the south of
(with abl.); दक्षिणाहि ग्रामात् Sk.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0554-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दक्षिणीकृ
दक्षिणीकृ {c8c} U.
1 To place on the
right side.
--2 To keep the right side
towards any one (as a mark of
respect); cf. प्रदक्षिण.
