दघ्
दघ् {vI.v} {c5c} P. (दघ्नोति)
1 To kill,
hurt.
--2 To go, leap.
--3 To
protect. {vII.v} {c4c} P. (दघ्यति) Ved.
1
To go, flow.
--2 To reach, attain.
--3 To go away.
