दंभोलिः|दम्भोलि|दंभोलि|दम्भोलिः
दंभोलिः
1 Indra's thunderbolt.
--2 A diamond.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0558-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
