--आढकः {1} foam. {2} a cuttle-fish bone.
{3} a ditch, moat. {4} a hurricane,
high wind. {5} red chalk. {6} wild
sesamum. {7} the Kunda creeper.
{8} a Śūdra. {9} the headman of a
village. 10 an elephant's ear.
--आढ्यं mud on the banks of a
river.
--कपाढः a folded leaf.
--कोमलं a lotus.
--कोषः the
Kunda creeper.
