दशा
दशा
1 The threads at the end of
a piece of woven cloth, the fringe
of a garment, the skirt, edge or
hem of a garment; रक्तांशुकं
पवनलोलदशं वहंती Mk. 1. 20; छिन्ना
इवांबरपटस्य दशाः पतंति 5. 4.
--2 The
wick of a lamp; Bh. 3. 129;
Ku. 4. 30.
--3 Age or time of life;
see दशांत below.
--4 A period or
stage of life; as बाल्य, यौवन, &c.;
R. 5. 40.
--5 A period in general.
--6 State, condition, circumstances;
नीचैर्गच्छत्युपरि च दशा चक्रनामंक्रंमंण
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0560-b" target="_blank">Page0560-b+ 56</a>]
