दृ
दृ {vI.v} {c6c} A. (द्रियते, दृत; desid.
दिदरिषते) (rarely used by itself,
usually found in combination with आ)
1
To respect, honor, worship,
reverence; द्वितीयाद्रियते सदा H. Pr. 7;
Mv. 7. 3; Bk. 6. 55.
--2 To care for,
mind; usually with न.
