दृश्
दृश् a. (At the end of comp.)
1
Seeing, superintending, surveying,
viewing.
--2 Discerning, knowing.
--3 Looking like, appearing. --f.
1
Seeing, viewing, perceiving.
--2 The
eye, sight; संदधे दृशमुदग्रतारकां
R. 11. 69.
--3 Knowledge.
--4 The
number ‘two’.
