--क्षेपः,
--ज्या the sine of the zenith-distance.
--तुल्य a. coincident with
observation, or an observed place
(in astr.).
--पथः the range
of sight.
--पातः a look, glance.
--प्रिया beauty, splendour.
--भक्तिः
f. a look of love, an amorous glance.
