देशीय
देशीय a. [देशे भवः --छ]
1 Belonging
to a province, provincial.
--2 Native,
local.
--3 Inhabiting any country
(at the end of comp.); as in
मगधदेशीय, तद्देशीय, वंगदेशीय &c.
--4 Not
far or distant from, almost,
bordering on (used as an affix at the end
of words); अष्टादशवर्षदेशीयां कन्यां द
दर्श K. 131 ‘a girl about 18 years old
(whose age bordered on 18);
R. 18. 39; so पटुदेशीय &c.
