देश्य|देश्यं|देश्यः
देश्य a. [दिश्-कर्भणिण्यत् देश-यत् वा]
1 To
be pointed out or proved.
--2 Local,
provincial.
--3 Born in a country,
native.
--4 Genuine, of genuine
descent.
--5 Being on the spot or place
(where anything is due).
--6 Not
far from, almost; see देशीय above.
--श्यः
1 An eye-witness of anything
अभियोक्ता दिशेद्देश्यं Ms. 8. 52.-53.
--2
The inhabitant of a country.
--श्यं
The statement of a question or
argument, the thing to be proved or
substantiated (पूर्वपक्ष).
