नवे यौवने 1. 72.
--2 An infidel, an
atheist.
--3 N. of a spell.
--न्या
1 A
nurse.
--2 Coriander.
--न्यं
1 Wealth,
treasure.
--2 Coriander.
--Comp.
--वादः {1} an expression of thanks,
thanksgiving. {2} praise, applause.
