epithet of Brahmā, the creator of the
world; मन्ये दुर्जनचित्तवृत्तिहरणे
धातापि भग्नोद्यमः H. 2. 165; R. 13. 6;
Śi. 1. 13; Ku. 7. 44; Ki. 12. 33.
--4
An epithet of Viṣṇu.
--5 The soul.
--6 N. for the seven sages (सप्तर्षि) being
the first creation of Brahmā; cf.
Ku. 6. 9.
--7 A married woman's
paramour, adulterer.
--8 One of the
forty-nine winds.
--9 An arranger.
--10 One who nourishes.
--Comp.
--पुत्रः an epithet of Sanatkumāra.
