<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धीरता
धीरता
1 Fortitude, courage,
strength of mind; विपत्तौ च महाल्ँलोके
धीरतामनुगच्छति H. 3. 44; V. 2.
--2
Suppression of jealousy &c.
--3 Gravity,
solemnity (as shown by silence &c.);
प्रत्यादेशान्न खलु भवतो धीरतां कल्पयामि
Me. 114.
--4 Steadiness, firmness.
--5
Wisdom, cleverness.
--6 Refusal.
(For other meanings see धैर्य).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0598-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धीरा
धीरा The heroine of a poetic
composition who, though jealous of her
husband or lover, suppresses all outward
manifestation or expression of her
resentment in his presence, or as the
Rasamañjarī puts it,
व्यंग्यकोपप्रकाशिका धीरा; see S. D. 102-105 also.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0598-b" target="_blank">Page0598-b+ 56</a>]
--Comp.
--अधीरा the heroine of a
poetic composition who, being jealous
of her husband or lover, alternately
expresses and conceals her jealousy;
(व्यंग्याव्यंग्यकोपप्रकाशिका धीराधीरा
Rasamañjarī).
