a dusty, greyish, or dusky-white
colour, grey; शशी दिवसधूसरः
Bh. 2. 56; Ku. 4. 4, 46; R. 5. 42; 16. 17;
Śi. 17. 41.
--रः
1 The grey colour.
--2
A donkey.
--3 A camel.
--4 A pigeon.
--5 An oilman.
--6 Anything of a
grey colour.
