ध्यान|ध्यानं
ध्यान [ध्यै-भावे-ल्युट्]
1 Meditation,
reflection, thought, contemplation;
ज्ञानाद् ध्यानं विशिष्यते Bg. 12. 12;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0602-b" target="_blank">Page0602-b+ 53</a>]
Ms. 1. 12, 6. 72.
--2 Especially,
abstract contemplation, religious
meditation; तदैव ध्यानादवगतोऽस्मि Ś. 7;
R. 1. 73.
--3 Divine intuition or
discernment.
--4 Mental
representation of the personal attributes of a
deity; इति ध्यानं.
--Comp.
--गम्य a.
attainable by meditation only.
--तत्पर, --निष्ठ, --पर a. lost in thought,
absorbed in meditation,
contemplative.
--मात्रं mere thought or
reflection.
--योगः profound
meditation.
--स्थ a. absorbed in
meditation, lost in thought.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0602-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
