trademark.
--8 The organ of
generation, (of any animal, male or
female).
--9 One who prepares and
sells liquors.
--10 A house situated
to the east of any object.
--11 Pride.
--12 Hypocrisy.
--13 A skull carried
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0603-b" target="_blank">Page0603-b+ 56</a>]
on a staff (as a mark of ascetics).
