नयनं|नयन
नयनं [नी-करणे ल्युट्]
1 Leading,
guiding; conducting, managing.
--2
Taking, bringing to or near,
drawing.
--3 Ruling, governing.
--4
Obtaining.
--5 The eye.
--6 Passing,
spending (as time).
--ना, --नी The
pupil of the eye.
--Comp.
--अभिराम a.
gladdening the sight, lovely to
behold.
--(मः) the moon.
--आमोषिन् a.
blinding the sight, obscuring.
--उत्सवः {1} a lamp. {2} delight of
the eyes. {3} any lovely object.
--उपांतः the corner of the eye;
Ku. 4. 23.
--गोचर a. visible, within the
range of sight.
--छदः an eyelid.
--जलं, --वारि n. tears.
--पथः the range
of sight.
--पुटं the cavity of the eye.
--विषयः {1} any visible object. {2}
the horizon. {3} the range of sight.
--सलिलं tears; Me. 39.
