<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नायिका
नायिका
1 A mistress.
--2 A wife.
--3 The heroine of a poetic
composition. (According to S. D. a नायिका
is of three kinds स्वा or स्वीया, अन्या
or परकीया, and साधारणस्त्री. For
further classification, see S. D. 97-112,
and Rasamañjarī 3-94; cf. अन्यस्त्री
also).
--4 A kind of musk.
