नाशः [नश्-मावे घञ्]
1
Disappearance; गता नाशं तारा
उपकृतमसाधाविव जने Mk. 5. 25.
--2 Frustration,
destruction, ruin, loss; Bg. 2. 40;
R. 8. 88, 12. 67; so वित्त˚, बुद्धि˚ &c.
--3
Death.
--4 Misfortune, calamity.
--5
Abandonment, desertion.
--6 Flight,
retreat.
--7 (In arith.) Elimination.
--8 Want of apprehension,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0616-c" target="_blank">Page0616-c+ 55</a>]
non-perception (अनुपलंभ).
