निग्रह्
निग्रह् {c9c} P.
1 To keep or hold
down, keep in check.
--2 To curb,
restrain, suppress, control; निगृह्य
शोकं K. 25; स्वकं तेजो निगृह्य
Pt. 3. 174; Bg. 2. 68, R. 5. 59, 14. 85.
--3 To stop, obstruct; निगृहीतो बलाद
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0619-c" target="_blank">Page0619-c+ 57</a>]
द्वांरि Mb.
--4 To punish, chastise;
Ms. 8. 310; 9. 308.
--5 To seize, catch,
apprehend, lay hold of; तमार्यगृह्यं
निगृहीतधेनुः R. 2. 33.
--6 To close
or contract (as eyes);
माथुरोऽक्षिणी निगृह्य Mk. 2.
--7 To subdue,
conquer, overpower, प्रज्ञया निग्रहीतुं
शक्यः Mu. 1; 1. 26.
--8 To draw in,
restrain; निगृह्यंतामभीशवः Ś. 1.
