<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदानं|निदान
निदानं
1 A band, rope, halter.
--2 A rope for tying up a calf.
--3 A
primary cause, the first or essential
cause; निदिनमिक्ष्वाकुकुलस्य संततेः
R. 3. 1; अथवा बलमारंभो निदानं क्षयसंपदः
Śi. 2. 94.
--4 A cause in general;
मुंच मयि मानमनिदानं Gīt. 5.
--5 (In
medicine) Inquiry into the causes
of a disease, pathology.
--6
Diagnosis of a disease.
--7 End,
termination.
--8 Purity, purification,
correctness.
--9 Claiming the reward of
penitential acts.
--Comp.
--स्थानं one
of the departments of medical
science.
