--2
Attacking, falling upon, a spring,
leap; R. 2. 60.
--3 Casting, hurling,
discharging; Ku. 3. 15.
--4
Descent, fall; निशितनिपाताः शराः
Ś. 1. 10.
--5 Dying, death;
