--6 Accidental occurrence or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0623-a" target="_blank">Page0623-a+ 55</a>]
mention.
--7 An irregular form,
irregularity, putting down as
irregular or exceptional; एते निपाताः,
निपातोयं &c.
--8 A particle, an
indeclinable; see P. I. 4. 56.
--9 The
opposite extremity, the lower end.
