नियत|नियतः
नियत p. p.
1 Curbed, restrained.
--2 Subdued, controlled,
self-possessed, self-governed.
--3
Abstemious, temperate.
--4 Attentive,
intent.
--5 Fixed, permanent, constant,
steady.
--6 (a) Certain, settled,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0625-b" target="_blank">Page0625-b+ 57</a>]
sure; Pt. 1. 284. (b) Fixed;
प्रकृतिनियतत्वादकृतकः U. 6. 14.
--7
Inevitable.
--8 Positive, definite.
--9 Forming the subject of
consideration, relevant or irrelevant;
see तुल्ययोगिता.
--10 Maintained,
observed (as a vow &c.); Ś. 7. 20.
--तं ind.
1 Always, constantly.
--2
Positively, certainly, invariably,
inevitably, surely.
--3 Forcibly.
