निरस्
निरस् {c4c} P.
1 To cast out, throw
or drive away, give up, quit, drive
or send back;
निरस्तगांभीयर्मपात्तपुष्पकं Śi. 1. 55, 9. 63.
--2 To destroy,
ward off, defeat, annihilate; dispel;
अह्नाय तावदरुणेन तमो निरस्तं R. 5. 70;
रक्षांसे वेदीं परितो निरास्थत् Bk. 1. 12,
2. 36.
--3 To turn out, remove,
expel, banish; गृहान्निरस्ता न तेन
वैदेहसुता मनस्तः R. 14. 84.
--4 To
throw out, discharge (as arrows).
--5 To reject, repudiate, decline.
--6 To refute, confute, controvert (as
arguments).
--7 To eclipse, obscure,
throw into the back-ground;
Bk. 1. 3.
--8 To tear out, strip off.
--9 To
stretch out (as a hand).
