निरुक्त|निरुक्तं
निरुक्त a.
1 Expressed,
pronounced, explained, defined.
--2 Loud,
distinct.
--क्तं
1 Explanation,
derivation, etymological interpretation.
--2 N. of one of the six Vedāṅgas,
that which contains glossarial
explanation of obscure words, especially
those occurring in the Vedas; नाम
च धातुजमाह निरुक्ते Nir.
--3 N. of a
celebrated commentary on the
Nighaṇṭus by Yāska.
--Comp.
--कारः
N. of the sage Yāska.
--जः one of
the twelve kinds of sons allowed by
the old Hindu law (= क्षेत्रज q. v.).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
