निर्मा|निर्म्मा
निर्मा {c3c} A., {c2c} P.
1 To make,
create, bring into existence; निर्मातुं
प्रभवेन्मनोहरमिदं रूपं पुराणो मुनिः
V. 1. 9; यस्मादेष सुरेंद्राणां मात्राभ्यो निर्मितो
नृपः Ms. 7. 5; 1. 13.
--2 (a) To build,
form, construct; स्नायुनिर्मिता एते पाशाः
H. 1 (b) To cause to be settled,
colonize (as a town &c.); निर्ममे निर्ममोऽ
र्थेषु मथुरां मधुराकृतिः R. 15. 28.
--3 To
cause, produce; शलाकांजननिर्मितेव
Ku. 1. 47.
--4 To compose, write;
स्वनिर्मितया टीकया समेतं काव्यं.
--5 To
prepare, manufacture in general.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्माणं|निर्माण|निर्म्माण|निर्म्माणं
निर्माणं
1 Measuring, meting out;
यतश्चाध्वकालनिर्मार्णं P. I. 4. 31 Vārt.
--2 Measure, reach, extent;
अयमप्राप्तनिर्माणः (बालः) Rām. ‘not having
reached the full measure of growth’.
--3 Producing, forming, making,
creation, formation, manufacture; ईदृशो
निर्माणभागः परिणतः U. 4.
--4 A
creation, created thing or object, form;
निर्माणमेव हि तदादरलालनीयं Māl. 9. 49.
--5 A shape, make, figure;
शरीरनिर्माणसदृशो नन्वस्यानुभावः Mv. 1.
--6
Composition, work.
--7 A building.
--8 A
part, portion.
--9 Essence, pith,
marrow.
--10 (With Buddhists)
Transformation.
--णा Fitness, propriety,
decorum.
