निर्माल्य a. Pure, clean, stainless.
--ल्यं
1 Purity, clearness,
stainlessness.
--2 The remains of an offering to
a deity, such as flowers;
निर्माल्योज्झितपुष्पदामनिकरे का षट्पदानां रतिः
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0634-b" target="_blank">Page0634-b+ 56</a>]
Ś. Til. 10.
--3 Flowers used and cast off,
faded or withered flowers; निर्माल्यरैथ
ननृतेऽवधीरितानां Śi. 8. 60.
--4 Remains
in general.
