निर्वहणं|निर्वहण|निर्व्वहण|निर्व्वहणं
निर्वहणं
1 End, completion;
Śi. 14. 63.
--2 Maintainig, carrying to the
end, sustaining; मानस्य निर्वहणं
Amaru. 24.
--3 Destruction, annihilation.
--4 (In dramas). The catastrophe,
the last stage in which the
action of the play is brought
to a head, the denouement;
तत्किंनिमित्तं कुकविकृतनाटकस्येव
अन्यन्मुखेऽन्यन्निर्वहणे Mu. 6.
