निर्वापणं|निर्वापण|निर्व्वापणं
निर्वापणं
1 An offering, oblation,
a funeral oblation.
--2 A gift
donation.
--3 Putting out,
extinguishing.
--4 Pouring out,
scattering, sowing (as seed).
--5 (a)
Offering, giving. (b) Offering
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0635-c" target="_blank">Page0635-c+ 57</a>]
oblations (especially funeral).
--6
Allaying, alleviation, pacification;
कर्तव्यानि दुःखितैर्दुःखनिर्वापणानि U. 3.
--7 Annihilation.
--8 Killing,
slaughter.
--9 Cooling, refreshing;
शरीरनिर्वापणाय Ś. 3.
--10 A refrigerant or
cooling application.
