निर्विण्ण|निर्व्विण्ण|निर्व्विण्णः
निर्विण्ण p. p.
1 Despondent,
depressed; Mk. 1. 14.
--2 Overcome
with fear or sorrow.
--3 Emaciated
with grief.
--4 A bused, degraded.
--5
Disgusted with anything;
मत्स्याशनस्य निर्विण्णः Pt. 1.
--6 Impaired,
decayed.
--7 Humble, modest.
--8
Known, certain.
