--2
Dripping, trickling, distilling;
तैलनिषेकबिंदुना R. 8. 38 ‘a drop of dripping
oil.’
--3 Effusion, discharge.
--4
Seminal effusion or discharge, infusion
of semen, impregnation, seed;
Ku. 3. 16; R. 14. 60.
--5 The ceremony
performed upon impregnation.
--6
Irrigation.
--7 Water for washing.
--8
Seminal impurity.
--9 Dirty water.
