निषेव्
निषेव् {c1c} A.
1 To pursue, follow,
attach oneself to, practise; Ś. 1. 27.
--2 To enjoy; निषेवते श्रांतमना विविक्त
Ś. 5. 5; Ku. 1. 5.
--3 To enjoy
carnally; यथा यथा तामरसेक्षणा मया
पुनः सरागं नितरां निषेविता Bv. 2. 155;
Pt. 1. 202.
--4 To resort to, inhabit,
frequent; Ku. 5. 76.
--5 To use,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0640-b" target="_blank">Page0640-b+ 57</a>]
