निष्कृ
निष्कृ {c8c} U.
1 To remove, drive
away, expel; Ms. 11. 54.
--2 To
break, frustrate; Bk. 15. 51.
--3 To
break into pieces, destroy.
--4 To
prepare, fit up, equip.
--5 To
accomplish, finish.
--6 To absolve, free
from (blame, sin &c.), acquit.
--7
To cure, heal.
