निष्कृतिः|निष्कृति
निष्कृतिः f.
1 Expiation, atonement;
Pt. 3. 157.
--2 Acquittance, requital,
discharge of a debt or obligation;
न तस्य निष्कृतिः शक्या कर्तुं वर्षशतैरपि
Ms. 2. 227, 3. 19; 8. 105, 9. 19,
11. 27.
--3 Removal.
--4 Restoration,
cure.
--5 Avoiding, escaping from.
--6 Neglecting.
--7 Bad conduct,
roguery.
