निष्क्रमः|निष्क्रम
निष्क्रमः
1 Going out, coming forth.
--2 Departure from, exit.
--3 One of
the Saṃskāras or religious rites;
i. e. taking out a child for the first
time into the open air (which is
usually performed in the fourth
month of its age); चतुर्थे मासि
निष्क्रमः Y. 1. 12; cf. उपनिष्क्रमण also.
--4
Degradation, loss of caste,
inferiority of tribe.
--5 Intellectual faculty.
