1
Hard, rugged, coarse, rough.
--2
Severe, sharp, smart (as a bow);
Śi. 5. 49.
--3 Cruel, harsh,
hard-hearted (said of persons or things);
व्यवसायः प्रतिपत्तिनिष्ठुरः R. 8. 65. 3. 62.
--4
Motionless, stiff.
--5 Contumelious.
--रं A harsh speech, abusive
language.
