निसर्गः|निसर्ग
निसर्गः
1 Bestowing, granting,
presenting, giving away;
Ms. 8. 143.
--2 A grant.
--3 Evacuation,
voiding excrement.
--4 Abandoning,
relinquishing.
--5 Creation.
--6
Nature, natural character, natural state
or condition; निसर्गदुर्बोधं Ki. 1. 6;
18. 31; R. 3. 35; Ku. 4. 16;
निसर्गतः, निसर्गेण ‘by nature’, or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0644-a" target="_blank">Page0644-a+ 56</a>]
‘naturally’.
--7 Exchange, barter.
--Comp.
--ज, --सिद्ध a. innate, inborn,
natural.
--भिन्न a. different by nature;
निसर्गभिन्नास्पदमेकसंस्थं R. 6. 29.
--विनीत a. {1} naturally discreet. {2}
naturally well-behaved.
