नीत|नीतं
नीत p. p. [नी-कर्मणि क्त]
1 Carried,
conducted, led.
--2 Gained, obtained.
--3 Brought or reduced to.
--4 Spent,
passed away.
--5 Well-behaved,
correct; see नी.
--तं
1 Wealth.
--2 Corn,
grain.
