Me. 69; नेताश्वस्य स्रुध्नं स्रुघ्नस्य वा Sk.;
Mu. 7. 14.
--2 A director, preceptor;
Bh. 2. 88.
--3 A chief, master,
head.
--4 An inflictor (as of
punishment); Ms. 7. 25.
--5 An owner.
--6 The hero of a drama.
--7 The
numeral ‘two’.
