पण्
पण् {vI.v} {c1c} A. (पणते, पणित)
1 To
deal in, barter, purchase, buy;
N. 2. 91.
--2 To bargain, transact
business.
--3 To bet or stake at play
(usually with gen. of the thing staked,
but sometimes with acc.);
प्राणानामपणिष्टासौ Bk. 8. 121; पणस्व कृष्णां
पांचालीं Mb.
--4 To risk or hazard
(a battle).
--5 To win anything at
play. {vII.v} {c1c} A., {c10c} U. (पणते, पणायति-ते)
1 To praise.
--2 To honour. --WITH
वि to sell, barter; आभीरदेशे किल
चंद्रकांतं त्रिभिर्वराटैर्विपणंति गोपाः
Subhāṣ.
