पद्
पद् {vI.v} {c10c} A. (पदयते) To go or
move. {vII.v} {c4c} A. (पद्यते, पन्न; caus.
पादयति-ते; desid. पित्सते)
1 To go,
move.
--2 To go to, approach (with
acc.).
--3 To attain, obtain, gain;
ज्योतिषामाधिपत्यं च प्रभावं चाप्यपद्यत
Mb.
--4 To observe, practice; स्वधर्मं
पद्यमानास्ते Mb.
--5 Ved. To fall down
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0663-a" target="_blank">Page0663-a+ 57</a>]
with fatigue.
--6 Ved. To perish.
--7
To fall out. {vIII.v} {c1c} P. (पदति) To
stand fast or fixed.
