परकीय|परकीयं
परकीय a.
1 Belonging to another;
अर्थो हि कन्या परकीय एव Ś. 4. 21;
Ms. 4. 201.
--2 Stranger, hostile.
--या Another's wife, a woman
not one's own, one of the three
main kinds of heroines; see अन्यस्त्री
and S. D. 108 et seq.
