परतस्
परतस् ind.
1 From another;
Bv. 1. 120.
--2 From an enemy;
R. 3. 48.
--3 Further, more (than),
beyond, after, over (often with abl.);
द्धेः परतस्तु सः Bg. 3. 42.
--4 Other
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0667-c" target="_blank">Page0667-c+ 57</a>]
wise.
--5 Differently.
--6 Further
afterwards.
