परत्वं|परत्व
परत्वं
1 The following of another
letter, posteriority.
--2 Distinction,
difference.
--3 Remoteness.
--4
Consequence, result.
--5 Enmity,
hostility.
--6 Priority of place or time,
proximity, one of the 24 guṇas of
the Vaiśeṣikas.
