परत्र|परत्रं
परत्र ind.
1 In another world, in
a future birth; परत्रेह च शर्मणे
R. 1. 69; Ku. 4. 37; Ms. 3. 275, 5. 166;
8. 127.
--2 In the sequel, further or
later on.
--3 Hereafter, in future.
--त्रं Future world.
--Comp.
--भीरुः
one who stands in awe of the future
world, a pious or religious man.
