powerless; परवानिव शरीरोपतापेन
Māl. 3.
--3 Completely under the
influence of (another), not master of
oneself, overpowered or overcome;
विस्मयेन परवानस्मि U. 5; आनंदेन
परवानस्मि U. 3; साध्वसेन Māl. 6.
--4
Devoted to.
