परस्पर|परस्परं
परस्पर a. Mutual; परस्परां
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0669-a" target="_blank">Page0669-a+ 56</a>]
विस्मयवंति लक्ष्मीमालोकयांचक्रुरिवादरेण
Bk. 2. 5. --pron. a. Each other, one
another (used in the sing. only; often
in comp.); परस्परस्योपरि पर्यचीयत
R. 3. 24; 7. 38; अविज्ञातपरस्परैः अपसर्पैः
17. 51; परस्पराक्षिसादृक्ष्यं 1. 40, 3. 24.
Note. The acc. and abl. singulars
are often used adverbially in the
sense of ‘mutually,’ ‘reciprocally’,
‘one another,’ ‘by, from, or to one
another’, ‘against one another’ &c.;
see Bg. 3. 11, 10. 9; R. 4. 79;
6. 46; 7. 14, 53; 12. 94.
--Comp.
--ज्ञः a friend.
