परा
परा ind. A prefix to verbs and
nouns in the sense of ‘away, back,
in an inverted order, aside, towards.’
According to G. M. the senses of
परा are: 1. killing, injuring &c.
(पराहत). 2. going (परागत). 3.
seeing, encountering (परादृष्ट). 4.
prowess (पराक्रांत). 5. direction
towards (परावृत्त). 6. excess (पराजित).
7. dependence (पराधीन). 8.
liberation (पराकृत). 9. inverted
order, backwards (पराङ्मुख). 10
setting aside, disregarding.
