परिघः|परिघ
परिघः
1 An iron (or wooden)
beam or bar used for locking or
shutting a gate (अर्गल)); एकः कृत्स्नां
नगरपरिघप्रांशुबाहुर्भुनक्ति Ś. 2. 15;
R. 16. 84; Śi. 19. 32; M. 5. 2.
--2
(Hence) A bar barrier, hindrance,
obstacle; भार्गवस्य सुकृतोऽपि सोऽ
भवत्स्वर्गमार्गपरिघो दुरत्ययः R. 11. 88.
--3
A stick or club studded or tipped
with iron; R. 12. 73.
--4 An iron
club in general.
--5 A water-jar,
pitcher.
--6 A glass-pitcher.
--7 A
house, dwelling.
--8 Killing,
destroying.
--9 Striking, a stroke or
blow.
--10 A child which assumes a
peculiar cross position in birth.
--11
A line of clouds crossing the sun at
sunrise or sunset.
--12 The gate of
a palace, town or house.
--घौ (m.
dual) Two birds flying on each side
of a traveller (regarded as an omen).
