परिवेदनं|परिवेदन
परिवेदनं
1 The marriage of a
younger brother before the elder.
--2 Marriage in general.
--3
Complete or accurate knowledge.
--4
Gain, acquisition.
--5 Maintaining
the household fire (अग्न्याधान);
Ms. 11. 61.
--6 Pervasion on all sides,
universal pervasion or existence.
--7 Discussion.
--8 Misery, pain
--ना
1 Shrewdness, wit.
--2
Prudence, foresight.
