परिहारः|परिहार
परि(री)हारः
1 Leaving,
quitting, giving up, abandoning.
--2
Removing, taking away; as in
विरोधपरिहार.
--3 Shunning, avoiding.
--4
Refuting, repelling.
--5 Omitting
to mention, omission, leaving out.
--6 Reserve, concealment.
--7 A tract
of common land round a village or
town; धनुःशतं परीहारो ग्रामस्य
स्यात्समंततः Ms. 8. 237.
--8 A special grant,
immunity, privilege, exemption
from taxes; Ms. 7. 201.
--9
Contempt, disrespect.
--10 An objection.
--11 Seizing, keeping back.
--12
Bounty.
--13 (In gram.) The
repetition of a word before and after इति;
cf. परिग्रह.
--14 Atoning for any
improper action.
