--4 A particular kind
of posture practised by ascetics in
meditation, sitting on the hams;
it is the same as वीरासन which is
thus defined by Vasiṣṭha:
--एकं
पादमथैकस्मिन् विन्यस्योरौ तु संस्थितं ।
इतरस्मिंस्वथैवोरुं वीरासनमुद हृतं ॥; पर्यंकग्रंथिबंध
&c. Mk. 1. 1.
--Comp.
--बंधः sitting
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">Page0685-a+ 55</a>]
on the hams, the posture called
पर्यंकः पर्यंकबंधस्थिरपूर्वकायं Ku. 3. 45,
59.
--भोगिन् m. a kind of serpent.
