पर्युपास्
पर्युपास्^1 {c2c} A.
1 To attend
upon, worship, attend
respectfully; पर्युपास्यंत लक्ष्या R. 10. 62;
Ku. 2. 38; Ms. 7. 37.
--2 To go to (for
protection), resort to, seek shelter
or patronage with; अशक्ता एव सर्वत्र
नरेद्रं पर्युपासते Pt. 1. 241.
--3 To
enclose, surround.
--4 To share in
partake of.
--5 To sit on.
--6 To
live round.
[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170110. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/332,. note: wrong placed repha.
