पातन|पातनं
पातन a. [पत्-णिच् ल्यु ल्युट् वा] Felling.
cutting down.
--नं
1 Causing to fall
down, bringing or throwing down,
knocking down.
--2 Throwing,
casting.
--3 Humbling, lowering.
--4
Removing. N. B. पातनं may have
different meanings according to the
noun with which it is used; e. g.
दडस्य पातनं ‘causing the rod to fall’,
i. e. chastising; गर्भस्य पातनं ‘causing
the fœtus to fall’, causing an
abortion.
