get over; Pt. 2. 6.
--2 to
accomplish, fulfil; as in प्रतिज्ञायाः पारंगतः.
{3} to master fully, become proficient
in; सकलशास्त्रपारं गतः Pt. 1;
पारं नी ‘to bring to a close.’).
--रः Quick-silver. (पारे meaning ‘on
the other side of’, ‘beyond’
sometimes enters into comp.; e. g. पारेगंगं,
पारेसमद्रं beyond the Ganges or
theocean).
