--ग्रहः a follower.
--ग्रहणं
attacking or threatening an enemy in
the rear.
--ग्राहः {1} an enemy in the
rear. {2} a general commanding the
rear of an army. {3} an ally who
supports a prince; Ms. 7. 207.
--घातः a kick; Ki. 17. 50.
--त्रं a
rear-guard, a body of forces in the
rear, reserve.
--वाहः an outside
horse.
--सारथिः a charioteer who
drives one of the outside horses.
