पीडनं|पीडन
पीडनं [पीड् भावे ल्युट्]
1 Paining,
distressing, oppressing, inflicting
pain; Ms. 9. 299; Pt. 1. 345.
--2
(a) Squeezing, pressing;
दोर्वल्लिबंधनिबिडस्तनपीडनानि Gīt. 10;
दंतौष्ठपीडननखक्षतरक्तसिक्तां Ch. P. 44. (b)
Pressure; Māl. 9. 38.
--3 An
instrument for pressing.
--4 Taking,
holding, seizing; as in करपीडन or
पाणिपीडन q. v.
--5 Laying waste,
devastation.
--6 Threshing corn.
--7 An eclipse; as in ग्रहपीडन q. v.
--8 Suppressing sounds, a fault in
the pronunciation of vowels.
