पुत्तलः|पुत्तल
पुत्तलः --ली
1 An image, idol, a
statue, effigy.
--2 A doll, puppet.
--Comp.
--दहनं, --विधिः burning an
effigy in place of the body of one
who has died abroad or whose corpse
is lost.
--पूजा idolatry.
