पुरस्कृत|पुरस्कृतः
पुरस्कृत p. p.
1 Placed in front;
R. 2. 20.
--2 Honoured, treated with
respect, distinguished.
--3 Chosen,
adopted, followed.
--4 Adored,
worshipped.
--5 Attended or
accompanied, provided with, possessing,
having.
--6 Prepared, got ready.
--7
Consecrated.
--8 Accused,
calumniated.
--9 Made prefect or complete,
finished.
--10 Anticipated, expected.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0710-b" target="_blank">Page0710-b+ 57</a>]
--11 Appointed.
--12 Harassed or
attacked (by an enemy).
--13
Sprinkled with holy water.
