पुरस्तात्
पुरस्तात् ind.
1 Before, in front
of (oft. with gen. or abl.);
R. 2. 44; Ku. 7. 30; Me. 15; or used
by itself; अभ्युन्नता पुरस्तात्
Ś. 3. 8.
--2 At the head of, foremost;
यः पुरस्ताद्यतीनां M. 1. 1.
--3 In the
first place, at the beginning.
--4
Formerly, previously.
--5 Eastward,
in or towards the east.
--6 Later or
further on, in the sequel.
