पुरोधा
पुरोधा^1 {c3c} U.
1 To place or put in
the front or at the head, make as a
leader; तुरासाहं पुरोधाय धाम स्वायंभुवं
ययुः Ku. 2. 1; R. 12. 43.
--2 To
make a family-priest of any one.
--3 To appoint, place in office.
--4
To entrust or charge with.
--5 To
place or set before or in front.
--6
To honor, esteem, respect.
--7 To
devote or apply oneself to.
--8 To
think, ponder over.
