पूतनः|पूतन
पूतनः A dead body in a cemetery.
--ना
1 N. of a female demon who,
while attempting to kill Kṛṣṇa,
when but an infant, was herself
crushed by him.
--2 A demoness, or
Rākṣasī in general; मा
पूतनात्वमुपगाःशिवतातिरेधि Māl. 9. 49.
--Comp.
--अरिः, --सूदनः, --हन् m. epithets of
Kṛṣṇa.
