पूर्वक|पूर्वकः|पूर्व्वक
पूर्वक a. (At the end of comp.)
1 Preceded by, attended with;
अनामयप्रश्वपूर्वकमाह Ś. 5.
--2
Preceding, antecedent.
--3 Previous,
former, prior.
--4 First.
--कः An
ancestor, a forefather.
