पूर्ववत्|पूर्ववन्त्|पूर्व्ववत्
पूर्ववत् a.
1 Having something
antecedent or a cause.
--2 Relating to
something preceding. --n. One of the
three kinds of अनुमान, inference of
the effect from the cause; i. e.
inferring from the rising of clouds
that rain will fall. --ind. As before.
