पूर्वेद्युस्|पूर्व्वेद्युस्
पूर्वेद्युस् ind.
1 On the former
day.
--2 On the day before,
yesterday; Ms. 3. 187.
--3 During the
first part of the day, in the morning,
at dawn.
--4 Early, betimes.
