Ki. 14. 24. {2} a fool, a
blockhead, an ignorant man;
Śi. 16. 9. {3} a wicked man, sinner.
--पिंडः a distant relation who offers
the funeral rice-ball separately and
not together with other relations.
--भावः separateness, individuality;
(so पृथक्त्वं).
--रूप a. of different
shapes or kinds.
--विध a. of
different kinds, diverse, various.
--शय्या sleeping apart.
--स्यितिः f.
separate existence.
