पृषत्|पृषन्त्
पृषत् a.
1 Spotted, variegated.
--2
Sprinkling --m. The spotted ante
lope. --n. A drop of water or of
any other liquid; (said by some to
be used only in pl.).
--Comp.
--अंशः,
अश्वः {1} wind, air. {2} an epithet of
Śiva.
--आज्यं ghee mixed with
coagulated milk.
--पतिः (पृषतांपतिः)
wind.
--बलः N. of the horse of
Wind.
