पृषोदरः|पृषोदर
पृषोदरः Wind, air. (The word
is supposed to be compounded of
पृषत् and उदर, the त् of पृषत् being
dropped as an irregular case. The
word is thus taken as the type of a
whole class of such irregular
compounds); पृषोदरादित्वात् साधुः, see
Gaṇa to P. VI. 3. 109.
