पॄ
पॄ {c3c} {c9c} P. (पिर्पींत, पृणाति, पपार, अपारीत्,
परि-री-ष्यति, परि-री-तुं, पूर्ण; pass. पूर्यते;
caus. पूरयति-ते; desid. पिपरि-री-षति,
पुपूर्षति)
1 To fill, fill up, complete.
--2
To fulfil, gratify (as hopes &c.).
--3 To fill with wind, blow (as a
conch, flute &c.).
--4 To satisfy,
refresh, please; पितॄनपारित् Bk. 1. 2
--5 To rear, bring up, nourish,
nurture, cherish.
