Bh. 2 72; Pt. 1. 31; प्रकटीभू ‘to become
manifest, appear’).
--Comp.
--प्रीतिवर्धनः an epithet of Śiva.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0723-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
