consideration, the subject in hand
(often used in works on Alaṃkāra
for उपमेय); संभावनमथोत्प्रेक्षा प्रकृतस्य
समेन यत् K. P. 10.
--6 Important,
interesting.
--7 Wished, expected.
--8 Original.
--तं The original
subject, the matter or subject in hand;
यातु किमनेन प्रकृतमेव अनुसरामः ‘come
to the point.’
--Comp.
--अर्थ a. {1}
having the original sense. {2} true,
real.
--(र्थः) the original sense.
