प्रतिभा
प्रतिभा {c2c} P.
1 To shine, appear
bright or luminous; प्रतिभांत्यद्य
वनानि केतकीनां Ghaṭ. 15.
--2 To show
oneself, become manifest.
--3 To
seem, appear; स्त्रीरत्नसृष्टिरपरा प्रतिभाति
सा मे Ś. 2. 9; R. 2. 47;
Ku. 5. 38; 6. 54.
--4 To occur to, come
into the mind of; as in नोत्तरं
प्रतिभाति मे.
--5 To fall to the lot or
share of.
--6 To seem fit or proper;
Pt. 3.
