प्रतियोगिन्
प्रतियोगिन् a.
1 Opposing,
counteracting, impeding.
--2 Related or
corresponding to, being or forming
a counter-part of (anything); often
used in works on Nyāya; as a घट
is the प्रतियोगी of घटाभाव; (यस्याभावो
बिवक्ष्यते स प्रतियोगी).
--3 Co-operating
with.
--4 Equally matched. --m.
1 An adversary, opponent, enemy;
दहत्यशेषं प्रतियोगिगर्वं Vikr. 1. 117.
--2 A counter-part, match.
--3 A
partner, an associate.
--4 An object
dependent upon another.
