--2 Withholding.
--3 Restraining the organs of
sense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0746-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहारः|प्रत्याहार
प्रत्याहारः
1 Drawing back,
marching back, retreat.
--2 Keeping back,
withholding.
--3 Restraining the
organs.
--4 Dissolution of the world,
--5 (In gram.) The comprehension
of several letters or affixes into one
syllable, effected by combining the
first letter of a Sūtra with its final
indicatory letter, or in the case of
several Sūtras, with the final letter
of the last member; thus अण् is the
प्रत्याहार of the Sūtra अइउण्; अच्
(vowels) of the four Sūtras अइउण्,
ऋऌक्, एओङ्, ऐऔच्; हल् of the
consonants; अल् of all letters.
--6
Abridgment.
