Throwing, projecting.
--4 Showing,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0747-c" target="_blank">Page0747-c+ 57</a>]
evincing, displaying.
--5 A place where
anything is spread.
--6
Celebrating, proclaiming.
