प्रबाध्
प्रबाध्^1 {c1c} A.
1 To press hard upon,
oppress.
--2 To trouble, torment,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0752-b" target="_blank">Page0752-b+ 56</a>]
harass, tease, hurt; समुच्छ्रितानेव
तरून् प्रबाधते (प्रभंजनः) H. 1;
Bk. 12. 2.
--3 To drive away, remove, get
over; कथं च दैवं शक्येत पौरुषेण
प्रबाधितुं Mb.
--4 To throw down,
destroy.
--5 To repel, repulse.
[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170214. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/336. note: prefix of root bAD.
