प्रबोधः|प्रबोध
प्रबोधः
1 Awaking(fig. also),
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0752-c" target="_blank">Page0752-c+ 55</a>]
awakening; regaining one's
consciousness, consciousness; अप्रबोधाय सुष्वाप
R. 12. 50; मोहाद्भूत्कष्टतरः प्रबोधः 14. 56.
--2 Blowing, expanding (of flowers).
--3 Wakefulness, sleeplessness;
चिरप्रबोधान्न संभावितं धर्मासनमध्यासितुं
Ś. 6.
--4 Vigilance, watchfulness.
--5
Knowledge, understanding, wisdom,
removal of delusion, real
knowledge; as in प्रबोधचंद्रोदय; R. 5. 65.
--6 Consolation.
--7 Reviving the
fragrance of a perfume.
--8
Explaining.
--Comp.
--उत्सवः N. of a
festival observed from the tenth to
the day of full-moon in the month
of Kārtika.
