expanded, opened.
--5 Changed,
altered
--6 Deformed, disfigured.
--7
Relaxed, loosened.
--8 Intoxicated, in
rut; Ku. 5. 80.
--9 Pierced, bored.
--10 Different, distinct.
--न्नः An
elephant in rut.
--Comp.
--अंजनं a
kind of collyrium or eye-salve
mixed with oil.
--करट a. ‘having the
cheeks cleft,’ being in rut,
intoxicated.
