--6 Of Śiva.
--7
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0754-a" target="_blank">Page0754-a+ 56</a>]
Of Brahmā.
--8 Of Indra.
--Comp.
--भक्त a. attached or devoted to
one's lord, loyal.
--(क्तः) a good
horse.
--भक्तिः f. devotion to one's
lord, loyalty, faithfulness.
