1 Tormenting,
harassing, torturing, afflicting, harrowing;
क्व रुजा हृदयप्रमाथिनी क्व च ते
विश्वसनीयमायुधं M. 3. 2; Māl. 2. 1;
Ki. 3. 14.
--2 Killing, destroying.
--3
Agitating, setting in motion;
Bg. 2. 60; 6. 34.
--4 Tearing or
pulling down, striking down;
R. 11. 58.
--5 Cutting down; Ki. 17. 31.
--m. N. of a year.
