प्रमत्त|प्रमत्तः
प्रमत्त p. p.
1 Intoxicated, drunk;
कथां प्रमत्तः प्रथमं कृतामिव (न
स्मरिष्यति) Ś. 4. 1.
--2 Mad, insane.
--3
Careless, negligent, inattentive
heedless, regardless (generally with
loc.).
--4 Swerving from, failing
to do (with abl.)
--5 Blundering.
--6
Wanton, lascivious.
--Comp.
--गीत a.
sung carelessly.
--चित्त a. negligent,
heedless, careless.
