प्रमुच्
प्रमुच् {c6c} P.
1 To set free, liberate,
release.
--2 To throw, cast, hurl.
--3
To shed, emit, send forth.
--4 To
abandon, forsake, give up, renounce.
--5 To loosen, untie, unbind.
--6
To expel, drive away, banish.
