--5 Acted,
represented.
--6 Arising or resulting from,
produced by, consequent on;
Pt. 1. 61.
--7 Endowed with.
--8 Lost in
meditation, abstracted.
--9 Lent or
put to interest (as money).
--10
Prompted, instigated, urged;
Ku. 1. 21.
--11 Directed, hurled at.
--12
Shaken, set in motion.
--13 Inflicted
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0757-b" target="_blank">Page0757-b+ 59</a>]
upon.
--14 Connected with.
--15
Thick, compact, closely united.
--क्तं
A cause.
--Comp.
--संस्कार a.
polished (as a gem).
