प्राप्तिः|प्राप्ति
प्राप्तिः f.
1 Obtaining, acquisition
gain, attainment, profit; द्रव्य˚,
यशः˚, सुख˚ &c.
--2 Reaching or
attaining to.
--3 Arrival, coming to.
--4 Finding, meeting with.
--5 Range,
reach.
--6 A guess, conjecture.
--7
Lot, share, portion.
--8 Fortune, luck.
--9 Rise, production.
--10 The power
of obtaining anything (one of the
eight Siddhis q. v.).
--11 Union,
collection (संहति).
--12 The result of
actions done in a former life.
--13
Fate, destiny; Pt. 2. 123.
--14 Being
valid, holding good, application (as
of a rule).
--15 The successful
termination of a plot (सुखागम).
--Comp.
--आशा the hope of obtaining
anything (regarded as part of the
development of the plot of a play);
उपायापायशंकाभ्यां प्राप्त्याशा प्राप्तिसंभवा
S. D. 6.
