1 N. of a creeper (said to
put forth blossoms at the touch of
women); प्रियंगुश्यामांगप्रकृतिरपि
Māl. 3. 9. (For some of the conventions
of poets about the blossoming of
trees, see the quotation under अशोक).
--2 Long pepper.
--गु n. Saffron.
