फण्
फण् {c1c} P. (फणति, फणित)
1 To
move, move about; रुरुजुर्भेजिरे
फेणुर्बहुधा हरिराक्षसाः Bk. 14. 78.
--2 To
produce easily or without exertion;
(this sense according to some
belongs to the Caus. of फण्). --Caus.
(फाणयति) To skim, take off (the
surface of a fluid.).
