फलकं|फलक|फलकः
फलकं
1 A board, plank, slab,
tablet; कालः काल्या भुवनफलके क्रीडति
प्राणिशारैः Bh. 3. 39; द्यूत˚, चित्र˚ &c.
--2 Any flat surface;
चुंब्यमानकपोलफलकां K. 218, धृतमुग्धगंडफलकैर्विबभुः
Śi. 9. 47, 37; cf. तट
--3 A shield.
--4 A slab, tablet, leaf or page for
writing upon.
--5 The buttocks, hips.
--6 The palm of the hand.
--7 Fruit,
result, consequence.
--8 Profit, gain.
--9 Menstruation.
--10 The head of
an arrow.
--11 The pericarp of a
lotus.
--12 A broad and flat bone (of
the forehead).
--Comp.
--पाणि a.
armed with a shield (as a warrior).
--यंत्रं an astronomical instrument
invented by Bhāskarācārya.
--सक्थ a. having a thigh as broad as a
board.
