बंध्य|बन्ध्य|बन्ध्यः
बंध्य [बंध् --यत्]
1 To be bound or
fettered, to be confined or
imprisoned; Y. 2. 243.
--2 To be joined
or bound together.
--3 To be
formed, built or constructed.
--4
Detained, under arrest.
--5 Barren,
unproductive, fruitless, useless (said of
persons or things); बंध्यश्रमास्ते
R. 16. 75; अबंध्ययत्नाश्च बभूवुरत्र ते 3. 29;
Ki. 1. 33.
--6 Not having the menses
or menstrual discharge.
--7 (At
the end of comp.) Deprived or
destitute of.
--Comp.
--फल a. useless,
vain, idle.
