भः|भ|भं
भः
1 N. of the planet Venus.
--2
Error, delusion, mere semblance.
--3 An epithet of Śukra.
--4 N.
given to the base of nouns before
the vowel terminations beginning
with accusative plural; cf. अंग and
पद.
--भं
1 A star.
--2 A lunar
mansion or asterism.
--3 A planet.
--4 A sign of the zodiac.
--5 The
number twenty-seven.
--6 A bee
--Comp.
--ईनः, --ईशः the sun.
--कक्षा
the path of the asterisms.
--गणः,
वर्गः {1} the group of stars or
asterisms. {2} the zodiac. {3}
revolution of the planets in the zodiac.
