भग्न|भग्नं
भग्न p. p. [भंज्-क्त]
1 Broken,
fractured, shattered, torn.
--2
Frustrated, foiled, disappointed.
--3 Check,
ed, arrested, suspended.
--4 Marred,
impaired.
--5 Routed, completely
defeated or vanquished; U. 5.
--6
Demolished, destroyed. (See भंज्).
