--3 Any learned man
or philosopher.
--4 A kind of mixed
caste, whose occupation is that of
bards or panegyrists;
क्षत्रियाद्विपकन्यायां भट्टो जातोऽनुवाचकः.
--5 A bard,
panegyrist.
--Comp.
--आचार्यः {1}
a title given to a learned man or
any celebrated teacher. {2} a great
doctor.
--प्रयागः = प्रयाग q. v.
