भर|भरः
भर a. [भृ-अप्] Bearing,
granting, supporting, &c. (at the end
of comp.).
--रः
1 A burden, load,
weight; खुरत्रये भरं कृत्वा Pt. 1
‘supporting himself on his three hoofs’;
फलभरपरिणामश्यामजंबू &c. U. 2. 20;
भरव्यथा Mu. 2. 18.
--2 A great
number, large quantity, collection,
multitude; धत्ते भरं कुसुमपत्रफलावलीनां
Bv. 1. 94, 54; Śi. 9. 47.
--3 Bulk, mass.
--4 Excess; निर्व्यूढसौहृदभरेति
गुणोज्ज्वलोति Māl. 6. 17; शोमाभरैः संभृताः
Bv. 1. 103; कोपभरेण Gīt. 3.
--5 A
particular measure of weight.
--6 Theft,
taking away.
--7 Attacking, a battle
(Ved.).
--8 A hymn or song of
praise.
