भवितव्य|भवितव्यं
भवितव्य pot. p. About to take
place, about to happen, likely to be,
often used like भाव्य impersonally,
i. e. in the neuter gender and
singular number, with the instrumental
of the subject and the predicative
word; त्वया मम सहायेन भवितव्यं Ś. 2;
गुरुणा कारणेन भवितव्यं Ś. 6.
--व्यं
What is destined to happen;
भवितव्यं भवत्येव यद्विवर्मनसि स्थितं Subhāsh
