भविष्यत्|भविष्यन्त्
भविष्यत् a. (ती or न्ती f.) About
to be, become or come to pass,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0811-a" target="_blank">Page0811-a+ 56</a>]
future. --n. The future time.
--Comp.
--आक्षेपः {1} denying the occurrence
of a possible future event. {2} a
kind of Alaṃkāra or figure of speech;
see Kāv. 2. 126.
--कालः futurity.
--वक्तृ, --वादिन् a. predicting future
events, prophesying.
