भागिन्
भागिन् a. [भाग-इनि]
1 Consisting
of shares or parts.
--2 Sharing,
having a share.
--3 Sharing or
participating in, partaking of; as in
दुःख˚.
--4 Concerned in, affected by.
--5 A possessor, owner; Ms. 9. 53.
--6 Entitled to a share; Ms. 9. 165;
Y. 2. 125.
--7 Lucky, fortunate.
--8
Inferior, secondary. --m. A coheir.
--नी A coheiress.
