भाविक|भाविकः
भाविक a. (की f.) [भावेन निर्वृत्तं ठक्]
1 Natural, real, inherent, innate.
--2 Sentimental, pervaded by a
feeling or sentiment.
--3 Future.
--कः
An equation involving the products
of unknown quantities.
--कं
1
Language full of love or passion.
--2
(In Rhet.) A figure of speech
which consists in describing the
past or future so vividly that it
appears to be actually present. It
is thus defined by Mammaṭa; प्रत्यंक्षा
इव यद्भावाः क्रियंते भूतभाविनः । तद्भाविकं
K. P. 10.
