भिक्षवे दद्यात् Ms. 3. 94.
--2 A religious
mendicant, a Brāhmaṇa in the
fourth order of his religious life
(when he quits his house and
family and lives only on alms), a
Saṃnyāsin.
--3 The fourth order or
stage in the religious life of a
Brāhmaṇa (संन्यास).
--4 A Buddhist
mendicant.
--Comp.
--चर्या
begging, a mendicant's life.
--संघः a
society of Buddhist mendicants.
--संघाती old or tattered clothes (
चीवर).
--सूत्रं a collection of rules for
mendicants.
