<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भोजक
भोजक a. [भुज् णिच् ण्वुल्]
1
Causing to eat, feeding, nourishing.
दैवे पित्र्ये च भोजकः Y. 2. 235.
--2
An eater.
