भोजन|भोजनं|भोजनः
भोजन a. [भुज्-ल्यु ल्युट् वा]
Feeding, nourishing, giving to eat.
--नः
1 N. of Viṣṇu.
--2 Of Śiva.
--नं
1
Eating, eating food; taking one's
meals; अर्जीर्णे भोजनं विषं.
--2 Food
--3 Giving (food) to eat, feeding.
--4 Using, enjoying.
--5 Any object
of enjoyment.
--6 That which is
enjoyed.
--7 Property, wealth,
possessions.
--Comp.
--अधिकारः charge
of provender, superintendence over
food or provisions, stewardship.
--आच्छादनं food and raiment.
--कालः
--वेला, --समयः meal-time, dinner or
supper time.
--त्यागः abstaining
from food, fasting.
--भांडं a dish of
meat.
--भूमिः f. a dining-hall.
--विशेषः a dainty, delicacy.
--वृत्तिः f.
a meal, food.
--व्यग्र a. {1} engaged
in eating. {2} straitened for want
of food.
--व्ययः expense for food.
