भोज्य|भोज्यं
भोज्य pot. p.. [भुज्-ण्यत्]
1 To be
eaten.
--2 To be enjoyed or
possessed.
--3 To be suffered or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0827-b" target="_blank">Page0827-b+ 55</a>]
