भ्रमः [भ्रम्-घञ्]
1 Moving or
roaming about, roving.
--2 Turning round,
whirling, revolving.
--3 Circular
motion, rotation.
--4 Straying,
deviating.
--5 An error, a mistake,
misapprehension, delusion; शुक्तौ
रंजतमिति ज्ञानं भ्रमः.
--6 Confusion,
perplexity, embarrassment.
--7 An eddy.
a whirlpool.
--8 A potter's wheel
--9 A grind-stone.
--10 A lathe.
--11
Giddiness.
--12 A fountain,
watercourse.
--Comp.
--आकुल a.
confused.
--आसक्तः a sword-cleaner, an
armourer.
