भ्रांत|भ्रान्त|भ्रान्तः
भ्रांत p. p. [भ्रम्-क्त]
1
Wandered or roamed about.
--2 Turned
round, whirled, revolved.
--3 Erred,
mistaken, gone astray.
--4
Perplexed, confused.
--5 Moving about,
moving to and fro, wheeling.
--6
Whirling or turning round, roaming
or wandering about.
--तः
1
An elephant in rut.
--2 A kind of
thorn-apple.
--तं
1 Roaming, moving
about; वरं पर्वतदुर्गेषु भ्रांतं वनचरैः सह
Bh. 2. 14.
--2 A mistake, an
error.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0829-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
