1
A female frog.
--2 A wanton or
unchaste woman.
--3 N. of several
plants.
--Comp.
--अनुवृत्तिः, --प्लुतिः f.
‘the leap of a frog’, skipping over
or omitting at intervals (in
grammar the word is used to denote the
skipping of several Sūtras and
supplying from a previous Sūtra);
क्रियाग्रहणं मंडूकप्लुत्यानुवर्तते Sk.
--कुलं
a collection of frogs.
--योगः a kind
of abstract meditation in which the
person who meditates sits motion.
less like a frog.
--सरस् n. a pond
full of frogs.
