मत|मतं|मतः
मत p. p. [मन्-क्त]
1 Thought,
believed, supposed.
--2 Considered,
regarded, deemed, looked upon.
--3
Esteemed, honoured, respected;
R. 2. 16, 8. 8.
--4 Commended, valued.
--5 Conjectured, guessed.
--6
Meditated upon, thought of, perceived,
recognised.
--7 Thought out.
--8
Intended, aimed at.
--9 Approved,
sanctioned.
--10 Wished or hoped
for.
--11 Perceived, observed, known,
understood. (See मन्).
--तं
1 A
thought, idea, opinion, belief, view:
निश्चितं मतमुत्तमं 18. 6;
केषांचिन्मतेन &c.
--2 Doctrine, tenet; creed,
religious belief; ये मे मतमिदं नित्यमनुति
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0834-c" target="_blank">Page0834-c+ 56</a>]
ष्ठंति मानवाः Bg. 3. 31.
--3 Advice,
instruction, counsel.
--4 Aim, design,
intention, purpose.
--5 Approbation,
sanction, commendation.
--6
Knowledge.
--Comp.
--अक्ष a. well-versed
in playing at dice.
--अंतरं {1} a
different view. {2} a different creed.
--अवलंबनं adopting or holding a
particular opinion.
