मंथः|मन्थ|मंथ|मन्थः
मंथः [मथ्-करणे घञ्]
1 Churning
shaking about, stirring agitating;
मंथादिव क्षुभ्य ति गांगमंभः U. 7. 16;
R. 10. 3.
--2 Killing destroying.
--3
A mixed beverage.
--4 A
churningstick (मंथा also).
--5 The sun.
--6
A ray of the sun.
--7 Excretion of
rheum from the eyes, mucus (from
the eyes), cataract.
--8 An
instrument for kindling fire by attrition.
--9 A spoon for stirring.
--10 A
kind of antelope.
--Comp.
--अचलः,
--अद्रिः, गिरिः, --पर्वतः, --शैलः the
Mandara mountain (used as a
churningstick); Bv. 1. 55.
--उदकः, --उदधिः the
sea of milk
--गुणः a churning-cord.
--जं butter.
--दंडः, --दंडकः a
churning-stick.
