plunge (with loc. or acc.); सीदन्नंधे
तमसि विधुरो मज्जतीवांतरात्मा U. 3. 38;
Māl. 9. 20; सोऽसंवृतं नाम तमः सह
तेनैव मज्जति Ms. 4. 81; R. 16. 72.
--3 To be drowned, perish, (in
water).
--4 To sink into misfortune.
--5 To despond, be discouraged or
disheartened. --Caus. (मज्जयति)
1
To cause to sink, immerse, dip,
drown.
--2 To deluge, inundate,
overwhelm.
