[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0852-a" target="_blank">Page0852-a+ 57</a>]
(The number of Mahākāvyas is
usually said to be five:
--रघुवंश,
कुमारसंभव, किरातार्जुनीय, शिशुपालवध and
नैषधचरित, or six, if मेघदूत --a very
small poem or खंडकाव्य --be added
to the list. But this enumeration
is apparently only traditional, as
there are several other poems, such
as the भट्टिकाव्य, विक्रमांकदेवचरित,
हरविजय &c. which have an equal claim
to be considered as Mahākāvyas)
