of a bird.
--5 A lady's maid, female
servant (सैरिंध्री).
--6 An immoral
woman.
--7 Money acquired by the
prostitution of one's wife; cf.
माहिषिक.
--Comp.
--पालः a keeper of
she-buffaloes.
--स्तंभः a pillar
adorned with a buffalo's head.
