representing Durgā at the Durgā festival.
--4 N. of Durgā.
--5 The celestial
Ganges.
--6 N. of a metre; see App.
{1}
--7 N. of the mother of
Bibhīshaṇa.
--8 N. assumed by Draupadī
while residing at the Court of
Virāta.
--9 N. of a river; Ś. 3. 7.
