मूर्तिः|मूर्ति|मूर्त्ति|मूर्त्तिः
मूर्तिः f. [मुर्च्छ्-क्तिन्]
1 Anything
which has definite shape and limits,
material element, matter,
substance.
--2 A form, visible shape,
body, figure; Mu. 2. 2; R. 3. 27;
14. 54.
--3 An embodiment,
incarnation, personification, manifestation;
करुणस्य मूर्तिः U. 3. 4; Pt. 2. 159.
--4 An image, idol, a statue.
--5
Beauty.
--6 Solidity, hardness.
--Comp.
--धर, --संचर a. embodied, incarnate;
धर्मो बा मूर्तिसंचरः Mv. 1. 10;
U. 6. 10.
--पः a worshipper of an image,
one who is in charge of an idol.
