<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्धन्य|मूर्द्धन्यः
मूर्धन्य a. [मूर्ध्नि भवः यत्]
1 Being
in or on the head.
--2 Cerebral or
lingual, a term applied to the letters
ऋ, ॠ, ट्, ठ्, ड्, ढ्, ण्, र्, and ष्; ऋटुरषाणां
मूर्धा.
--3 Chief, pre-eminent, most
excellent.
