मृद्
मृद् {c9c} P. (मृद्गति, मृदित)
1 To
squeeze, press, rub: मम च मृदितं क्षौमं
बाल्ये त्वदंगविवर्तनैः Ve. 5. 40.
--2 To
trample or tread upon; crush, dash
to pieces, kill, destroy, pound
bruise, pulverize; तावमदर्दिखादीच्च
Bk. 15. 15; बलान्यमृद्गान्नलिनाभवक्त्रः
R. 18. 5.
--3 To rub, stroke, rub
against, touch; Śi. 4. 61.
--4 To
overcome, surpass.
--5 To wipe
away, rub off, remove.
--6 (In astr.)
To pass through (as a
constellation). --Caus. (मर्दयति) = मृद्
q. v. above.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0877-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

