enrapturing; U. 1. 36; Māl. 6. 8.
--नः
1 An epithet of Śiva.
--2 N. of one
of the five arrows of Cupid.
--3 The
thorn-apple (धत्तूर).
--नं
1
Stupefying.
--2 Bewildering, perplexing,
puzzling.
--3 Stupor; loss of
sensation.
--4 Infatuation, delusion,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0881-b" target="_blank">Page0881-b+ 55</a>]
mistake.
--5 A seduction, temptation.
--6 Sexual intercourse; Māl. 4.
--7
A means employed in perplexing
others.
--8 A magical charm
employed to bewilder an enemy.
--Comp.
--अस्त्रं a missile which fascinates or
bewitches the person against whom
it is used.
