म्लान|म्लानं
म्लान p. p. [म्लै-क्त तस्य नः]
1
Faded, withered.
--2 Wearied, weary,
languid.
--3 Enfeebled, weak,
feeble, faint.
--4 Sad, dejected,
melancholy.
--5 Black.
--6 Foul, dirty.
--नं Withering, fading.
--Comp.
--अंग a. weak-bodied.
--(गी) a
woman during her menses.
--मनस्
a. depressed in mind,
dispirited, disheartened.
