यः|य|यं
यः
1 One who goes or moves, a
goer, mover.
--2 A carriage.
--3
Wind, air.
--4 Union.
--5 Fame.
--6
Barley.
--7 Restraint.
--8 Light.
--9 Abandoning.
--10 One of the
eight syllabic feet (गण) consisting
of one short syllable followed by
two long ones.
--11 N. of Yama.
--या
1 Going.
--2 A carriage.
--3
Restraining.
--4 Religious
meditation (ध्यान).
--5 Obtaining.
--6
An epithet of Lakṣmī.
--7
Pudendum muliebre.
