यज्ञिय|यज्ञियं|यज्ञियः
यज्ञिय a. [यज्ञाय हितः घ]
1
Belonging to or fit for a sacrifice, sacrificial.
--2 Sacred, holy, divine.
--3
Adorable, worthy of worship.
--4 Devout,
pious.
--यः
1 A god, deity.
--2 The
third or Dvāpara age.
