यज्वन्
यज्वन् a. (यज्वरी f.) [यज्-क्वनिप्]
Sacrificing, worshipping, adoring
&c. --m.
1 One who performs
sacrifices in accordance with Vedic
precepts, a performer of sacrifices;
नीपान्वयः पार्थिव एष यज्वा R. 6. 46,
