यत्र
यत्र ind. [यद्-त्रल्]
1 Where, in
which place, whither; सैव सा (द्यौः)
चलति यत्र हि चित्तं N. 5. 57;
Ku. 1. 7, 10.
--2 When; as in यत्र काले.
--3
Whereas, because, since, as. (यत्र
यत्र means ‘wherever’; यत्र यत्र
धूमस्तत्र तत्र वह्निः T. S.; यत्र तत्र in whatever
place, everywhere; यत्रकुत्र or
यत्रक्वचन क्वापि {1} wheresoever, in
whatever place. {2} whensoever, at
whatever time. {3} whenever, as often
as. {4} hither and thither).
