यंतृ|यन्तृ
यंतृ a [यम्-तृच्]
1 Restraining,
curbing, controlling.
--2 Guiding,
directing. --m.
1 A director,
governor, ruler.
--2 A driver (as of
an elephant, carriage &c.); coachman,
charioteer; यंता गजस्याभ्यपतद्गजस्थं
R. 7. 37; अथ यंतारमादिश्य धुर्यान्
विश्रामयेति सः 1. 54.
--3 An
elephantdriver or rider.
