यम्
यम् {c1c} P. (यच्छति, ययाम,
अयंसीत्, यंस्यति, यंतुं, यत; desid.
यियंसति)
1 To check, curb, restrain,
control, subdue, stop, suppress;
यच्छेद्बाङ्मनसी प्रज्ञः Kaṭh; यतचित्तात्मन्
Bg. 4. 21; see यत.
--2 To offer, give,
bestow.
--3 Ved. To support, sustain.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0889-a" target="_blank">Page0889-a+ 56</a>]
--4 To raise, lift up.
--5 To extend,
stretch.
--6 To go.
--7 To exhibit,
show. --Caus. (यमयति-ते) To
restrain, check &c.
