यमक|यमकं|यमकः
यमक a. [यम-स्वार्थे क]
1
Twinborn, twin.
--2 Twofold, double.
--कः
1 A restraint, check.
--2 A
twin; one of a pair, a fellow.
--3 A
great moral or religious duty; see
यम (4).
--कं
1 A double bandage.
--2 (In Rhet.) Repetition in the
same stanza (in any part of it) of
words or syllables similar in sound,
but different in meaning, a kind of
rhyme, (of which various kinds are
enumerated; see Kāv. 3. 2-52);
आवृत्तिं वर्णसंघातगोचरां यमकं विदुः
Kāv. 1. 61, 3. 1; S. D. 640.
