[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0892-b" target="_blank">Page0892-b+ 55</a>]
entertainment.
--Comp.
--उत्सवः a
festive procession.
--करणं an
expedition, a march.
--प्रसंगः going on a
pilgrimage.
