युक्त|युक्तं|युक्तः
युक्त p. p. [यज्-क्त]
1 Joined,
united.
--2 Fastened, yoked,
harnessed.
--3 Fitted out, arranged.
--4
Accompanied.
--5 Furnished or
endowed with, filled with, having,
possessing (with instr. or in comp.).
--6 Fixed or intent on, absorbed or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0894-a" target="_blank">Page0894-a+ 58</a>]
engaged in, devoted to; (with loc.)
U. 1. 11, Pt. 1. 284.
--7 Used,
employed.
--8 Adapted, fitted.
--9
Appointed.
--10 Connected with.
--11 Proved, inferred,
--12 Active,
diligent.
--13 Skilful, experienced,
clever.
--14 Fit, proper, right,
suitable (with gen. or loc.).
--15
Primitive, not derived (from another
word).
