युज्
युज् a. (At the end of comp.)
1 Joined or united with, yoked,
drawn by &c.
--2 Furnished or
filled with, possessed of.
--3 Exciting,
setting on.
--4 Even, not odd. --m.
1 A joiner, one who unites or joins.
--2 A sage, one who devotes
himself to abstract meditation.
--3 A
pair, couple (n. also in this sense).
--m. dual.
1 The sign Gemimi of the
zodiac.
--2 The two Aśvins.
