येन
येन ind. (Strictly instr. sing.
of यद used adverbially)
1
Whereby, by which, wherefore, on which
account, by means of which; किं
तद्येन मनो हर्तुमलं स्यातां न शृण्वतां
R. 15. 64, 14. 74.
--2 So that; दर्शय तं
चौरसिंहं येन व्यापादयामि Pt. 4.
--3
Since, because.
