योजनं|योजन
योजनं [युज्-भावादौ ल्युट्]
1 Joining,
uniting, yoking.
--2 Applying, fixing.
--3 Preparation, arrangement.
--4
Grammatical construction,
construing the sense of a passage.
--5 A
measure of distance equal to four
Krośas or eight or nine miles; न
योजनशतं दूंरं वाह्यमानस्य तृष्णया
H. 1. 146.
--6 Exciting, instigation.
--7
Concentration of the mind,
abstraction (= योग q. v.).
--8 Erecting,
constructing (also योजना in this sense).
--9 Ved. Effort, exertion.
--10 A
road, way.
--ना
1 Junction, union,
connection.
--2 Grammatical
construction.
--Comp.
--गंधा {1} musk.
{2} N. of Satyavatī, mother of
Vyāsa. {3} of Sītā.
