रत|रतं
रत p. p. [रम्-कर्तरि क्त]
1
Pleased, delighted, gratified.
--2 Pleased
or delighted with, fond of,
enamoured of, fondly attached to.
--3
Inclined to, disposed.
--4 Loved,
beloved.
--5 Intent on, engaged in,
devoted to; (see रम्).
--तं
1 Pleasure.
--2 Sexual union, coition;
R. 19. 23, 25; Me. 89.
--3 The private
parts.
--Comp.
--अंदुकः, --आमर्दः a
dog.
--अयनी a prostitute, harlot.
--अर्थिन् a. lustful, lascivious.
--उद्वहः the (Indian) cuckoo.
--ऋद्धिक
{1} a day. {2} the eight auspicious
objects. {3} bathing for pleasure
--कीलः a dog.
--कूजितं lustful or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0903-a" target="_blank">Page0903-a+ 56</a>]
lascivious murmur.
--गुरुः a husband.
--ज्वरः a crow.
--तालिन् m. a libertine,
sensualist.
--ताली a procuress,
bawd.
--नारीचः {1} a voluptuary.
{2} the god of love, Cupid. {3} a
dog. {4} lascivious murmur.
--निधिः
the wagtail.
--बंधः sexual union.
--वर्णः a dog.
--शायिन् m. a dog.
--हिंडकः {1} a ravisher or seducer
of women. {2} a voluptuary.
