<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रहित|रहितं
रहित p. p. [रह्-कर्मणि क्त]
1
Quitted, left, abandoned, deserted.
--2 Separated from, free from,
deprived or destitute of, without (with
instr. or at the end of comp.);
रहिते भिक्षुभिर्ग्रामे Y. 3. 59; गुणरहितः;
सत्त्वरहितः &c.
--3 Lonely, solitary.
--तं Secrecy, privacy.
