<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राज्
राज् m., राजः
1 A king, chief,
prince.
--2 Anything best of its
kind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0908-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राजकः|राजक|राजकं
राजकः A little king, a petty
prince.
--कं A number of kings or
princes, a collection of sovereigns;
सहते न जनोऽप्यधः क्रियां किमु लोकाधि
कधाम राजकं Ki. 2. 47; Śi. 14. 43.
