राजायते
राजायते Den. A. To act like a
king, consider oneself a king.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0909-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राजसात्
राजसात् ind. To the state or in
the possession of a king.
