राज्ञी
राज्ञी
1 A queen, the wife of a
king.
--2 Yellowish-red brass.
--3 N.
of the wife of the sun.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0909-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
