<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राजस|राजसः
राजस a. (सी f.) [रजसा निर्मितं
अण्] Relating to or influenced by
the quality rajas, endowed with the
quality rajas or passion; ऊर्ध्व
गच्छंति सत्त्वस्था मध्ये तिष्ठंति राजसाः
Bg. 14. 18; 7. 12; 17. 2.
