--गत a. {1} heaped,
piled up. {2} summed up.
--चक्रं
the zodiac.
--त्रयं the rule of three.
--नामन् n. a name given to a child
taken from the Rāśi under which
he is born.
--भागः a fraction.
˚अनुबंधः the addition of fractions.
--भोगः the passage of the sun, moon, or
any planet through a sign of the
zodiac.
