रुक्मिणी
रुक्मिणी The daughter of
Bhīshmaka of Vidarbha. [She was
betrothed by her father to Śiśupāla, but
she secretly loved Kṛṣṇa and sent
him a letter praying him to take her
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0914-a" target="_blank">Page0914-a+ 57</a>]
away. Kṛṣṇa with Balarāma came
and snatched her off after having
defeated her brother in battle. She bore
to Kṛṣṇa a son named Pradyumna.].
