--2 Splendour, loveliness,
beauty.
--3 Colour, appearance (at
the end of comp.);
चलवन्भृंगरुचस्तवालकान् R. 8. 53; Ku. 3. 65;
Ś. 1. 16; Ki. 5. 45.
--4 Liking,
desire.
--5 Lightning.
--6 The note
of the parrot or Mainā.
