रुचक a. [रुच्-क्वुन्]
1 Agreeable,
pleasing.
--2 Stomachic.
--3 Sharp,
acrid.
--कः
1 The citron.
--2 A pigeon.
--कं
1 A tooth.
--2 A golden ornament
especially for the neck.
--3 A tonic,
stomachic.
--4 A wreath, garland.
--5 Sochal salt.
--6 A curl on a horse's
neck.
--7 A lucky object.
--8 A
building having terraces on three
sides and closed on the north only.
--9 Alkali.
