[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0914-c" target="_blank">Page0914-c+ 56</a>]
effort, trouble.
--5 A ewe.
--6
Leprosy.
--Comp.
--कर a. causing
pain, sickening.
--(रः) a disease,
sickness, illness.
--प्रतिक्रिया
counteraction or treatment of disease, curing,
practice of medicine.
--भेषजं a
medicine.
--सद्मत् n. feces,
excrement.
