रुध्
रुध् {vI.v} {c7c} U. (रुणद्धि, रुंद्धे, रुरोध, रुरुधे,
अरुधत्-अरौत्सीत्-अरुद्ध, रोत्स्यति-ते, रोद्धुं,
रुद्ध; desid. रुरुत्सति-ते)
1 To obstruct,
stop, arrest, check, oppose, hinder;
impede, prevent इदं रुणद्धि मां
पद्ममंतःकूजितषट्पदं V. 4. 21; रुद्धालोके
नरपतिपथे Me. 37, 91; प्राणापानगती रुद्ध्वा
Bg. 4. 29.
--2 To hold up, preserve,
sustain (from falling); आशाबंधः
कुसुमसदृशं प्रायशो ह्यंगनानां सद्यःपाति
प्रणयि हृदयं विप्रयोगे रुणद्धि Me. 10.
--3
(a) To shut up, lock or block up,
close up, shut or close; (with loc.,
but sometimes with two acc.);
Bk. 6. 35; व्रजं रुणद्धि गां Sk. (b) To
surround, fence or hem in.
--4 To
bind, confine; व्यालं
बालमृणालतंतुभिरसौ रोद्धुं समुज्जृभते Bh. 2. 6.
--5 To
besiege, invest, blockade; रुंधंतु
वारणघटा नगरं मदीयाः Mu. 4. 17;
अरुणद्यवनः साकेतं or माध्यमिकान् Mbh.;
Bk. 14. 29.
--6 To hide, cover,
obscure, conceal.
--7 To oppress,
torment, afflict excessively. --Caus.
1
To cause to stop, detain, impede,
obstruct.
--2 To fetter, confine,
chain.
--3 To oppress, torment,
harass. {vII.v} {c1c} P. (रोधति) To grow,
germinate, cf. रुह्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0915-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

