रूक्ष्
रूक्ष् {c10c} U. (रूक्षयति-ते)
1 To be
rough or harsh.
--2 To be unkind.
--3 Ved. To make dry.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0915-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्ष|रूक्षं|रूक्षः
रूक्ष a.
1 Rough, harsh, not
smooth or soft (as touch, sound
&c.), रूक्षस्वरं वाशति वायसोऽयं
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0916-a" target="_blank">Page0916-a+ 57</a>]
Mk. 9. 10; Ku. 7. 17.
--2 Astringent
(taste).
--3 Rough, uneven,
difficult, austere.
--4 Sullied, soiled,
dirtied; R. 7. 70; Mu. 4, 5.
--5
Cruel, unkind, harsh;
नितांतरूक्षाभिनिवेशमीशं R. 14. 43; संरभंरूक्षमिव
सुंदरि यद्यदासीत् V. 3. 20; Ś. 7. 32;
Pt. 4. 91.
--6 Arid, parched up, dry,
dreary; स्निग्धश्यामाः क्वचिदपरतो
भीषणाभोगरूक्षाः U. 2. 14. (रूक्षीकृ means
‘to make rough’, ‘soil’,
‘besmear)’.
--क्षः A tree.
--Comp.
--गंधः, --गंधकः bdellium.
--पत्रः the
Śākhoṭa tree.
--पेषं ind. without
the addition of any liquid; as in
रूक्षपेषं पिनष्टि.
