लयः|लय
लयः [ली-अच्]
1 Sticking, union,
adherence.
--2 Lurking, hiding.
--3
Fusion, melting, solution.
--4
Disappearance, dissolution, extinction,
destruction; universal destruction
(प्रलय); लयंया ‘to be dissolved or
destroyed’.
--5 Absorption of the
mind, deep concentration, exclusive
devotion (to any one object); पश्यंती
शिवरूपिणं लयवशादात्मानमभ्यागता
Māl. 5. 2, 7; ध्यानलयेन Gīt. 4.
--6 Time
in music (of three kinds द्रत, मध्य,
and विलंबित); किसलयैः सलयैरिव
पाणिभिः R. 9. 35; पादन्यासो लयमनुगतः
M. 2. 9.
--7 A pause in music.
--8 Rest,
repose.
--9 A place of rest, abode,
habitation; अलया Śi. 4. 57 ‘having
no fixed abode, wandering’.
--10
Slackness of mind, mental inactivity.
--11 An embrace.
--12 The supreme
being.
--13 The union of song,
dance, and instrumental music.
--Comp.
--अर्कः the sun at the
destruction of the universe.
--आरंभः --आलंभः an actor, a dancer.
--कालः the time of destruction (of
the world).
--गत a. dissolved,
melted away.
--पुत्री an actress, a
female dancer.
