ललाम|ललामं|ललामः
ललाम a. (मी f.)
1 Beautiful,
lovely, charming.
--2 Having a mark on
the forehead marked with a blaze.
--मं
1 An ornament for the forehead,
an ornament or decoration in
general; (m. also in this sense); अहं तु
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0925-c" target="_blank">Page0925-c+ 56</a>]
तामाश्रमललामभूतां शकुंतलामधिकृत्य ब्रवीमि
Ś. 2; Śi. 4. 28.
--2 Anything the
best of its kind.
--3 A mark on the
forehead.
--4 A sign, symbol, mark
in general.
--5 A banner, flag.
--6 A
row, series, line.
--7 A tail.
--8
A mane.
--9 Eminence, dignity,
beauty.
--10 A horn.
--मः A horse.
