लसता हसतीव स्तनद्वयं K. P. 10;
करवाणि चरणद्वयं सरसलसदलक्तकरागं
Gīt. 10; Amaru. 16; N. 22. 53.
--2 To
appear, arise, come to light.
--3 To
embrace.
--4 To play, frolic about,
skip about, dance.
--5 To sound,
resound. --Caus. (लासयति-ते)
1 To
cause to shine, grace, adorn.
--2 To
cause to dance.
--3 To exercise an art.
