1 One who is
acquainted with marks or signs.
--2
Characteristic, indicatory.
--3 Having a
secondary sense, used in a
secondary sense (as a word, as
distinguished from वाच्य and व्यंजक
q. v.); स्याद्वाचंको लाक्षणिकः
शब्दोऽत्र व्यंजकस्त्रिधा K. P. 2.
--4
Expressing indirectly or figuratively.
--5
Secondary, inferior.
--6 Technical.
--कः A technical term.
