लीलावत्|लीलावन्त्
लीलावत् a.
1 Sportive, playful.
--2
Beautiful, graceful.
--ती
1 A
charming or handsome woman.
--2
An amorous or wanton woman.
--3
N. of Durgā.
--4 N. of a
wellknown mathematical work by
Bhāskarāchārya.
--5 N. of the wife of
the demon Maya.
