लुब्ध|लुब्धः
लुब्ध p. p. [लुभ्-क्त]
1 Greedy,
covetous, avaricious.
--2 Desirous
of, longing for, greedy of; as in
धनलुब्ध, मांसलुब्ध, गुणलुब्ध &c.
--ब्धः
1 A hunter.
--2 A libertine, lecher.
