वच्
वच् {c2c} P. (A. also in
non-conjugational tenses; in conjugational
tenses it is said to be defective in
the third person plural by some
authorities, or in the whole plural
by others; वक्ति, उवाच, अवोचत्, वक्ष्यति,
वक्तुं, उक्त)
1 To say, speak; वैराग्यादिव
वक्षि K. P. 10; (oft. with two. acc.);
तामूचतुस्ते प्रियमप्यमिथ्या R. 14. 6;
sometimes with accusative of words
meaning ‘speech’; उवाच धात्र्या
प्रथमोदितं वचः R. 3. 25, 2. 59; क एवं
वक्ष्यते वाक्यं Rām.
--2 To relate,
describe; रघूणामन्वयं वक्ष्ये R. 1. 9.
--3
To tell, communicate, announce,
declare; उच्यतां मद्वचनात्सारथिः Ś. 2;
Me. 98.
--4 To name, call;
तदेकसप्ततिगुणं मन्बंतरमिहोच्यते Ms. 1. 79.
--5
To signify, denote (as sense).
--6
To recite, repeat.
--7 To censure;
reproach. --Caus. (वाचयति-ते)
1 To
cause to speak.
--2 To go over, read,
peruse.
--3 To say, tell, declare.
--4
To promise. --Desid. (विवक्षति) To
wish to speak, intend to say
(something); विवक्षता दोषमपि
च्युतात्मना त्वयैकमीशं प्रति साधु भाषितं
Ku. 5. 81.
