--4 A stem, trunk.
--5 A beam; pole, post.
--6 A
sacrificial post.
--7 An offering to
Vanaspati.
--8 A wooden amulet.
--9 A scaffold.
--10 An ascetic.
--Comp.
--कावः the whole world
of plants, vegetable kingdom.
