वर्धमान a. [वृध् --शानच्] Growing,
increasing.
--नः
1 The castor-oil
plant.
--2 A kind of riddle.
--3 N.
of Viṣṇu.
--4 N. of a district (said
to be the same as the modern
Bardvāna).
--5 Sweet citron.
--नः, --नं
1
A pot or dish of a particular shape,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">Page0949-c+ 55</a>]
lid.
--2 A kind of mystical diagram.
--3 A palace or temple built in the
form of the above diagram.
--4 A
house having no door on the south
side.
--ना N. of a district (the
modern Bardvāna).
--Comp.
--पुरं the
city of Bardvāna.
