वर्षा
वर्षा (Usually f. pl.)
1 The rainy
season, the rains, the monsoon;
ग्रीष्मे पंचाग्निमध्यस्थो वर्षासु स्थंडिलेशयः
Y. 3. 52; Bk. 7. 1.
--2 Rain (sing.
in this sense).
--Comp.
--कालः
the rains, the rainy season; so
वर्षासमयः.
--कालीन a. belonging to or
produced in the rainy season.
--प्रभंजनः a high wind.
--भू m. {1} a
frog. {2} a kind of insect (इंद्रगोप).
--भूः, --भ्वी f. {1} a female frog or a
little frog. {2} hogweed. {3} an
earth-worm.
--रात्रः {1} a night in
the rainy season. {2} the rainy
season.
