1 Scenting,
perfuming, infusing, fumigating &c.
--2
Causing to dwell, populating.
--कं
Clothes.
--Comp.
--सज्जा, --सज्जिका
a woman who dresses herself
in all her ornaments and keeps
herself (and her house) ready
