<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकारिन्
विकारिन् a.
1 Liable to change,
susceptible of emotions or
impressions; भ्रमति भुवने कंदर्पाज्ञा विकारि च
यौवनं Māl. 1. 17.
--2 Changing,
modifying.
--3 Spoiling, corrupting.
--4
Affected by love.
