विचर्
विचर् {c1c} P.
1 To wander about,
roam over (oft. with acc.);
इष्टान्देशान् विचर जलद Me. 115; विचचार दावं
R. 2. 8; Ku. 3. 31.
--2 To do,
perform, practise.
--3 To act, deal,
behave.
