--5 To pass through, pervade.
--6 To attack, march against.
--7 To
associate or have intercourse with.
--8 To go badly, fail. --Caus.
1 To
think, reflect or meditate upon.
--2
To discuss, call in question, debate;
आज्ञा गुरूणां ह्यविचारणीया R. 14. 46.
--3 To calculate, estimate; take into
account, consider; परेषामात्मनश्चैव यो
विचार्य बलाबलं Pt. 3; सुविचार्य यत्कृतं
H. 1. 22.
--4 To hesitate, doubt.
--5
To examine, investigate.
--6 To
seduce.
