विचिकित्सा
विचिकित्सा
1 Doubt, hesitation,
uncertainty.
--2 Mistake, error.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0970-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्र|विचित्रं|विचित्रः
विचित्र a.
1 Diversified,
variegated, spotted, speckled;
Mu. 1. 4.
--2 Various, varied.
--3 Painted.
--4 Beautiful, lovely; क्वचिद्विचित्रं
जलयंत्रमंदिरं Rs. 1. 2.
--5 Wonderful,
surprising, strange; हतविधिलसितानां
ही विचित्रो विपाकः Śi. 11. 64.
--त्रा
A white deer.
--त्रं
1 Variegated
colour.
--2 Surprise.
--Comp.
--अंग
a. having a spotted body.
--(गः) {1}
a peacock. {2} tiger.
--देह a. having a
lovely body.
--(हः) a cloud.
--रूप a.
diverse.
--वीर्यः N. of a king of the
lunar race. [He was a son of Śantanu by
his wife Satyavatī and so half-brother
of Bhīṣma. When he died childless,
his mother called Vyāsa (her own son
before her marriage), and requested
him to raise up issue to Vicitravīrya in
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0970-b" target="_blank">Page0970-b+ 56</a>]
accordance with the practice of Niyoga.
He complied with the request, and
begot on Ambikā and Ambālikā, the two
widows of his brother, two sons
Dhṛtarāṣṭra and Pāṇḍu respectively].
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0970-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

