विच्छित्तिः|विच्छित्ति
विच्छित्तिः f.
1 (a) Cutting off or
asunder, tearing off; Bh. 3. 11.
(b) Breaking off, fracture.
--2
Dividing, separating.
--3
Disappearance, absence, loss.
--4
Cessation.
--5 Colouring the body with
paints and unguents, painting
colours, rouge; विच्छित्तिशेषैः सुरसुंदरीणां
Ś. 7. 5; Śi. 16. 84.
--6 Limit,
boundary (of a house &c.).
--7 A
pause in a verse, cæsura.
--8 A
particular kind of amorous gesture,
consisting in carelessness in dress
and decoration (through pride of
personal beauty);
स्तोकाप्याकल्परचना विच्छित्तिः कांतिपोषकृत् S. D. 138.
