विज्ञा
विज्ञा {c9c} U.
1 To know, be aware
of; Bh. 3. 21.
--2 To learn,
comprehend, understand.
--3 To
ascertain, find out, learn from.
--4 To
regard, know to be, consider as.
--5
To discern, discriminate,
distinguish.
--6 To be familiar with.
--7
To become wise or learned;
Ms. 4. 20. --Caus. (विज्ञापयति)
1 To
request, beg (opp. आज्ञापयति);
सीता-आर्यपुत्र अस्ति मे विज्ञाप्यं;
रामः-नन्वाज्ञापय U. 1; R. 5. 20.
--2 To
communicate, inform.
--3 To say,
speak in general.
--4 To teach,
instruct.
