वितन्
वितन् {c8c} U.
1 To spread, stretch;
स्फुरितविततजिह्वः Mk. 9. 12;
Ki. 15. 53, Śi. 5. 38, 14. 53.
--2 To cover,
fill; प्रस्वेदबिंदुविततं वदनं प्रियायाः
Ch. P. 9; यो वितत्व स्थितः खं Me. 58.
--3
To form, make;
श्रेणीबंधाद्वितन्वद्धिरस्तंभां तोरणस्रजं R. 1. 41;
Ki. 16. 51.
--4 To stretch, string
(as a bow); U. 6. 1;
Bk. 3. 47.
--5 To cause, produce,
create, give, bestow; V. 1. 4.
--6
To write or compose (as a work);
विराटपर्वप्रद्योती भावदीपो वितन्यते.
--7
To do or perform (as a sacrifice or
any other rite); Ku. 2. 46.
--8 To
unfold, manifest, exhibit, show;
Māl. 9. 11.
--9 To perform, carry
out, accomplish.
--10 To prepare,
make ready.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0973-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

