विधू
विधू {5} {c10c} U., {c6c} P.
1 To shake,
move, cause to tremble;
वायुर्विधूनयति चंपकपुष्परेणून् Kavirahasya;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0978-a" target="_blank">Page0978-a+ 57</a>]
मृदुपवनविधूतान् Rs. 6. 29; 3. 10;
