विप्रलापः|विप्रलाप
विप्रलापः
1 Idle or unmeaning talk,
prattle, gibberish, nonsense.
--2
Mutual contradiction,
contradictory statement.
--3 A dispute,
wrangling.
--4 Violation of one's
promise, breaking one's word.
