विप्लवः|विप्लव
विप्लवः
1 Floating or drifting
about, floating in different directions.
--2 Opposition, contrariety.
--3
Confusion, perplexity.
--4 Tumult, scuffle,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0983-c" target="_blank">Page0983-c+ 55</a>]
affray; M. 1.
--5 Devastation,
predatory warfare; danger from an
enemy.
--6 Extortion.
--7 Loss,
destruction; सत्त्वविप्लवात् R. 8. 41.
--8
Adverseness, evil turn; अथवा मम
भाग्यविप्लवात् R. 8. 47.
--9 The rust
on a mirror (dust accumulating on
its surface); अपवर्जितविप्लवे शुचौ…
मतिरादर्श इवाभिदृश्यते Ki. 2. 26 (where
विप्लव also means प्रमाणबाधः ‘absence of
reasoning’).
--10 Transgression,
violation; Ki. 1. 13.
--11 An evil, a
calamity.
--12 Sin, wickedness,
sinfulness.
--13 Terrifying an enemy by
shouts and gestures.
--14 Divulging,
making public.
