विभ्रम्
विभ्रम् {c1c} {c4c} P.
1 To roam,
wander about.
--2 To hover, whirl or
wheel round.
--3 To scare away,
disperse, scatter about.
--4 To be
confused or disordered, be
bewildered or perplexed; Bg. 16. 16.
--Caus. To confuse, confound;
प्रभामत्तश्चंद्रो जगादिदमहो विभ्रमयति
K. P. 10.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0985-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
