विरागः|विराग
विरागः
1 Change of colour.
--2
Change of disposition, disaffection,
discontent, dissatisfaction;
विरागकारणेषु परिहृतेषु Mu. 1.
--3 Aversion,
disinclination.
--4 Indifference to
worldly attachments, freedom from
passion.
