विराज्
विराज् {c1c} U.
1 To shine, glitter;
Bv. 1. 88.
--2 To appear or look
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0988-c" target="_blank">Page0988-c+ 56</a>]
like; R. 2. 20.
--3 To be eminent
or illustrious. --Caus. To brighten,
illuminate, irradiate.
