विराटः|विराट
विराटः
1 N. of a district in
India.
--2 N. of a king of the
Matsyas. The Pāṇḍavas lived
incognito in the service of this king
for one year, (the thirteenth of their
exile) having assumed different
disguises. His daughter Uttarā was
married to Abhimanyu and was mother
of Parīkṣit who succeeded
Yudhisṭhira to the throne of Hastināpura.
--Comp.
--जः a sort of inferior
diamond.
--पर्वन् n. the fourth book
of the Mahābhārata.
