विलयनं|विलयन
विलयनं
1 Dissolving, liquefying,
dissolution.
--2 Corroding.
--3
Removing, taking away.
--4
Attenuating.
--5 An attenuant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0990-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
