विवरं|विवर|विवरः
विवरं
1 A fissure, hole, cavity,
hollow, vacuity; यच्चकार विवरं
शिलाघने ताडकोरसि स रामसायकः
R. 11. 18, 9. 61, 19. 7; धीरनादभरितकर्णविवरं
प्रिये मदयंतिके इति व्याहरति Māl. 7.
--2
An interstice, interval, intervening
space; Ś. 7. 7.
--3 A solitary place;
Ki. 12. 37.
--4 A fault, flaw, defect, weak
point.
--5 A breach, wound.
--6 The
number ‘nine’.
--रः Expansion.
--Comp.
--नालिका a flute, fife
--प्रवेशः entrance into a chasm (one
of the means of getting one's
desired object); Pt. 5.
