--2
To go or come to, come into the
possession of, fall to the share of;
उपदा विविशुः शश्वन्नात्सेकाः कोशलेश्वरं
R. 4. 70.
--3 To sit or settle down
upon.
--4 To penetrate, pervade.
--5
To enter upon, undertake. --Caus.
(वेशयति-ते) To cause to enter.
--Desid. (विपिक्षति) To wish to
enter.
