pleasures of sense, a sensualist.
--2
A man of the world.
--3 The god
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0999-b" target="_blank">Page0999-b+ 55</a>]
of love.
--4 A king.
--5 An organ of
sense.
--6 A materialist.
