विसर्जनं|विसर्जन|विसर्ज्जनं
विसर्जनं
1 Emitting, sending forth,
pouring down; समतया
वसुवृष्टिविसर्जनैः R. 9. 6.
--2 Giving away, a gift,
donation; R. 9. 6.
--3 Voiding;
Ms. 4. 48.
--4 Casting off, quitting,
abandoning; श्रुतदेहविसर्जनः पितुः
R. 8. 25.
--5 Sending away, dismissal.
--6 Allowing (the deity invoked)
to go (opp. आवाहन).
--7 Setting a
bull at liberty on certain occasions.
