विस्तृ
विस्तृ {c5c} U., विस्तॄ {c9c} U.
1 To
spread, diffuse.
--2 To cover, fill.
--3
To extend, expand.
--4 To strew
or scatter about. --Caus.
1 To
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">Page1001-c+ 57</a>]
cause to spread or expand; as in
पयोधरविस्तारयितृकं यौवनं Ś. 1.
