वी {vI.v} {c2c} P. (वेति, rarely used in
classical literature)
1 To go, move.
--2 To approach.
--3 To pervade.
--4
To bring, convey.
--5 To throw,
cast.
--6 To eat, consume.
--7 To
obtain.
--8 To conceive, bring forth.
--9 To be born or produced.
--10
To shine, be beautiful.
--11 To
desire, wish.
--12 To shine. {vII.v} (वि +
इ) {c2c} P.
1 To go away, depart;
तस्यामहं त्वयि च सप्रांति वीतचिंतः
Ś. 4. 12; so वीतभय, वीतक्रोध.
--2 To
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">Page1003-c+ 68</a>]
undergo a change; सदृशं त्रिषु लिंगेषु
यन्न व्योति तदव्ययं Sk.
--3 To spend.
--4 To be diffused, to spread.
--5 To
vanish, disappear.
--6 To cross over,
traverse.
