V. 1. 4. {2} a strong or violent wind.
--आघातः {1} sudden arresting of
velocity, check of speed. {2}
obstruction of excretion, constipation.
--नाशनः the phlegmatic humour.
--रोधः
= ˚आघातः q. v.
--वाहिन् a. swift.
--विधारणं checking of speed.
--सरः
a mule.
