वैशेषिक|वैशेषिकः
वैशेषिक a. (की f.)
1
Characteristic.
--2 Belonging to the
Vaiśeshika doctrine.
--कः A follower of
the Vaiśeṣika doctrine.
--कं [
विशेषं पदार्थमेदमधिकृत्य कृतो ग्रंथः ठञ्] One
of the six principal Darśanas or
systems of Hindu philosophy founded
by Kaṇāda; it differs from the
Nyāya philosophy of Gautama in that it
recognizes only seven instead of
sixteen categories or heads of
predicables (the earlier writers, e. g.
Kaṇāda recognizing only six), and
lays particular stress upon Viśeṣa.
