व्यंग्य|व्यङ्ग्य|व्यङ्ग्यः
व्यंग्य a.
1 Indicated by
implication, indicated by covert or indirect
allusion.
--2 Suggested (as sense).
--ग्यं Suggested sense, insinuation,
the meaning hinted at (opp. वाच्य
‘the primary or expressed meaning’,
and लक्ष्य ‘the secondary or indicated
meaning’); इदमुत्तममतिशयिनि व्यंग्ये
वाच्याद् ध्वनिर्बुधैः कथितः K. P. 1.
--Comp.
--उक्तिः f. covert
expression, insinuation, inuendo.
