व्यक्त|व्यक्तः
व्यक्त p. p.
1 Manifested,
displayed.
--2 Developed, created;
Ku. 2. 11.
--3 Evident, manifest, clear,
plain, distinct, clearly visible;
Pt. 2. 92.
--4 Specified, known,
distinguished.
--5 Individual.
--6 Wise,
learned.
--7 Ved. Adorned,
decorated.
--क्तः N. of Viṣṇu.
--क्तं
That which is developed as the
product of अव्यक्त q. v.
--क्तं ind.
Clearly, evidently, certainly.
--Comp.
--गणितं arithmetic.
--दृष्टार्थः an
eye-witness, a witness in general.
--राशिः
a known quantity.
--रूपः an
epithet of Viṣṇu.
--विक्रम a.
displaying valour.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1016-c" target="_blank">PDF</a>
