<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतीत|व्यतीतः
व्यतीत p. p.
1 Passed, gone,
elapsed, passed over; R. 5. 14.
--2 Dead.
--3 Left, abandoned, departed from.
--4 Disregarded, omitted.
