<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यत्ययः|व्यत्यय
व्यत्ययः
1 Passing over.
--2
Opposition, contrariety.
--3 Inverted
order, inversion.
--4 Interchange,
transmutation.
--5 Obstruction,
hindrance; Pt. 4. 57.
