व्यभिचर्
व्यभिचर् {c1c} P.
1 To go astray,
deviate from; as in अव्यभिचरित
साध्यसामान्याधिकरण्यं व्यप्तिः Tarka K.
--2
To transgress against, be faithless to.
--3 To act crookedly.
--4 To offend,
injure.
--5 To fail, miscarry.
