व्यभिचारिणी
व्यभिचारिणी An unchaste wife,
adulteress.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभिचारिन्
व्यभिचारिन् a.
1 Straying or
deviating from, going astray, erring,
trespassing.
--2 Irregular,
anomalous.
--3 Untrue, false; see अव्याभचारन्.
--4 Faithless, unchaste, adulterous.
--5 Profligate, wanton.
--6
Departing from its usual meaning, having
several secondary meanings (as a
word) --m. व्यभिचारिभावः A
transitory feeling. an accessory (opp.
स्थायन or स्थायिभाव q. v.). (Though like
the Sthāyibhāvas these
accessories do not form a necessary
substratum of any rasa, still they
act as feeders to the prevailing
sentiment, and strengthen it in
various ways, whether openly or
covertly. They are said to be 33 or 34
in number; for an enumeration
of these, see K. P. 4 Kārikās 31-34,
S. D. 169; or R. G. first Ānana;
cf. विभाव and स्थायिभाव also).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यय्
व्यय् {vI.v} {c10c} U. (व्यययति-ते)
1 To
go, move.
--2 To expend, give
away, bestow. {vII.v} {c1c} U. (व्ययति-ते)
To go, move. {vIII.v} {c10c} U. (व्याययति-ते,
also व्यापयति-ते)
1 To throw, cast.
--2
To drive.
