व्यय|व्ययं|व्ययः
व्यय a. Liable to change,
mutable, perishable; cf. अव्यय.
--यः
1
(a) Loss, disappearance,
destruction; आपाद्यते न व्ययमंतरायैः
कच्चिन्महर्षेस्त्रविधं तपस्पत् R. 5. 5, 12. 23.
(b) Cost, sacrifice; प्राणव्ययेनापि
मया विधेयः Māl. 4. 5. Ku. 3. 23.
--2 Hindrance, obstacle;
भूयस्तपोव्ययो मा भूत् R. 15. 37.
--3 Decay,
decline, overthrow, downfall.
--4
Expenditure, expense, outlay,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1019-b" target="_blank">Page1019-b+ 56</a>]
spending, applying to use (opp. आय);
आये दुःख व्यये दुःख धिगर्थाः
कष्टसंश्रयाः Pt. 1. 163; आयधिकं व्ययं
करोति ‘he lives beyond his means’;
R. 5. 12, 15. 3; Ms. 9. 11.
--5
Extravagance, prodigality.
--Comp.
--पर a. lavish in expenditure;
Pt. 5. 61.
--पराङ्मुख a. stingy,
niggardly.
--शील a. spendthrift, prodigal.
--शुद्धिः f. defraying^1 of expenses.
[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar on 20210122. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/48.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

