व्यवस्था
व्यवस्था {c1c} A.
1 To be placed
asunder.
--2 To be arranged in due
order.
--3 To be settled or fixed,
become permanent, वचतीयमिदं
व्यवस्थितं Ku. 4. 21.
--4 To rest or
depend upon. --Caus.
1 To place or
rest upon, direct towards;
Ku. 7. 75.
--2 To arrange, manage, adjust.
--3 To settle, resolve, decree.
--4
To separate, place apart.
--5 To do,
perform.
--6 To lay down a rule or
law, enact a law.
