व्यवस्था
व्यवस्था
1 Adjustment,
arrangement, settlement; as in
वर्णाश्रमव्यवस्था.
--2 Fixity,
definiteness; R. 7. 54.
--3 Fixity,
firm basis; आजहतुस्तच्चरणौ
पृथिव्यां स्थलारविंदश्रियमव्यवस्थां
Ku. 1. 33.
--4 Relative position.
--5 A
settled rule, law, statute, decree,
decision, legal opinion, written
declaration of the law (especially
on doubtful points or where
contradictory texts have to be properly
adjusted).
--6 An agreement, a
contract.
--7 State, condition.
--8
State or order of things.
--9
Separation.
