<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनिन्
व्यसनिन् a.
1 Addicted to any
vice, vicious.
--2 Unlucky,
unfortunate.
--3 Intently attached or
excessively devoted to anything, fond
of (usually in comp.); किं
भूमृत्कटकस्थितिव्यसनिना व्यर्थं खुराः शातिताः
Subhāṣ.
