व्यस्त|व्यस्तः
व्यस्त p. p.
1 Cast or thrown
asunder, tossed about; Māl. 5. 23.
--2 Dispersed, scattered; U. 5. 14.
--3 Dispelled, cast away.
--4
Separated, divided, severed; हिमवति
जलधौ च व्यस्ततोयेव गंगा V. 5. 22.
--5 Taken or considered separately,
taken singly (opp. समस्त); एभिः
समस्तैरपि किमस्य किं पुतर्व्यस्तैः U. 5;
तदस्ति किं व्यस्तमपि त्रिलोचने
Ku. 5. 72.
--6 Simple, uncompounded (as
a word).
--7 Manifold, different.
--8 Removed, expelled.
--9 Agitated,
troubled, confused.
--10 Disordered,
out of order, disarranged.
--11
Reversed, upset.
--12 Inverse (as
ratio).
--13 Pervading, inherent
in.
--स्तं ind. Severally,
separately, singly.
--Comp.
--केश a. with
disordered or dishevelled hair.
--त्रैराशिकं the rule of three inverted.
--पदं {1} (in law) a confused
statement (of a case). {2} an
uncompounded or simple word.
--वृत्ति
a. the meaning of which is
changed, which has lost its force
(as a word); R. 11. 73.
