existing in, absent from (frequently
used in phil. in this sense); धूमो
जलहदादेर्व्यावृत्तः Tarka K.;
Mu. 5. 10.
--4 Revolved, turned round.
--5
Encompassed, surrounded.
--6
Desisting, ceased from; Ku. 2. 35.
--7 Split asunder.
--Comp.
--गति
a. desisting from any course of
action.
