व्रातीन|व्रातीनः
व्रातीन a.
1 Living by day-labour,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1026-c" target="_blank">Page1026-c+ 54</a>]
a hired labourer, coolie.
--2 One
living by violence.
