शक्य|शक्यः
शक्य pot. p.
1 Possible,
practicable, capable of being done or
effected (usually with an inf.); श
क्यो वारयितुं जलेन हुतभुक् Bh. 2. 11,
R. 2. 49, 54.
--2 Fit to be
effected.
--3 Easy to be effected.
--4 Directly conveyed or
expressed (as the meaning of a word);
शक्योऽर्थोऽभिधया ज्ञेयः S. D. 10.
--5
Potential. (The form शक्यं is some
times used as a predicative word
with an inf. in a passive sense, the
real object of the infinitive being
in the nom. case; एवं हि प्रणय
वती सा शक्यमुपेक्षितुं कुपिता
M. 3. 22; शक्यं…अविरलमालिंगितु पवनः
Ś. 3. 7, विभूतयः शक्यमव प्तुमूर्जिताः
Subhāṣ.; Bg. 18. 11.).
--Comp.
--अर्थः the meaning directly
expressed.
--प्रतीकार a. remediable.
