--3 Uncertain,
doubtful.
--4 Fearful, apprehensive,
alarmed; Pt. 1. 197.
--5 Weak,
unsteady; (see शंक्).
--Comp.
--चित,
--मनस् a. {1} timid, faint-hearted. {2}
suspicious, distrustful. {3} doubtful.
--वर्णः a thief.
