शंढः|शण्ढ|शंढ|शण्ढः
शंढः
1 A eunuch, an impotent
man.
--2 A male attendant in the
women's apartments (chosen from
the class of eunuchs or emasculated
persons).
--3 A bull.
--4 A bull at
liberty to move.
--5 A mad-man.
