शंतनुः|शन्तनु|शंतनु|शन्तनुः
शंतनुः N. of a king of the lunar
race. He married Gaṅgā and
Satyavatī; by the former wife he had a son
named Bhīṣma, and by the latter
Citrāṅgada and Vicitravīrya.
Bhīṣma remained a celibate all his
life, and his younger brothers died
childless; cf. भीष्म.
