शब्दित
शब्दित p. p.
1 Sounded, made
to give out a sound, played upon
(as a musical instrument).
--2
Uttered, articulated.
--3 Called, called
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1033-c" target="_blank">Page1033-c+ 57</a>]
out to.
--4 Named; designated.
--5
Explained.
--6 Made public,
manifested.
