--3 A place of refuge, resort,
asylum (applied to persons also);
स सुरासुरस्य जगतः शरणं Ki. 18. 22;
संतप्तानां त्वमसि शरणं Me. 7; शरणं
गमइ-या &c. ‘to go to for protection,
take shelter with, to submit to’;
यामि ह कमिह शरणं Gīt. 7.
--4 A
sanctuary, closet, an apartment;
अग्निशरणमार्गमादंशय Ś. 5.
--5 An
abode, a house, habitation;
Mu. 3. 15; Bk. 6. 9.
--6 Lair,
restingplace.
--7 Injuring, killing.
--Comp.
--अर्यिन् a.
--एषिन् a. {1} seeking
refuge or protection; Bh. 2. 76. {2}
unfortunate.
--आगत, --आपन्न a.
gone to for refuge or protection,
taking shelter with, fugitive.
--उन्तुख
a. looking up to for protection;
R. 6. 21.
