[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">Page1039-a+ 56</a>]
Relating to Śakti or the female
personification of divine energy
--क्तः A
worshipper of Śakti; (the Śāktas
are generally worshippers of Durgā
representing the female
personification of divine energy, and the ritual
enjoined to them is of two kinds,
the pure or right-hand ritual
दक्षिणाचार, and impure or left-hand ritual
वामाचार q.q. v.v.).
