शालः|शाल
शालः
1 N. of a tree (very tall
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1041-c" target="_blank">Page1041-c+ 55</a>]
and stately), Shorea Robusta;
R. 1. 38; Śi. 3. 40.
--2 A tree in
general; R. 1. 13; Ve. 4. 3.
--3 An enclosure, a fence.
--4
A kind of fish.
--5 N. of king
Sālivāhana.
--Comp.
--ग्रामः a kind
of sacred stone said to be typical
of Viṣṇu, as the Phallus is of
Śiva. ˚गिरि N. of a mountain. ˚शिला
the Sālagrāma stone.
--जः,
--निर्यास; exudation of the Sāla tree, resin;
R. 1. 38.
--भंजिका {1} a doll,
puppet, statue; Vb. 1; N. 2. 83. {2}
a courtezan, harlot.
--भंजी a doll,
puppet.
--वेष्ट्रः the resin of the
Sāla tree.; cf. साल.
--सारः {1} a
superior tree. {2} asa foetida.
