शास्तृ
शास्तृ m. [शास्-तृच् इडभावः]
1 A
teacher, an instructor.
--2 A ruler,
king, sovereign.
--3 A father.
--4
A Buddha or Jina; or a deified
teacher of the Bauddhas or Jainas.
