--अटकः {1} a hole. {2} a fence, an
enclosure. {3} a room on the top of a
house.
--आत्मजं iron.
--आत्मिका a
crucible.
--आरंभा the wild plantain.
--आसनं {1} a slab of stone used as a
seat. {2} benzoin.
--आह्वं bitumen.
--उच्चयः a mountain; huge rock;
