--क्रिया any
manual labour, handicraft.
--कारः,
--कारकः, --कारिन् m. an artisan, a
mechanic.
--विद्या {1} mechanical science.
{2} any manual skill, handicraft.
--शालं, --ला a workshop,
manufactory (a technical school).
--शास्त्रं
{1} a book on any art, fine or
mechanical. {2} mechanics.
