मृतोयैः शुध्यते शोध्यं नदी वेगेन शुध्यति ।
अद्भिर्गात्राणि शुध्यंति मनः सत्येन शुध्यति
Ms. 5. 108-9.
--2 To be
auspicious, favourable, or eligible;
तिथिरेव तावन्न शुध्यति Mu. 5.
--3 To be
made clear, have the doubts
removed; न शुध्यति मेंऽतरात्मा Mk. 8.
--4 To be defrayed or cleared; व्ययः
शुध्यति Pt. 5. --Caus. (शोधयति-ते)
1 To purify, cleanse, wash off.
--2
To clear, pay off (as a debt).
--3
To refine, filter.
--4 To correct.
--5
To acquit.
--6 To examine,
investigate, inquire into. --WITH परि, --वि,
सं to be purified; R. 12. 104;
Ms. 5. 64.
