शुभ्
शुभ् {c1c} A. शोभते
1 To shine, be
splendid, look beautiful or
handsome; सुष्ठु शोभसे एतेन विनयमाहात्म्येन
U. 1; R. 8. 6.
--2 To appear to
advantage; सुखं हि दुःखान्यनुभूय शोभते
Mk. 1. 10.
--3 To suit, become, befit
(with gen.); रामभद्र इत्येवोपचारः
शोभते तातपरिजनस्य U. 1.
--4 To be gay
or happy.
--5 To be victorious. --Caus.
(शोभयनि-ते) To decorate, adorn,
grace. --WITH परि, -वि to shine,
look splendid.
