सशैबलासंगमपि प्रकाशते Ku. 5. 9; Me. 28,
35.
--2 A flock, multitude, group;
U. 4.
--3 A guild or company of
traders, artisans &c., corporate body.
--4 A bucket.
--Comp.
--धर्माः (m.
pl.) the customs of trades or
guilds.
--बंध a. forming a row,
being in a line; R. 1. 41.
