षंडः|षण्ड|षंड|षण्डः
षंडः
1 A bull.
--2 A eunuch;
(14 or 20 classes of eunuchs are
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1064-1b" target="_blank">Page1064-1b+ 16</a>]
mentioned by different writers).
--3 A group, multitude;
collection, heap, quantity (n.
also in this sense); कलस्वमुपगीते
षट्पदौघेन धत्तः कुमुदकमलषंडे
तुल्यरूपामवस्थां Śi. 11. 15; cf. खंड also.
--डः, --डं A flock (of goats &c.).
