<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयज्
संयज् {c1c} U.
1 To adore,
worship; समयष्टास्त्रमंडलं Bk. 15. 96.
--2
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1066-1c" target="_blank">Page1066-1c+ 12</a>]
To consecrate, dedicate.
