संयमः|संयम
संयमः
1 Restraint, check, control;
श्रोत्रादीनींद्रियाण्यन्ये संयमाग्निषु जुह्वति
Bg. 4. 26, 27; so संयमधनः &c.
--2
Concentration of mind, a term
applied to the last three stages of
Yoga; धारणाध्यानसमाधित्रयमंतरंगं
संयमपदवाच्यं Sarva. S., Ku. 2. 59.
--3 A religious vow.
--4 Religious
devotion, practice of penance;
Ś. 4. 16.
--5 Humanity, feeling of
compassion.
--6 Any religious act on the
day preceding a vow or course of
penance.
