संयमनं|संयमन|संयमनः
संयमनं
1 Restraining, checking.
--2 Drawing in; Ś. 1.
--3 Binding,
tying up; U. 1; V. 3. 6.
--4
Confinement.
--5 Self-denial, control.
--6 A religious vow or obligation.
--7 A square of four houses.
--नः
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1067-b" target="_blank">Page1067-b+ 56</a>]
One who restrains or regulates, a
ruler.
