संयुज्
संयुज् {c7c} U.
1 To join together,
connect, unite.
--2 To endow or
furnish with.
--3 To form an
alliance.
--4 To place or fix in, set in.
--Pass. To be united with;
संयोक्ष्यसे स्वेन वर्पुमहिम्ना R. 5. 55. --Caus.
1 To unite, join; संयोजयति विद्यैव
नीचगापि नरंसरित् H. 1.
--2 To
harness, yoke.
--3 To prepare, equip
(an army).
--4 To furnish, endow
or supply with, provide with;
बुद्ध्या संयो जयंति तं Pt. 2.
--5 To
fasten or fix on.
--6 To throw,
discharge, shoot (a missile).
--7 To
use, employ.
--8 To appoint (to an
office), entrust with.
--9 To
perform, accomplish. --To be absorbed
in, meditate upon.
