--अभावः one of the two
main kinds of non-existence, relative
non-existence, which is of three
kinds -- प्रागभाव antecedent,
प्रध्वंप्ताभाव emergent, and अत्यंनाभाब absolute,
non-existence.
--दोषः. the fault or
evil consequences resulting from
association, especially with bad
people.
