संहारः|संहार
संहारः
1 Drawing or bringing
together, collecting; अनुभवनु
वेणीसंहारमहोत्सवं Ve. 6.
--2 Contraction,
compression, abridgment.
--3
Withholding, drawing back, withdrawal
(opp. प्रयोग or विक्षेप); प्रयोगसंह
रविभक्तमंत्रं R. 5. 57, 45.
--4
Restraining, holding back.
--5
Destruction, especially of the universe,
universal destruction.
--6 Close,
end, conclusion.
--7 An assemblage,
a group.
--8 A fault in
pronunciation.
--9 A charm or spell for
withdrawing magical weapons.
--10
Practice, skill.
--11 A division of
hell.
--Comp.
--भैरवः one of the
forms of Bhairava.
--मुद्रा N. of a
particular posture in the Tantra
worship; it is thus defined:--
अवोमुखे वामहस्ते ऊर्ध्वास्यं दक्षहस्तकं ।
क्षिप्तांगुलीरंगुलीभिः संगृह्य परिवर्तयेत्.
