--2 At one time, on one
occasion, formerly, once;
सकृत्कृतप्रणयोयं जनः Ś. 5.
--3 At once.
--4
Always.
--5 Together with. --m.
--f. Feces, excrement (usually
written शकृत् q. v.).
--Comp.
--गर्भा
{1} a mule. {2} a woman who is
pregnant only once.
--प्रजः a crow.
--प्रसूता, --प्रसूतिका {1} a woman who
has borne only one child. {2} a
cow that has calved once.
--फला
the plantain tree.
