संजयः|सञ्जय|संजय
संजयः N. of the charioteer of
king Dhṛtarāṣṭra. He tried to
bring about a peaceful settlement
of the dispute between the
Kauravas and Pāṇḍavas, but failed.
It was he who narrated the events
of the great Bhāratī war to the
blind king Dhṛtarāṣṭra; cf.
Bg. 1. 1.
