सत्त्रं|सत्र|सत्रं
सत्त्रं [सद्-ष्ट्रन्] (usually
written सत्रं)
1 A sacrificial session,
especially one lasting from 13 to 100
days.
--2 A sacrifice in general.
--3
An oblation, offering, or gift.
--4
Liberality, munificence.
--5 Virtue.
--6 A house, residence.
--7
Covering.
--8 Wealth.
--9 A wood, forest;
Ki. 13. 9.
--10 A tank, pond.
--11
Fraud, cheating.
--12 A place of
refuge, asylum, covert.
--Comp.
--अपश्रयः a place of refuge, asylum.
--अयनं (णं) a long sacrificial session.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1084-a" target="_blank">Page1084-a+ 56</a>]
--परिवेषणं distribution of food at a
sacrifice.
--शाला an alms-house.
