संदेहः|सन्देह|संदेह|सन्देहः
संदेहः
1 Doubt, uncertainty,
suspense; अत्र कः संदेहः.
--2 Risk,
danger, peril; जीवितसंदेहदोलामारोपितः
K.; अर्थार्जने प्रवृत्तिः ससंदेहा H. 1;
Pt. 1. 176.
--3 (In Rhet.) Doubt
regarded as a figure of speech, in
which the close resemblance
between two objects leads to one
of them being mistaken for the
other (this figure is also called
ससंदेह by Mammaṭa and others);
ससंदेहस्तु भेदोक्तौ तदनुक्तौ च संशयः
K. P. 10; e. g. see Māl. 1. 2 (l. 3);
V. 3. 2.
--Comp.
--दोला the swing of
uncertainty, a state of suspense,
dilemma, fix.
