<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधा
संधा
1 Union, association.
--2
Intimate union, close connection.
--3 State, condition.
--4 An
agreement, a promise, stipulation,
compact; ततार संधामिव सत्यसंधः
R. 14. 52; Mv. 7. 8.
--5 Limit, boundary.
--6 Fixity, steadiness.
--7 Twilight.
--8 Distillation (for संधान q. v.).
--9
Steady continuance in any state.
