संधानं|सन्धान|संधान|सन्धानं
संधानं
1 Joining, uniting.
--2
Union, junction, combination; यदर्धे
विच्छिन्नं भवति कृतसंधानमिव तत्
Ś. 1. 9; Ku. 5. 27; R. 12. 101.
--3
Mixing, compounding (of medicines
&c.).
--4 Restoration, repairing.
--5
Fitting, taking an aim, fixing (as
an arrow to the bow-string);
तत्साधुकृतसंधानं प्रतिसंहर सायकं Ś. 1. 11;
Śi. 20. 8.
--6 Alliance, league, friendship,
peace; मृद्घटवत्सुखभेद्यो दुःसंधानश्च
दुर्जनो भवति H. 1. 92 (where it has
sense 1 also).
--7 A joint;
पादजंघयोः संधाने गुल्फः Suśr.
--8 Attention.
--9 Direction.
--10 Supporting.
--11 Distillation (of liquors).
--12
Spirituous liquor or a kind of it.
--13 A kind of relish eaten to excite
thirst.
--14 Preparation of pickles.
--15 Contraction of the skin by
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1089-a" target="_blank">Page1089-a+ 56</a>]
means of astringents.
--16 Sour
rice-gruel.
--17 Bell-metal (सौराष्ट्र).
