सपिंडीकरणं|सपिण्डीकरण|सपिण्डीकरणं
सपिंडीकरणं
1 The performance
of a particular Śrāddha in honour
of deceased relatives called सपिंड
q. v., to be performed at the end
of one full year after the death of
a relative, but now usually
performed on the 12th day after death
as part of the funeral obsequies.
--2 Giving a person the rights of a
Sapiṇḍa or kinsman.
