समर्थ्
समर्थ् {c10c} U.
1 To believe,
consider, regard, think; समर्थये
यत्प्रथमं प्रियां प्रति V. 4. 39; मया न
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1094-c" target="_blank">Page1094-c+ 57</a>]
साधु समर्थितं V. 2; अनुपयुक्तमिव
आत्मानं समर्थये Ś. 7, 3. 19.
--2 To
corroborate, support, substantiate
by proof; उक्तमेवार्थमुदाहरणेन
समर्थयति.
--3 To deliberate, think or
reflect about.
--4 To make ready,
prepare.
--5 To maintain, assert,
enforce.
--6 To imply, suggest.
--7
To approve.
