plenty, exuberance, abundance,
excess; तुषारवृष्टिक्षतपद्मसंपदां Ku. 5. 27;
R. 10. 59.
--7 Treasure.
--8 An
advantage, a benefit, blessing.
--9
Advancement in good qualities.
--10
Decoration.
--11 Right method.
--12
A necklace of pearls
