<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साधक|साधकः
साधक a. [साध्-ण्वुल्, सिध्-णिच् ण्वुल्
साधादेशः वा Tv.] (धका or धिका f.)
1 Accomplishing, fulfilling,
effecting, completing.
--2 Efficient,
effective; Ku. 3. 12.
--3
Skilful, adept.
--4 Effecting by
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1115-a" target="_blank">Page1115-a+ 57</a>]
magic, magical.
--5 Assisting, helping.
--कः A magician, one possessed of
supernatural powers, a yogin;
Māl. 5. 1.
--का N. of Durgā.
