[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1115-b" target="_blank">Page1115-b+ 57</a>]
having means, possession of means to
accomplish a desired object;
प्रतिकूलतामुपगते हि विधौ विफलत्वमेति
बहुसाधनता Śi. 9. 6.
--2 The state of
perfection.
