सु
सु {vI.v} {c1c} U. (सुवति-ते) To go, move.
{vII.v} {c1c} {c2c} P. (सवति, सौति) To
possess power or supremacy. {vIII.v} {5}
U. (सुनोति, सुनुते, सुत; the स् of सु is
changed to ष् after any preposition
ending in इ or उ)
1 To press out or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1126-a" target="_blank">Page1126-a+ 56</a>]
extract juice.
--2 To distil.
--3 To
pour out, sprinkle, make a libation.
--4 To perform a sacrifice, especially
the Soma sacrifice.
--5 To bathe.
--6
To churn. --Desid. (सुषूसति-ते) --WITH
उद् to excite, agitate.
--प्र to
produce, beget.
