[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1131-c" target="_blank">Page1131-c+ 56</a>]
a. ambrosial, flowing with nectar;
Bh. 2. 6.
--स्रवा uvula or soft palate.
--हरः an epithet of Garuḍa; see
गरुड.
