सूच्
सूच् {c10c} U. (सूचयति-ते, सूचित)
1
To pierce.
--2 To point out,
indicate, show, manifest, prove; त्वां
सूचयिष्यति तु माल्यसमुद्भ बोयं (गंधः)
Mk. 1. 35; Me. 21; Ś. 1. 14.
--3 To
betray, divulge, reveal; स जातु
सेव्यमानोऽपि गुप्तद्वारो न सूच्यते R. 17. 50.
--4
To hint, intimate, suggest.
--5 To
gesticulate, act, indicate by gestures
or signs; वामाक्षिस्पंदनं सूचयति,
रथवेगं सूचयति &c.
--6 To trace out,
spy, ascertain. --WITH अभि to
show, indicate^1; अमन्यत नलं प्राप्तं
कर्मचेष्टाभिसूचितं Mb.
[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar and Jim Funderburk on 20210104. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/20.
