सूचक|सूचकः
सूचक a. (चिका f.) [सूच्-ण्वुल्]
1
Indicative, indicating, proving,
showing.
--2 Betraying, informing.
--कः
1 A piercer.
--2 A needle,
any instrument for perforating or
sewing.
--3 An informer, a
talebearer, traducer, spy.
--4 A
narrator, teacher, an instructor.
--5 The
manager or chief actor of a
company.
--6 A Buddha.
--7 A Siddha.
--8 A villain, scoundrel.
--9 A
demon, goblin.
--10 A dog.
--11 A
crow.
--12 A cat.
--13 A kind of fine
rice.
--Comp.
--वाक्यं the information
given by an informer.
