सूतिः|सूति
सूतिः f. [सू-क्तिन्]
1 Birth,
production, parturition, delivery,
childbearing.
--2 Offspring, progeny.
--3
Source, fountain-head; तपसां
सूतिरसूतिरापदां Ki. 2. 56.
--4 A place
where Soma juice is extracted
--Comp.
--अशौचं impurity caused by
child-birth in a family (which lasts
for 10 days).
--गृहं the
lying-inchamber.
--मासः (also सूतीमासः) the
month of delivery, the last month
of pregnancy.
