--भवनं the lying-in-chamber.
--रोगः
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1134-c" target="_blank">Page1134-c+ 56</a>]
sickness subsequent to child-birth,
puerperal sickness.
--षष्ठी N. of a
particular goddess worshipped on
the sixth day after child-birth.
