सेवा
सेवा [सेव्-अ]
1 Service, servitude,
dependence; attendance; सेवां
लाघवकारिणीं कृतधियः स्थाने श्ववृत्तिं विदुः
Mu. 3. 14; हनिसेवा न कर्तव्या
H. 3. 11.
--2 Worship, homage,
honouring
--3 Addiction or devotion to,
fondness for.
--4 Use, practice,
employment, exercise.
--5 Frequenting,
resorting to.
--6 Flattery, coaxing
or flattering words; अलं सेवया
मध्यस्थतां गृहीत्वा भण M. 3.
--Comp.
--आकार a. in the form of servitude;
V. 3. 1.
--काकुः change of voice in
service; (this is a variant in
V. 3. 1 for सेवाकारा).
--धर्मः {1} the duty
of service; सेवाधर्मः परमगहनो
योगिनामप्यगम्यः Pt. 1. 285. {2} the
obligations of service.
--व्यवहारः the
practice or law of service.
