स्तनः|स्तन
स्तनः [स्तन्-अच्]
1 The female breast;
स्तनौ मांसग्रंथी कनककलशावित्युपोमतौ
Bh. 3. 20; (दरिद्राणां मनोरथाः)
हदयेष्वेव लीयंते विधवास्त्रीस्तनाविव
Pt. 2. 91.
--2 The nipple of the breast.
--3 The breast, udder, or dug of any
female animal; अर्धपीतस्तनं मातुरामर्दक्लि
ष्टकेशरं Ś. 7. 14.
--Comp.
--अंशुकं a
cloth covering the breasts or bosom,
breast mantle^1.
--अग्रः a nipple.
--अंगरागः
a paint or pigment smeared on the
breasts of women.
--अंतरं {1} the heart.
{2} the space between the breasts;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1144-a" target="_blank">Page1144-a+ 56</a>]
(न) मृणालसूत्रं रचितं रतनांतरे Ś. 6. 17,
R. 10. 62. {3} a mark on the breast
(said to indicate future widowhood).
--आभोगः {1} fulness or expanding
of the breasts. {2} the
circumference or orb of the breast. {3} a
man with large breasts like those of
a woman.
--तटः, --ष्टं the slope of the
breast; cf. तट.
--प, --पा, --पायक,
--पायिन् a. sucking the breast, a
suckling.
--पानं sucking of the breast.
--भरः {1} the weight or heaviness
of breasts; पादाग्रस्थितया मुहुः
स्तनभरेणानीतया नम्रतां Ratn. 1. 1. {2} a
man having breasts like those of
a woman.
--भवः a particular
position in sexual union.
--मुखं, --वृंतं
--शिखा a nipple.
[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar on 20210122. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/48.
