स्थानकं|स्थानक
स्थानकं [स्थान स्वार्थे क]
1 A
position, situation.
--2 A particular
point or situation in dramatic action;
e. g. पताकास्थानक q. v.
--3 A city,
town.
--4 A basin.
--5 Froth, a kind
of scum on spirits or wine.
--6 A
mode of recitation.
--7 A division
or section of the Taittirīya, a branch
of the Yajurveda.
