1
Any stationary or inanimate object
(such as clay, stones, trees &c.
which formed the seventh creation
of Brahman; cf. Ms. 1. 41); मान्यः
स मे स्थावरजंगमानां
सर्गस्थितिप्रत्यवहारहेतुः R. 2. 44; Ku. 6. 58.
--2 A
bow-string.
--3 immovable property,
real estate.
--4 A heir-loom.
