--अस्थावरं, --जंगमं {1} moveable and
immovable property. {2} animate
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1149-b" target="_blank">Page1149-b+ 57</a>]
and inanimate things.
--आत्मन् a.
of immovable form; Ku. 6. 67.
