स्नानं [स्ना-भावे ल्युट्]
1 Bathing,
washing, ablution, immersion in
water; ततः प्रविशति स्नानोत्तीर्णः
काश्यपः Ś. 4.
--2 Purification by bathing,
any religious or ceremonial ablution.
--3 The ceremony of bathing or
anointing an idol.
--4 Anything
used in ablution.
