स्मार्त|स्मार्तः|स्मार्त्त|स्मार्त्तं|स्मार्त्तः
स्मार्त a. [स्मृतौ विहितः, स्मृतिं
वेत्त्यधीते वा अण्]
1 Relating to memory.
remembered, memorial.
--2 Being
within memory.
--3 Based on or
recorded in a Smṛti, prescribed in
a code of laws; कर्म स्मार्तविवाहाग्नौ
कुर्वीत प्रत्यहं गृही Y. 1. 97; Ms. 1. 108.
--4 Legal.
--5 Following or
professing the law-books.
--6 Domestic
(as fire).
--र्तः
1 A Brāhmaṇa
well-versed in traditional law.
--2
One who follows the traditional
law.
--3 N. of a sect.
--र्तं An act
or rite enjoined by the Smṛti, a
legal act.
