--2 Pleasing, agreeable,
attractive, lovely, charming. --m.
1 Sweet flavour, sweetness of taste,
relish.
--2 Treacle, molasses. --n.
Sweetness, relish, taste; कविः करेति
काव्यानि स्वादु जानाति पंडितः Subhāṣ.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1162-b" target="_blank">Page1162-b+ 56</a>]
--दुः f. A grape.
