--अन्न
sweet or choice food, dainties,
delicacies.
--अम्लः the pomegranate
tree.
--खंडः {1} a piece of any sweet
substance. {2} molasses.
--धन्वन् m.
N. of the god of love.
--फलं the
jujube.
--(ला) the jujube tree.
--मूलं a carrot.
--रसा {1} the fruit of
the hog-plum. {2} the Śatāvarī
plant. {3} the root काकोली. {4}
spirituous liquor. {5} a grape.
--शुद्धं {1}
rock-salt. {2} marine-salt.
