हंहो
हंहो ind.
1 A vocative particle
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1164-b" target="_blank">Page1164-b+ 54</a>]
corresponding to, ‘ho,’ ‘hallo’;
हंहो चिन्मयचित्तचंद्रमणयः संवर्धयध्वं
रसान् Chandr. 1. 2.
--2 A particle
expressing haughtiness or contempt.
--3 A particle of interrogation. (In
dramas it is mostly used as a form
of address by characters of the
middling class; हंहो बाह्मण मा कुष्य
Mu. 1).
