हठ्
हठ् {c1c} P. (हठति)
1 To leap,
jump.
--2 To be wicked.
--3 To
oppress.
--4 To bind to a post.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
