हंडा|हण्डा
हंडा ind. A vocative particle
used in addressing a female
of inferior rank, or by equals of the
lowest^1 caste in addressing each
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1164-c" target="_blank">Page1164-c+ 56</a>]
other; हंडे हंजे हलाह्वाने नीचां चेटीं सखीं
प्रति Ak. --f. A large earthen
vessel (?).
[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar on 20210122. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/48.
