हस्तिनी
हस्तिनी
1 A female elephant.
--2
A kind of drug and perfume.
--3 A
woman of a particular class, one of
the four classes into which writers
on erotical science divide women
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1169-b" target="_blank">Page1169-b+ 56</a>]
(described as having thick lips,
thick hips, thick fingers, large
breasts, dark complexion, and
libidinous appetite); the
Ratimañjarī thus describes her:
--स्थूलाधरा
स्थूलनितंबबिंबा स्थूलांगुलिः स्थूलकुचा सुशीला ।
कामोत्सुका गाढरतिप्रिया च नितांतभोक्त्री
(नितंबखर्वा) खलु हस्तिनी स्यात् (करिणी
मता सा) {8}
