1
Pleased, delighted, glad, happy, rejoiced,
enraptured.
--2 Thrilled; having the
hair bristling.
--3 Astonished.
--4
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1175-a" target="_blank">Page1175-a+ 56</a>]
Bent, bowed.
--5 Disappointed.
--6
Fresh.
--7 Armed, accoutred.
