--अंग a. golden; Mu. 2. 10
v. {1}
--(गः) {1} Garuḍa. {2} a lion.
{3} the mountain Sumeru. {4} N.
of Brahman. {5} of Viṣṇu. {6}
the Campaka tree.
--अंगदं a
goldbracelet.
